<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Pogoro Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kula</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu ashi sha Kulawa shendeleza histoliya ya kaya ya Abrahamu ya kwanja na Lyanjiru. Mana ya shisoweru kulawa “(Kulawira)” Patuwuya muisi ya Israeli kulawira mumisri, kuwuya muisi yakalongiti Mlungu kwa Abrahamu. Shiutamaduni, wafunda wajimira shitabu sha kulawa shilembitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu Musa hatuviwoni muvipandi vyavilisyaguliti vyeni. Kulawa 24: 4 Shilonga ntambu gaa Musa kalembiti pasi pa shipandi sha shitabu. Mujoshuwa 8:31 hayiweri lagiru muliyanjiru 20:25 na shilongiti handa shilembitwi mushitabu sha lagiru lya Musa mulipatanu lya syayi litakulira shitabu shilembitwi na Musa shaka shoseri, kwa mfanu shaka tuyoweleriti kuwera shilawiriti shishi mkulunguziya ndundu ama shidowi, walonga shilembitwi mshitabu sha Musa Marko 12:26 Kuwala kwa Waisraeli kulawa Misri kuweriti shipindi sha vinja 1300 ama 1400 B.C 1 Wafalumi 6:1 shilonga Kulawa shitoliti vinja 480 pamberi pa vinja 4 vinja vya Sulemani kuwera mfalumi gwa Israeli. Kulawa shitakulira ntambu gaa Mlungu katuliti lipatanu kwa Abrahamu Isaka na Yakobu. Shiyowelera kuusu Mlungu kana likakala hakautekeleri wiwuka wa Abrahamu, muisi ya Israeli Kulawa mulitapaka lya Misri (Kulawa 1-12) kulawa panu Mlungu kawalonguziya wantu wakuyi mumigongu ya Sinayi peni kampananiti Musa Lagiru kwa Waisraeli wagafati (Kulawa 12-19. Lagiru ali yagawera amu ntambu gaa yagatenda na ntambu yakulaviya tambiku na ntambu ya kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu yeni ndo seemu ya kumguwira Mlungu mulisandiku lya Lipatanu na vintu vimonga vya kuguwira munumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu asa nguwu Kulawa 20-31. Shakapanu pa likabila linkondu linyawiti shinyagu sha zahabu mfanu gwa mwana gwa ng'ombi Musa kaliwoniti kayi na Mlungu Kulawa 32-33. Mushipandi sha upeleru sha shitabu tubetuliti handa vintu gaa vya kwanja vyakufata Kulawa 33-40.</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 1 shitakulira ntambu gaa Waisraeli waweriti wamanda muisi ya Misri.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 2-4 shimyowelera Musa na shiyowelera kulikala kwakuyi mpaka shaka Mlungu pakawashemiti wantu wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu shilembiti na kuyowelera ntambu gaa Mlungu kalaviya makakala gakuyi na kuyikomanga Misri su kuwalaviya wantu kulawa muisi ya wamashonta wa Farao.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi 5-15:21 4 Kulawa kuisi ya Waisraeli kugenda lugongu lwa Sinayi shipandi sha 15-22:19.</para>
  <para style="io">Mushipandi 20-31 hambetuli ntambu gaa Mlungu kampananiti Musa lagiru lyeni lilaviya visoweru vya Mlungu kwa wantu wakuyi Israeli wawezi kulikala pamuhera na kumguwira.</para>
  <para style="io">Mushipandi sha 32 shilembitwi ntambu gaa wantu yawawera ndiri Waisraeli wamlemiti Mlungu wamfiriti kaka gwawu Musa mweni wamshemiti Aruni kanyawi shinyagu sha zahabu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 33-40 shilonga ntambu gaa Musa kawona ukwisa wa Mlungu na shakapanu kananitwi mlonguziwu kuusu Lagiru lya Mlungu na ntambu gaa ya kunyawa numba nkulu ya Mlungu, numba ya Mlungu na vintu vyamonga kwajili ya kumguwira mnamba ya Mlungu na nguwu za gweka za watambika.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankutabisiwa muisi ya Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Aga ndo matawu ga wana wapalu wa Yakobu yawagenditi Misri pamuhera na tati gwawu, pawawera na wadala wawu pamuhera na wana wawu. <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Womberi waweriti Rubeni na Simiyoni na Lawi na Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakari na Zabuloni na Benjamini, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dani na Nafutali na Gadi na Asheri. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Wantu woseri yawagenditi pamuhera na Yakobu, waweriti wantu malongu saba. Womberi waweriti wana wakuyi na wazukulu wakuyi pamuhera na wana wawili wa wazukulu wakuyi. Yusufu kaweriti kala muisi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Mivinja yaifatiti, Yusufu pamuhera na walongu wakuyi woseri na kila muntu mukaya yawu yakalikaliti mushiyiwuku mushaka shilii, wahowiti. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Kumbiti shiyiwuku sha Yakobu shyendereyiti kwiyula wana wavuwa. Mawalanga ga shiyiwuku shyongerikiti nentu. Malawaliranu gakuyi, womberi waweriti wavuwa na waweriti na makakala na waweriti kila pahala muisi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Pa mivinja yamonga ivuwa shakapanu, mfalumi gwa syayi kanjiti kukolamlima muisi ya Misri. Yomberi kashimaniti ndiri shilii Yusufu shakatenditi kwa wantu wa Misri pamakashu. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Mfalumi kawagambiriti wantu wakuyi, “Mloli shashilawiriti! Wantu wa Israeli wendereya kuwera wavuwa nentu na kuwera na makakala kuliku twenga na vinu wawera hatari kwa twenga. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Su tusakuli ntambu ya kuwakolamlima! Patutenda ndiri hangu, walanga yawu hayendereyi kwongoreka nentu. Shakapanu wangondu pawatwizira kutukomanga, womberi hawalikolerani pamuhera na wangondu wetu kutukoma na hawashapiri kulawa muisi yetu.”<verse eid="EXO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Su mfalumi pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi watuliti wantu wa kuwagolokera wantu wa Israeli na kuwatenda womberi watabiki nentu kwa kutenda womberi watendi lihengu likamala. Womberi wawatenditi kwa makakala wantu wa Israeli kunyawa lushi mbili, lushi lwa Pitimu pamuhera na lushi lwa Ramesesi, lushi azi ziweriti kwajili ya Falawu mfalumi gwa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Kumbiti ntambu yawawatenderiti madoda wantu wa Israeli, wantu wa Israeli wendereyiti kwongereka nentu na kweneya muisi ilii. Su wantu wa Misri wanjiti kuwatira wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Womberi wawatenditi kwa makakala wantu wa Israeli watendi lihengu likamala nentu, <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />wawatenditi womberi waweri wamanda, wawatenditi womberi makaliru gawu gaweri ga hinginiku. Wawatenditi kwa makakala kunyawa numba zivuwa kwa matafali. Viraa wawatenditi womberi watendi mahengu mumarambu. Wawatenditi womberi kutenda lihengu lyoseri, wakulu wa wantu wa Misri wawagolokeriti womberi kwa kuwatabisiya.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Kuweriti na wadala wamakolu wawili wa Shiebrania. Yumu kashemwa Shifira na yumonga kashemwa Puwa. Falawu kawagambiriti wadala walii, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />“Pamuwatanga wadala wa Shiebrania kwiyura wana, pawiyura wana wapalu muwalagi. Handa pawiyura wana wadala muwaleki walikali.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Kumbiti wamakolu walii waweriti wantu yawamguwira Mlungu. Su womberi watenditi ndiri shilii shawagambirituwi na Falawu. Womberi wawalekiti wana wapalu walikali. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Su Falawu kawashema wamakolu wawili walii, kawakosiya, “Iwera hashi mtenda hangu? Kwa ntambu gaa muwaleka wana wapalu walikali?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Yumu gwa wamakolu walii kamwankula Farao, “Gufiruwa kuvimana kuwera wadala wa Shiebrania wawafira ndiri wadala wa Shimisri. Wadala wa Shiebrania wawera na nshimba zyaziwera na makakala. Womberi wiyula wana pamberi twenga kusoka kuwatanga.”<verse eid="EXO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Su Mlungu kawapananiti maheri wamakolu walii, wantu wa Israeli wendereyiti kwongereka nentu na kuwera na makakala. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Su toziya ya wamakolu awa yawamguwiriti Mlungu, Mlungu kawapananiti womberi viraa kaya zawu weni.<verse eid="EXO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Shakapanu Falawu kawalagalira wantu woseri wa Misri, “Mumwasi mulushemba lwa Naili, kila mwana mpalu yakawiyuriruwa kulawa kwa mdala gwa Shiebrania! Kumbiti muweza kumleka mkomu mwana mdala.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwiuka kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu yakalawi mushiyiwuku sha Lawi mwana gwa Yakubu. Yomberi kamyugiti mdala viraa gwa shiyiwuku sha Lawi. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Su mdala ayu kapatiti yinda, kawuyiriti mwana mpalu. Yomberi pakawoniti kuwera mwana ayu kaherepa nentu, kamfifiti kwa myezi mitatu, toziya kafiliti ndiri kutenda shilii shakalagaliriti Falawu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Pakasinditi kwendeleya kumfifa, yomberi kanyawiti lijamanda lyakatyeremekiti lami su nalipeniziya mashi. Shakapanu kamtuliti mwana mulijamanda pakati pantundu za kumbwega kwa lushemba lwa Naili. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Dada gwakuyi kagolokiti pakwegera pakalola yashifira kumlawira. <verse eid="EXO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Su muhinja gwa Falawu kasuluka kugenda kulushemba kwoga mashi. Yomberi kawoniti lijamanda lyamuntundu mumbwega mwa lushemba. Su kamtumiti yaya yumu kagendi kulitola lijamanda lilii.<verse eid="EXO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Su yaya ulii pakamjegeriti lijamanda lilii, yomberi kaligubutula, kalikangashiti pakamwoniti mwana kankulira. Muhinga ulii kamwoneriti lusungu, kalongiti, “Ayu kawera yumu gwa wana wa Waeburaniya.” <verse eid="EXO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Shakapanu Dada gwa mwana uli kamwizira mhinja gwa Farao kamgambira, “Hashi gufira nukusakuliri yumu pakati pa wadala wa Shiebrania kakuleleri mwana ayu?” <verse eid="EXO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Muhinja gwa Falawu kamgambira, “Yina; gugendi kansakuliri,” hangu kagenda, kamshema mawu gwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Muhinja gwa Falawu kamgambira, “Gumtoli mwana ayu, guneleri, naneni hanukulipi shibena mgongu shaku.” Mdala ayu kamtola mwana kamnoneziya. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Mwana pakaweriti mkulu, mawu gwakuyi kamjegiti kwa muhinja gwa Falawu, nayomberi kamtola na kumtenda mwana gwakuyi. Muhinja gwa Falawu kampanana litawu Musa, litawu lilifana na shisoweru sha Shiebrania numjabula, Kalongiti “Toziya numlaviya mumashi.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankutugira kugenda Midiyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Lishaka limu, Musa pakaweriti mkulu, kalawiti mnumba nkulu ya shifalumi kugenda kuwalola wantu wayaguwi wa Shyeburania. Yomberi kawawoniti womberi ntambu yawatendituwi kwa makakala kutenda lihengu likamala nentu. Viraa yomberi kawoniti muntu gwa Misri pakamkoma yumu gwa Mweburaniya muyaguwi. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Musa kalola wega zoseri, na pakawoniti kwahera muntu, kamlaga Mmisri na kamkululira mumhanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Shirawu yakuwi, Musa kawuya palapalii. Kalikangasha kawona Waebraniya wawili wankulikomanga. Kamgambira yakanjiti ndewu,“Kwa shishi gwankumkoma Mwebraniya myagu?” <verse eid="EXO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Nayomberi kamwankula, “Gaa kakutula guweri mtoza gwetu?” Gwahera ukulu wa kutukamlira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:14">Su Musa katiriti na toziya kaliholiti “Kumbiti muntu ayu kavimana shantenditi nakaka wantu wamonga hawavimani!”<verse eid="EXO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Na ali liweriti nakaka Falawu kapikaniriti shakamtendiriti Mmisri ulii, kaamulu wanjagira wakuyi wamlagi Musa. Kumbiti Musa kamtira Falawu kawuka Misri, kagenditi kwagulawa mshenji mpaka seemu ya Midiyani kanja kulikala aku. Lishaka limu, Musa kaweriti kalivaga pambeku pa linegu lya mashi.<verse eid="EXO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Muntu yakaweriti mtambika kwajili ya Wamidiyani mweni litawu lyakuyi wamshemiti Yesulo kaweriti na wahinja saba. Lishaka limu Musa pakaweriti kalikaliti kumbeku kulinegu, wahinja waliii wiziti kuteka mashi kulinogu. Wamemiziiti vulu zawu mashi su wanji kuwalandisiya mashi kondolu wa tati gwawu. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Walolera wamonga wiziti na kwanja kuwawinga wahinja walii. Kumbiti Musa kawatangatira wahinja walii na kuwalandisiya mashi kondolu. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Pawawuyiti kwa tati gwawu Yesulo mweni litawu lyakuyi limonga Reuli, yomberi kawakosiyiti, “Mbona leru muwuya kalongola?” <verse eid="EXO 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Nawomberi wamwankula, “Mmisri yumu katulopoziya mumawoku mwa walolira, kayi yomberi katutekara mashi kulawa kulinegu na kuwalandiziya kondolu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Tati gwawu kawakosiya wahinja wakuyi, “Kaa koshi? Ntambu gaa mumleka haku? Mumshemeri kizi kaliyi shiboga.” <verse eid="EXO 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Watenda hangu Musa kajimira kuliya na womberi na kulikala nawu. Shakapanu Yesulo kampanananiti Zipora kaweri mdala gwakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Zipora kamwiwulira mwana mpalu, kamshema Gerishomu, Shiebrania lyana mana mhenga toziya kalongiti, “Nilikala handa muhenga muisi ayi.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Vinja vivuwa shakapanu, mfalumi gwa Misri kahowa. Waisraeli Mumisri waweriti wankutabika nentu toziya ya lihengu likamala lyawafiruwitwi kutenda handa wamanda, walira kuluwa utanga Mlungu kakupikiniriti kulira kwawu. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Mlungu kapikaniriti kulira kwawu, kalihola lipatanu lyakuyi lyakalitenditi na Ibrahimu na Isaka na Yakobu lya kuwatekelera wiuka wawu. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Mlungu kawona Waisraeli ntambu yawatenderitwi madoda, kawaholera.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumlawira Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Lishaka limu, Musa kaweriti kankulolera wakondolu wa mganafu gwakuyi Yetiru, mtambika gwa wantu wa Midiyani. Yomberi kashilongoziti shipinga sha wakondolu kushiwala na kwingira Horebu, lugongu lulii shakapanu lushemituwi Sinayi, lugongu lwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Kulii, Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti yomberi pakalifana gambira ntumintumi gwa kumpindi. Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kalawiriti gambira limbamba lya motu mushiputira shashiyaka motu. Musa kashiloliti, kumbiti yomberi kalikangashiti kuwera shiputira shirunguliti ndiri. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Musa kalongiti, “Hansegeleri pakwegera moni likangashu ali! Hashi, shiputira ashi shankuyaka kumbiti shilungulira ndiri?”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawoniti kuwera yomberi kankusegelera, su kamshema Musa kulawa pakati pa shiputira shilii, kalongiti, “Musa! Musa!” Musa kawankula “Naam, napanu!” <verse eid="EXO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, “Nagwiza pakwegera! Toziya neni ndo Mlungu, isi yaguigoloka yananagala. Su guvuli vilwatu vyaku kulanguziya ligoya kwaneni.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Kalongiti, “Neni Mlungu, ulii wambuyi waku Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu wanguwiriti.” Su Musa kagubika sheni shakuwi, toziya katiriti kumlola Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, “Mona ntambu yawawatenderuwa vidoda wantu wangu muisi ya Misri. Nuwapikanira pawalira kuluwa utanga toziya ya wagolokera wawu ntambu yawawatabisiya mukutenda lihengu. Nivimana wantu wangu ntambu yawatabika. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />Su neni nsuluka kulawa kumpindi kuwalopoziya womberi kulawa kwa wantu wa Misri. Niza kuwalaviya womberi muisi ayi su wagendi muisi ya Kanaani. Hanuwajegi muisi nkulu na iherepa yaiwera na fasi nkulu. Hayiweri iherepa kulolerwa mifugu na kulima. Isi yeni wiwuka wa Kanaani na Hiti na Amori na Perizi na Hivi na Yebusi wankulikala. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Nakaka vinu nuwapikanira wantu wangu wa Israeli pawalira. Mona wantu wa Misri ntambu yawawatabisiya. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Su guwuyi muisi ya Misri. Nukulagalira gugendi kwa Falawu, yomberi kaweza kukuleka gwenga guwatoli wantu wangu, wantu wa Israeli kulawa muisi ya Misri.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Kumbiti Musa kamwankula Mlungu, “Neni weza ndiri! Hapeni wezi kugenda kwa Falawu, kumluwa kandekeziyi kuwatola wantu wa Israeli kulawa muisi ya Misri!” <verse eid="EXO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Mlungu kamgambira, “Neni haweri pamuhera nagwenga. Paguwalaviya wantu wangu kulawa muisi ya Misri, mwawoseri mwenga hamunguwiri mulugongu alu. Ayilanguziyi kuwera neni ndo ulii yakakutumiti gwenga kwa womberi.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Musa kamgambiriti Mlungu, “Pang'enda kwa wantu wa Israeli na kuwagambira, Mlungu, ulii wambuyi wenu wamguwiriti, kantuma nizi kwa mwenga, womberi hawankosiyi, litawu lyakuyi gaa? Hanuwagambiri shishi?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Mlungu kamwankula Musa, “NENI NDO YAWERA. Guwagambiri hangu wantu wa Israeli, ulii yawamshema. NENI NDO YAWERA. Kantuma kwa mwenga.<verse eid="EXO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Mlungu viraa kamgambiriti Musa, guwambiri wantu wa Israeli, Mtuwa Mlungu yawamguwiriti wambuyi wenu, Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu, yomberi kantuma kwa mwenga. Litawu ali Mtuwa Mlungu, haliweri litawu lyangu mashaka goseri. Litawu ali shiyiwuku shoseri shashizaku, hawalitenderi pawayowera kuusu neni. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Gugendi muisi ya Misri, guwajojoniri pamuhera wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli na guwagambiri,Mtuwa Mlungu kandawiriti, Mlungu ulii yakaguwirituwi na wambuyi wenu Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu. Yomberi kang'ambiriti, mona wantu wa Misri ntambu yawatenditi kwa mwenga. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Neni ntakula lagiru kuwera hanuwalopoziyi mwenga kulawa mumagaziwu muisi ya Misri, na hanuwajegi kugenda muisi ya kwawalikaliti wantu wa Kanaani na Hiti na Amori na Perizi na Hivi na Yebusi. Isi iherepa kufugila mifugu na kulima.”<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Wantu wangu hawatendi shagutakula, su gwenga pamuhera na wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli hamgendi kwa Falawu, hamumgambiri yomberi, Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii Mlungu gwa Waeburaniya yawamguwira, yomberi kaligubutula mweni kwa twenga. Su vinu tukuluwa, gutulekeziyi tugendi mwanja gwa mashaka matatu kushiwala, su kulii hatuwezi kulaviya malaviwu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu. <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Kumbiti nivimana kuwera Falawu hakawalekeziyi mwenga kuwuka handa pakavimana kuwera nana makakala makulu kuliku galii gakawera naga. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Su hantenderi makakala gangu kuwasyatanga wantu wa Misri kwa kutenda mawuzawuza gavuwa ga kutiliziya kulii. Shakapanu yomberi hakawalekeziyi mwenga kuwuka.”<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Aga pagalawira, hanuwatendi wantu wa Misri wawapanani ligoya. Malawiranu gakuyi hagaweri kuwera pamuwuka muisi ya Misri, womberi hawawapanani mwenga vintu vivuwa muwuki navi. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Mushaka ashi, kila mdala muwantu wa Israeli hakamluwi gwapakwegera gwakuyi kwa wantu wa Misri na kila mdala gwa Shimisri yakalikala mnumba yakuwi kampanani madini ga feza na vintu vya zahabu na nguwu ziherepa. Yomberi hakawapanani womberi na haguwavalisiyi wananguta waku wapalu na wadala kuwuka navi.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumpanana Musa uwezu wa kutenda mawuzawuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Musa kawankula, “Hayiweri hashi wantu wa Israeli pawanjimira ndiri ama kutenda shanuwagambira? Hayiweri hashi pawalonga, Mtuwa Mlungu kakulawira ndiri.” <verse eid="EXO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Guloli shintu shagukola uliwoku lyaku. Gukola shishi? Yomberi kawankula, luhonga lwa kutyangira.” <verse eid="EXO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gulwasi pasi!” Su Musa kalwasa pasi, luhonga lugalambuka kuwera njoka! Musa kasintuka kwa kumtira njoka. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, “Gulitalipisiyi liwoku lyaku, gumkoli mshira gwakuyi!” Su yomberi kalitalapisiya liwoku lyakuyi, kamkamuliti njoka ulii na njoka kagalambuka kawera luhonga kayi.<verse eid="EXO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira, “Gutendi ntambu iraa ayi kulongolu kwa wantu wa Israeli. Su womberi waweza kujimira kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu ulii gwa wambuyi waku Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu yawamguwiriti, nakaka kakulawiriti.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Mtuwa kamgambiriti kayi Musa, “Gutuli liwoku lyaku munguwu mkati pashifuwa shaku!” Yomberi katenditi, kumbiti pakalilaviyiti, yomberi kalikangashiti, liwoku lyakuyi liweriti lifufu. Liweriti na ulweri wa lukuli lya nshimba wautenditwi kuwera ufufu mbuu. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Shakapanu Mlungu kalonga, “Gutuli kayi liwoku lyaku munguwu mkati pashifuwa paku!” Musa kalituliti, pakalilaviyiti kayi kalikangasha liweriti gambira kwanja kwa ntambu yakuwi munshimba. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Mlungu kamgambira Musa, “Guweza kutenda hangu viraa kulongolu kwa wantu wa Israeli. Handa pawajimira ndiri shagutakula toziya wawona liwuzawuza lya kwanja, womberi hawajimiri pagutenda liwuzawuza lya pili. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Handa pawajimira ndiri ama pawatenda ndiri shagutakula, ata pagutenda kala mawuzawuza mawili aga, guteki mashi kulawa lushemba lwa Naili na gwiti pasi. Pagutenda hangu, mashi yagwititi pasi hagagalambuki kuwera mwazi.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Musa kamwankula, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, naguntuma neni. Neni nana shibaba! Neni weza ndiri kuwankula kwanjira makashu na panu paguyowera na neni! Neni weza ndiri kutakula weri, neni weza kutakula mpolimpoli ng'anji.” <verse eid="EXO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti yomberi, “Ilanguziya gulyaluwa gaa yakawatenditi wantu wawezi kutakula! Hashi, gaa yakamtenda muntu kawezi ndiri kutakula ama kupikanira ama kuwona? Ndo neni Mtuwa Mlungu! <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Su gwanji gugenda muisi Misri, neni hanukutangi gutakuli na hanukugambiri shagufiruwa kutakula.” <verse eid="EXO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Kumbiti yomberi kawankula, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, shondi shondi, gumtumi muntu yumonga pa neni!”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamkalariti nentu Musa. Kamgambiriti, “Hashi, gwahera mlongu gwaku Aruni gwa shiyiwuku sha Lawi viraa? Nivimana kuwera yomberi kaweza kutakula weri. Yomberi kamunjira kwiza, vinu hakanemeleri nentu kuliwona na gwenga. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Haguyoweri na yomberi na kumgambira shilii shaguakula, neni hanuwatangi woseri kuvimana shilii sha kutakula. Hanuwagambiri woseri shitwatira sha kutenda. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Aruni hakakutakuliri kwa wantu wa Israeli, yomberi hakaweri mtakula gwaku na gwenga haguweri mfanu gwa Mlungu kwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Naguleka kutola luhonga alu lwa kutyangira mumawoku mwaku, toziya hagulutenderi mawuzawuza.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwuya muisi ya Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Musa kawuyiti kwa Yetiru mganafu gwakuyi, kamgambiriti yomberi, “Shondi shondi, gundekeziyi mbuyi muisi ya Misri, kuwawona walongu wangu wantu wa Israeli kulii. Nfira kuvimana handa wankali wakomu.” Yetiru kamgambiriti Musa, “Gugendi, Mlungu kakupanani ponga ya mumoyu.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa pamberi pa kuwuka Midiyani, “Haguwezi kuwuya nyanyi muisi ya Misri toziya wantu yawahepiriti kukulaga vinu wahowa kala.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Su Musa kamtola mdala gwakuyi pamuhera na wananguta wakuyi, kawakweniziya pa punda, wawuyiti kugenda muisi ya Misri. Na Musa kalutoliti muliwoku lwakuyi luhonga Mlungu lyakamgambiriti kalutoli.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Paguwuya muisi ya Misri, guweri na unakaka kutenda mawuzawuza goseri kuwera nikupanana makakala ga kutenda, uganu Falawu pakalola. Kumbiti neni hanimtendi kaweri mtiti, malawiranu gakuyi hakalemi kuwalekeziya wantu wa Israeli wawuki kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Shakapanu gumgambiri Falawu, hangu ndo ntambu yakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu, wantu wa Israeli nuwafira nentu gambira wana shipanta njira. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nukugambiriti guwalekeziyi wantu wangu kuwuka muisi ya Misri, su womberi wawezi kunguwira neni kushiwala. Handa pagulema kuwalekeziya, nukuberiziya hanimlagi mwana shipanta njira gwaku.”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zipora kamwingiziya jandu mwana gwakuyi mpalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Pashiru pamu pawaweriti wagonjera mwanja kugenda muisi ya Misri, Mtuwa Mlungu kamlawiriti Musa. Kafiliti kumlaga Musa toziya kajimiriti ndiri lagaliru lyakuyi lya kuwingiziya jandu wana wapalu. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Su Zipola katoliti libuwi likola, kamwingiyiti jandu mwana gwakuyi. Shakapanu kashinkula magulu ga mwana gwakuyi kwa shipandi sha lukuli shakashilikuliti, yomberi kalongiti, “Kupitira kwingiziwa jandu, gwenga guwera mpalu gwangu nakaka.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Zipora kamgambiriti Musa, “Vinu gwa nyanyi toziya gwingiziwa jandu.” Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenduwa ndiri mwana gwakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Aruni, “Gugendi kushiwala gwakaliwoni na Musa.” Su yomberi kagenditi aku kulawa muisi ya Misri na kaliwoniti na Musa kulii Sinayi, kulugongu lwa Mlungu, kamlamsiya kwa kumkisikira. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Musa kamgambiriti Aruni kila shintu shakagambirituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu kuwuya muisi ya Misri. Viraa kamgambiriti Aruni goseri kuusu mawuzawuza Mtuwa Mlungu gakamgambiriti kugatenda.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Shakapanu Musa na Aruni wawuyiti kugenda muisi ya Misri. Kulii wawajojoniriti wakulu woseri wa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Aruni kawagambiriti visoweru vyoseri Mtuwa Mlungu vyakamlagaliriti Musa, Musa katenditi mawuzawuza goseri kulongolu kwa wantu uganu pawalola. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Womberi wajimiriti kuwera shilii shawatakuliti shanakaka. Womberi pawapikaniriti kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kawona wantu wa Israeli ntambu yawatabisiwa nentu, su kankugenda kuwatanga, womberi wasuntamiti makukama na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Musa na Aruni wapalongolu pa Falawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Shakapanu Musa na Aruni wamgendiriti Falawu, na yumu gwawu kamgambiriti, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli kankulonga hangu, guwaleki wantu wangu wagendi kushiwala, wantenderi msambu.” <verse eid="EXO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Kumbiti Falawu kawakosiya, hashi, “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo gaa?” Mpaka neni numpikaniri na kuwaleka Waisraeli wagendi? “Neni numumana ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu! Na hapeni nuwalekeri Waisraeli wagendi.” <verse eid="EXO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Musa na Aruni wamwankuliti, “Mlungu gwa Waeburaniya yawamguwira kaligubutuliti kwa twenga na kutugambira twizi tukugambiri gwenga. Su tukuluwa shondi shondi gutuleki tugendi kushiwala mwanja gwa mashaka matatu. Tufiruwa twakamlaviliri tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu kulii. Handa patutenda ndiri hangu, Mlungu hakatutendi twenga tuhowi kwa malweli ama kuvamiwa na wangondu wetu.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Misri kawankula, “Mwenga Musa na Aruni, iwera hashi mwankuwalewela wantu nawatenda mahengu? Muwagambiri wamanda walii wawuyi mumahengu!” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Falawu kalonga kayi, “Mumpikaniri! Mwenga wantu yamulikala panu mwawavuwa kuliku twenga wantu wa Misri. Su vinu mwenga mfira kuwatenda womberi waleki kutenda mahengu na kwoyera?”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wankufyatura matafali pota na mahamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Lishaka liraa lilii Falawu kalagaliriti wagolokera wa Misri pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli yawawagolokera wayawu, kalonga, <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Kwanjira leru namuwapanana wantu awa wa Israeli mahamba ga kufyatulira matafali ntambu yaiwera. Wawu weni hawagendi mumalambu kulisakulira mahamba. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Kumbiti walanga ya matafali gawafyaturiwuwa kila lishaka iweri ntambu iraa gambira kwanja, nampungura ata limu. Womberi wahera mahengu gavuwa ga kutenda. Ndo mana womberi wanduwa nuwalekiziyi wagendi kushiwala kumlavilira tambiku mlungu gwawu. <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Muwawongeri wantu awa lihengu likamala, su womberi hapeni waweri na shaka sha kupikanira upayira wa wakulu wawu!”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Su wakulu wa wamanda na wagolokela wa wamanda wagenditi kwawaweriti wantu wa Israeli na kuwagambira, “Mfalumi gwa Misri kalonga kuwera hapeni mpananuwi kayi mahamba. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Mgendi maweni mwakasakuli mahamba poseri pamuweza kugapata. Kumbiti mfiruwa kufyatura matafali galaa galii gamfyaturiti kwanja.” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Su wantu woseri wa Israeli wagenditi muisi yoseri ya Misri kusakula mahamba ga kufyatulira matafali. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Wakulu wa wamanda wawagambiriti womberi pawasintikira, “Mumalili lihengu lyenu lyanfiruwa kumalila kila lishaka, mfyaturi walanga ilaa ilii ya matafali gamfyaturiti pamberi pampananituwi mahamba!” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Wantu wa Israeli pawasinditi kumalila mahengu galii, wakulu wa wamanda wawasyantangiti ntomondu wantu wa Israeli yawawagolokera wayawu na wawakosiyiti, “Iwera hashi wantu woseri yamuwagolokera, wafyatura ndiri matafali leru gambira kwanja ntambu yamtenditi?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Shakapanu wantu wa Israeli yawawagolokera wayawu, wagenditi kwa Falawu na kuhinginika pawalonga, “Iwera hashi gwankututendera hangu twenga wantumintumi waku? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Vinu womberi watupanana ndiri mahamba ga kufyatura matafali, kumbiti watulazimisha kufyatula matafali. Na vinu mushaka shamonga watusyatanga ntomondu. Kumbiti likosa ali lya wakulu waku wa wamanda, yawatutenditi tusindi kufyatula matafali gambira kwanja.” <verse eid="EXO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Kumbiti Falawu kalongiti, “Mwenga mwawalegilegi na mfira ndiri kutenda lihengu! Ndo mana mwenga mlonga, Tuleki tugendi kushiwala twakamlaviliri tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Su mgendi mwakatendi lihengu, toziya twenga hapeni tuwapanani mahamba kumbiti hamfyaturi walanga ya matafali galaa galii gamfyaturiti pamberi.” <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Su wantu walii yawawagolokera wantu wa Israeli wayawu, vinu wayambuliti kuwera wawera muntabika, toziya womberi wagambirituwi, hapeni tupunguli walanga ya matafali yamfiruwa kugafyatura kila lishaka.<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Womberi pawawukiti mnumba nkulu ya mfalumi, waliwoniti na Aruni pamuhera na Musa yawaweriti wankuwahepera. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Su womberi wawagambiriti Aruni pamuhera na Musa, “Mtuwa Mlungu kashiwoni shitwatira ashi na kuwatoza mwenga wawili ntambu yamtenditi! Mlungu hakawazibu mwenga toziya mwenga mumtenda Falawu pamuhera na wakulu wakuyi watukalaliri twenga! Mwenga muwapanana toziya ya kutulaga twenga!”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankumlilira Mlungu kawatangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Shakapanu Musa kawalekiti womberi na kugenda kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu kayi pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, iwera hashi gulekiziya ukondora woseri awu ulawili kwa wantu waku? Iwera hashi guntumiti neni nizi panu? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Kwanjira pang'enditi kwa Falawu kumgambira shilii shagung'ambiriti ntakuli, yomberi kankuwatendera ukatili wantu waku na gwenga gutenda ndiri shintu shoseri kuwatanga wantu waku!”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankulagila kuwalopoziya wantu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula Musa, “Vinu haguwoni shilii shang'enda kushitenda kwa Falawu pamuhera na wantu wakuyi. Kwa makakala hakalazimiki kuwaleka wantu wangu wawuki. Kwa makakala hakawawingi wawuki muisi yakuwi”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Viraa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, “Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Neni ndo ulii yakawalawiriti Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu, niwagambiriti womberi kuwera neni ndo Mlungu yawera na Makakala, kumbiti niwagambiriti ndiri womberi kuwera litawu lyangu, Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Kayi ntenditi lipatanu nawomberi panuwalagiliti kuwapanana isi ya Kanaani, yawalikaliti gambira wahenga. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Mnu ga aga, mpikanira kulila kwa wantu wa Israeli toziya watendituwi kwa makakala na wantu wa Misri kutenda mahengu ga umanda, su niliholiti lipatanu lyangu. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Su guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli kuwera neni ntakula hangu, neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu! Hanuwalaviyi mwenga kulawa muvisanka vya kutenda mahengu gakamala galii gampananituwi na wantu wa Misri. Hanuwatendi muweri walekeru kulawa muumanda wawu. Kwa makakala gangu makulu na kuwaazibu womberi kwa ukaripa, hanuwakomboli. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Hanuwatendi mwenga muweri wantu wangu, na neni haweri Mlungu gwenu, Mlungu ulii yamumguwira. Mwenga hamuvimani nakaka kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu, neni ndo ulii yamuwalopoziyiti kulawa muvisanka vya mahengu ga umanda ga wantu wa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Na neni hanuwajegi muisi yanuwalagiliti kuwapanana Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu. Haniwapanani isi ayi muhali mashaka goseri. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu yandagila aga.’”<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Musa kawagambiriti aga wantu wa Israeli, kumbiti womberi wajimiriti ndiri shilii shakatakuliti. Womberi waweriti na utama mumoyu toziya ya ukatili yawatendirituwi muumanda wawu.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa na Aruni wamgambira kayi Falawu ujumbi wa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Gugendi kayi kwa Falawu kuwera kafiruwa kawalekeziyi wantu wa Israeli wawuki muisi yakuwi”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Kumbiti Musa kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Gupikanili shilii shanonga. Ata wantu wa Israeli wampikaniriti ndiri neni toziya nana shibaba. Su Falawu hakawezi hashi kumpikanira?”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni, pakawalagalira, muwagambiri wantu wa Israeli pamuhera na Falawu kuwera nuwalagalira mwenga muwalongoziyi wantu wa Israeli kulawa Misri.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambuyi wa Musa na Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Ayi ndo walanga wa shiyiwuku sha Israeli viraa kashemwa Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:14">Wana wa Rubeni, shipanta njira sha Yakubu. Womberi waweriti Hanoku na Palu na Hesironi na Karimi. Ashi shiweriti shiyiwuku sha walongu wa Rubeni.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Wana wa Simiyoni waweriti Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohari na Shauli ulii yakaweriti mawu gwa wantu wa Kanaani. Ashi shiweriti shiyiwuku sha Simiyoni.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Aga ndo matawu ga wana wapalu wa Lawi kulawirana na kwiwuka kwawu, womberi waweriti Gerishoni na Kohati na Merari. Lawi kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya na malongu matatu na saba.<verse eid="EXO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Wana wa Gerishoni waweriti Libini na Shimei. Womberi waweriti wambuyi kulawirana na lukolu lwawu.<verse eid="EXO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Wana wapalu wa Kohati waweriti Amramu na Izihari na Hebroni na Uzieli. Kohati kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya na malongu matatu na ntatu.<verse eid="EXO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Wana wapalu wa Merari waweriti Mahili na Mushi. Awu ndo ukolu wa Walawi kulawirana na shiyiwuku shawu.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amramu kamuyugiti Yokebedi dada gwa tati gwakuyi. Yomberi kaweriti mawu gwa Musa na Aruni. Amrani kahowiti pakawera na mivinja miya na malongu matatu na saba.<verse eid="EXO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Wana wapalu wa Izihari waweriti Kora na Nefegi na Zikiri.<verse eid="EXO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Wana wapalu wa Uzieli waweriti Mishaeli na Elizafani na Sitiri.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Aruni kamuyugiti Elisheba muhinga gwa Aminadabu, ulii yakaweriti dada gwakuyi Nashoni. Elisheba kayiwuliti wana wapalu wamsheshi, Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazari na Itamari.<verse eid="EXO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Wana wapalu wa Kora waweriti Asiri na Elikana na Abiasafu. Womberi waweriti wambuyi wa walongu wa Kora.<verse eid="EXO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleazari mwana mpalu gwa Aruni, kamuyugiti yumu gwa muhinga gwa Putieli, nayomberi kamuyuwuriti Finehasi. Awu ndo upeleru wa kaya na ukolu wa shiyiwuku sha Lawi. <verse eid="EXO 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Aruni na Musa ndo yawagambilituwi na Mlungu, “Muwalaviyi wantu wa Israeli kulawa muisi ya Misri.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Womberi ndo yawayoweriti na Falawu kuusu kuwalaviya wantu wa Israeli kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Lishaka lilii Mlungu pakayoweriti na Musa muisi ya Misri, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />kamgambiriti, “Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu. Gumgambiri Falawu kila shintu shanukugambira.” <verse eid="EXO 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Kumbiti Musa kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Gumpikaniri, neni nana shibaba. Su Falawu hakawezi hashi kumpikanira shilii shang'enda kumgambira?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankumlagalira Musa na Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gupikanili weri. Neni hanikutendi gwenga guweri gambira mlungu kwa Falawu, na mlongu gwaku Aruni hakaweri gambira mbuyi gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Gumgambiri mlongu gwaku Aruni vitwatira vyoseri vyanukugambira, Aruni mlongu gwaku hakamgambiri Falawu kawaleki wantu wa Israeli wawuki muisi yakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Kumbiti hanugutendi mtuwi gwa Falawu guweri na mtiti. Malawiranu gakuyi, hantendi ata pantenda mawuzauza gavuwa ga ntambu yingiyingi muisi ya Misri, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Falawu hapeni kakujimiri shilii shagumgambira. Shakapanu hanuwazibu nentu wantu wa Misri na hanuwalongoziyi viyiwuku vya wantu wa Israeli kulawa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Shakapanu pananguziya makakala gangu makulu kuwakoma wantu wa Misri na kuwalaviya wantu wa Israeli kulawa pakati pawu, womberi hawavimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mungu yakawera na makakala goseri.”<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Su Musa na Aruni watenditi ntambu yawagambiritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kumgambira yomberi. Womberi wagenditi kuyowera na Falawu. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Shaka ashi Musa kaweriti na mivinja malongu nani, Aruni kaweriti na mivinja malongu nani na ntatu.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aruni katenditi luhonga lugalambuki njoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Falawu pakawagambira, mtendi liuzauza kulanguziya nakaka kuwera Mlungu kawatuma shakapanu gumgambiri Aruni, Gwasi pasi luhonga kulongolu kwa Falawu, yeni haigalambuki kuwera njoka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Su Musa na Aruni wamgenderiti Falawu na kutenda gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawagambiriti. Aruni kalwasiti luhonga lwakuyi pasi kulongolu kwa Falawu pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi, na lweni lugalambuka kuwera njoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Shakapanu Falawu kawashemiti wahawi pamuhera na waganga woseri yawatenda mawuzauza muisi ya Misri. Womberi watenditi ntambu iraa ilii pawatendiriti uhawi wawu. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Kila yumu kalwasiti luhonga lwakuyi pasi na lugalambuka njoka. Kumbiti luhonga lwa Aruni lwalugalambukiti kuwera njoka luzimila honga zawu zoseri. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Kumbiti mtuwi gwa Falawu guweriti gwankali na mtiti, ntambu yaitakulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, na kawasheriti ndiri Musa na Aruni.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa na Aruni watenditi lushemba lwa Naili luweri lusheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Mtuwi gwa Falawu gwana mtiti. Kalema kuwalekeziya wantu wangu wawuki. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Su shilawu mandawira gugendi gwakaliwoni na yomberi, shaka pakagenda kwoga mashi kulushemba Naili. Gumuhepi kumbeku pa lushemba. Pakalawa mulushemba, gumlanguziyi luhonga lulii lwalugambaukiti kuwera njoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Gumgambiri hangu, ‘Mtuwa Mlungu gwa Waeburaniya, Mlungu ulii yawamguwira, kantuma kwaku kukugambira guwalekeziyi wantu waneni wawuki, su wamguwiri kushiwala. Tukugambiriti gwenga kumbiti gulishera ndiri. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Su vinu Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga hangu, ntambu ayi haguvimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, nana makakala ga kutenda shilii shantakuliti hanishitendi.” Guloli, nankugenda kugasyatanga mashi ga lushemba Naili kwa luhonga lwaluwera mumawoku gangu. Pantenda hangu, mashi hagagalambuki kuwera masheri gambira mwazi. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Shakapanu wasomba yawaweriti mulushemba alu hawahowi, mashi aga haganunki na wantu wa Misri hapeni wawezi kugaranda mashi ga lushemba lwa Naili.’”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Mlungu kamgambira Musa, “Paguyowera na Falawu, gumgambiri Aruni, gutoli luhonga lwaku na gulitalapisiyi gambira kutalipisiya pamashi ga Misri, pashemba na pavishemba na pamashi ga matanda na pamashi ga manegu goseri su gagalambuki kuwera msheri gambira mwazi. Aruni pakatenda hangu, hakuweri na mwazi muisi yoseri ya Misri, ata mukila shintu sha kutulila mashi.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Musa na Aruni watenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawagambiriti. Falawu pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi pawaweriti wankulola, Aruni kanyasula luhonga lwakuyi na kagasyatanga mashi ga lushemba lwa Naili. Na mashi goseri ga lushemba gagalambukiti kuwera masheri gambira mwazi. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Shakapanu wasomba woseri yawaweriti mulushemba lwa Naili wahowiti, nshemba zinunkiti nentu na wantu wa Misri wasinditi kuranda mashi galii. Mwazi guweriti kila pahala muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Kumbiti wahawi wa Misri watenditi ntambu iraa ilii. Su Falawu kendereyiti kuwera na mtiti. Yomberi kalisheriti ndiri shilii shawatenditi ashina Aruni na Musa, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuriti. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Su Falawu kawuyiti kunumba nkulu kwakuyi, shitwatira ashi kalisheriti ndiri. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Wantu woseri wa Misri wabawiti mumpeku mwa lushemba Naili su wapati mashi ga kulanda, toziya womberi waweziti ndiri kulanda mashi ga lushemba alu.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Komangu alu lilikaliti kwa mashaka saba pa Mtuwa Mlungu kugagalambula mashi ga lushemba lwa Naili kuwera mwazi.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Musa na Aruni watenditi malyuli waweri kila pahala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gugendi kwa Falawu gwakamgambiri, Mtuwa Mlungu kalonga kuwera guwaleki wantu wangu wawuki su wanguwiri neni kushiwala. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Kumbiti pagulema kuwaleka wawuki, su hanikuazibu kwa kuwajega malyuli muisi yaku yoseri. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Lushemba lwa Naili ndiri gweka yakuwi halumemi malyuli, kumbiti hawalawi amu na kwiza kila pahala na kwingira mushiwogu shaku na mumsagamu mwaku na mnumba mwa wakulu wayagu na kwa wantu waku na mujiku mwaku na muvyombu vyaku vya kutelekera. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Milyuli hawakweni munshimba yaku na munshimba za wakulu wayagu na kwa wantu woseri yawasigariti.”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu vilaa kamgambiriti Musa, “Gumgambiri Aruni, gutalapisiyi luhonga lwaku mumawoku mwaku gambira katalapisiya pamishemba na vishemba na pamatanda na guwajegi malyuli wizi muisi yoseri ya Misri.” <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Pagumgambira kala Aruni, yomberi kalitalipisiyi liwoku lyakuyi pamashi goseri, milyuli walawira mumashi na wayigubika isi yoseri ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Kumbiti wahawi yawatendiiti mawuzauza kwa uhawi wawu, watenditi ntambu iraa ilii, kayi watenditi mnu malyuli wavuwa walawi mumashi kwiza muisi.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Shakapanu Falawu kamshemiti Musa na Aruni, kawagambira, “Mumluwi Mtuwa Mlungu su kamusiliri neni pamuhera na wantu wangu milyuli awa. Pakawawusiya kala, neni hanuwaleki wantu wa Israeli wagendi zawu wakamlaviliri tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="EXO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa kamwankuliti Falawu, “Neni hawezi kuluwa toziya ya gwenga na wakulu wayagu na wantu waku woseri. Hanimluwi Mtuwa Mlungu kuwawusiya malyuli kulawa mnumba zyenu. Kumbiti malyuli hawasigali mulushemba lwa Naili. Su gung'ambili gufira nduwi ndii.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Falawu kamwankula, “Gunduwili shilawu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Musa kamgambira, “Hantendi ntambu yagutakuliti, shakapanu haguvimani kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu, ndo ulii yatumguwira, ndo Mlungu gwa nakaka na kwahera yakalifana nayu. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Malyuli hawawuki kwaku na mnumba zyenu na kwa wakulu wayagu na kwa wantu waku. Hawasigali mulushemba lwa Naili.”<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Su Musa na Aruni wawukiti kwa Falawu. Shakapanu Musa kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamwusiliri Falawu malyuli woseri yakaijegiti muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi gambira Musa ntambu yakamluwiti. Malyuli woseri yawaweriti mnumba zawu na muluwaga mwawu na mumalambu gawu wafuwiti. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Wantu wajojoniriti malyuli woseri yawafuwiti kuwera malundu makulu na isi yoseri inunka. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Kumbiti Falawu pakawoniti kuwera ntabisiwu ayi ipera, kanjiti kayi kuwera na mtiti. Su kalemiti kuwajimira Musa na Aruni gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komangu lya vinininga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gumgambiri Aruni katapilisiyi luhonga lwakuyi na kagakomi madika ga litapaka. Na pakatenda hangu, madika ga litapaka hagagalambuki kuwera vinininga muisi yoseri ya Misri.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Su womberi watenditi ntambu yawagambiritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. Aruni kagakomiti madika ga litapaka kwa luhonga lwakuyi, muisi yoseri ya Misri, madika ga litapaka gagalambukiti kuwera vinininga. Vinininga wawayingiriti wantu woseri pamuhera na wankanyama wawu. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Wahawi yawatenditi mawuzauza, wajeriti kutenda ntambu iraa ilii kuwajega vinininga kwa uhawi wawu, kumbiti wasinditi. Su vinininga wawayingiriti wantu pamuhera na wankanyama. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Wahawi walii wamgambiriti Falawu, “Mlungu ndo yakatenditi aga kwa makakala gakuyi!” Kumbiti Falawu kendereyiti kuwera na mtiti, kawasheriti ndiri Aruni na Musa gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatakuliti.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komangu lya wamembi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Shilawu gwimuki mandawira putiputi gumgenderi Falawu. Guseleli kugenda kulushemba lwa Naili na gumuhepi Falawu. Yomberi pakiza kwoga mashi, gumgambiri, ashi ndo shakatakula Mtuwa Mlungu, guwaleki wantu wangu wawuki, wagendi kunguwira kushiwala. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Nukuberiziya kuwera pagulema kuwalekeziya wantu wangu wawuki, hanuwatabisiyi kwa kuwajega wamembi wavuwa wingiri kwaku na kwa wakulu wayagu pamuhera na wantu waku. Numba za wantu waku wa Misri hazimemi wamembi. Wamembi hawagubiki pahala pagugoloka. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Kumbiti pagalawira aga, hanulutuli gweka mkowa gwa Gosheni yawalikala wantu wangu, wamembi nawawera aku. Kwanjira ayi, haguvimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu yantenda vitwatira avi panu muisi ayi. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Galii gagagenda kuwalawira wantu waku, hapeni galawiri kwa wantu wangu. Na mawuzauza aga hagalawiri shilawu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Mandawira putiputi, Musa kamgambiriti aga Falawu, kumbiti Falawu kalisheriti ndiri. Su Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi ntambu yakalongiti. Kawajegiti wamembi wavuwa mnumba nkulu ya Falawu na mnumba ya wakulu wayaguwi. Isi yoseri ya Misri iharabisiyituwi na wamembi. <verse eid="EXO 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Shakapanu Falawu kawashemiti Musa na Aruni, kawagambira, “Mwenga wantu wa Israeli muweza kugenda kumlavilira tambiku Mlungu gwenu, kumbiti mlaviyi muisi amu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Kumbiti Musa kamwankula, “Hapeni twenga tutendi hangu,” “Toziya hatulaviyi tambiku yaiwera nkalaliru nentu kwa wantu wa Misri. Patutenda hangu, wantu wa Misri hawatukalaliri twenga. Hashi womberi hawatulagi ndiri kwa kutugumanga mabuwi? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Twenga tufira kugenda kushiwala mwanja kwa mashaka matatu. Aku hatumlaviliri tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakatulagaliriti.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Su Falawu kalongiti, “Hanuwaleki wantu wenu wagendi kumlavilira tambiku mlungu gwenu aku kushiwala. Kumbiti namgenda kutali nentu. Vinu munduwiri kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Musa kawankula, “Gumpikaniri weri! Pandawa kwaku hanimluwi Mtuwa Mlungu, hanimluwi kuwera shilawu hakawawusiyi wamembi kwaku na kwa wakulu wayagu na kwa wantu waku. Kumbiti nagunzyanga kwa kuwalewelera wantu wetu kugenda kumlavilira tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Shakapanu Musa kawuka kwa Falawu, kagenda kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi gambira Musa ntambu yakamluwiti, kawawusiyiti wamembi kulawa kwa Falawu na kwa wakulu wayaguwi na kwa wantu wakuyi. Kwaheriti ata membi yumu. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Kumbiti Falawu kaweriti na mtiti mushaka ashi viraa, kawalekeziyiti ndiri wantu wa Israeli wawuki.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Komangu lya kuwalaga wankanyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gugendi kwa Falawu na gumgambiri, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu ulii yawamguwira Waeburaniya, kankulonga hangu, guwaleki wantu waneni wagendi kunguwira. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Handa pagwendereya kulema kuwalekeziya wawuki, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />nukubereziya kuwera hanukwazibu kwa makakala gangu kwa kujega malweli ga kutiliziya kwa wankanyama waku na kwa farasi waku na wankanyama punda waku na wankanyama ngamiya waku na kwa wang'ombi waku na kwa vipinga vya wambuzi waku na wakondolu waku. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Kumbiti neni Mtuwa Mlungu, hantuli gweka ntambu yantenda kwa wankanyama wa wantu wa Israeli na kwa wankanyama wa wantu waku. Malawiranu gakuyi hagaweri kwahera ata nkanyama yumu gwa wantu wa Israeli yakagenda kufuwa. <verse eid="EXO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Gumgambiri kuwera neni amuwa lishaka lya shirawu hanishitendi shitwatila ashi muisi ayi.”<verse eid="EXO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Shilawu yakuwi Mlungu katenditi shilii shakatakuriti. Ulweli wa kutiliziya nentu guwapatiti wankanyama wa wantu wa Misri, wankanyama wavuwa wafuwiti. Kumbiti kwahera nkanyama yoseri gwa wantu wa Israeli yakafuwiti. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Falawu kawatumiti wantu wakaloliloli, womberi walikangashiti kuweriti kwahera nkanyama yoseri gwa wantu wa Israeli yakahowiti. Kumbiti pawamgambiriti kala aga Falawu, Falawu kendereyiti kuwera na mtiti, viraa kawalekeziyiti ndiri wantu wa Israeli kuwuka.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komangu la maputi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni, “Mtoli livu lya tanuru mumawoku mwenu, shakapanu Musa kiti kunani, kulongolu kwa Falawu. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Livu ali alipalanganyikiti muisi yoseri ya Misri gambira madika madidini. Kila pahala livu halitendi maputi gawatenduwi wantu wa Misri pamuhera na wankanyama wawu muisi yawu yoseri.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Su watola livu na wagenditi naga kugoloka kulongolu kwa Falawu. Musa kagikiti kumpindi. Livu lyeneyiti koseri, su gatenditi maputi gawatenduwi wantu wa Misri pamuhera na wankanyama wawu. Maputi gawatenditi womberi waweri na vironda. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Ata wantu walii yawatenditi uhawi, viraa waweriti na maputi. Malawiranu gakuyi womberi wasinditi kwiza kwa Musa kusingana nayu, toziya wantu yawatenditi uhawi waweriti na maputi gambira wantu wamonga wa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Falawu kendereyiti kuwera na mtiti. Kawasheriti ndiri ashina Musa na Aruni shawalongiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Musa megalawiri.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komangu lya nvula ya mabuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Shirawu gwimuki mandawira putiputi gumgenderi Falawu. Gugendi na gugoloki kulongolu kwa Falawu na gumgambiri kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu yawamguwira Waeburaniya, kalonga hangu, guwaleki wantu wangu wawuki, wagendi kunguwira kushiwala. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Na pagulema kuwalekeziya wawuki, shaka ashi hanuwazibu kwa makomangu makulu, hanuwazibu ndiri gweka yawu wakulu wayagu pamuhera na wantu waku, kumbiti hanukwazibu pamuhera na gwenga, su haguvimani kuwera kwahera mlungu gwingi kuliku neni pasipanu poseri. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Handa mentenderi makakala gangu goseri kukusyatanga gwenga pamuhera na wantu waku kwa malweli ga kutiliziya nentu, megawamalili mwawoseri pasipanu. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Toziya ya kukuleka gulikali, su nukulanguziyi makakala gangu na malawiranu gakuyi wantu woseri pasipanu hawavimani ukulu yanuwera nawu. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Gwenga gwankali na mtiti kulema kuwalekeziya wantu waneni wawuki. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Su gushipikaniri ashi, shilawu mushaka gambira ashi, hantendi nvula ya mabuwi iwatoweli wantu wa Misri. Kwanjira Misri iweri isi, nvula ayi hayenitowi ntambu yaigenda kutowa. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Su gutumi ujumbi kwa kila muntu kuwatula weri wankanyama wakuyi na kila shintu shashiwera kunja mumalambu. Nvula ya mabuwi haimtoweleri kila muntu na kila nkanyama yakawera kunja kumalambu na yakawera ndiri mushisasa, woseri hawahowi.” Su Musa katenditi shilii shakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Wakulu wamu wayaguwi na Falawu, pawapikaniriti shilii shakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi watiriti nentu. Su wawatoliti wankanyama wawu pamuhera na wamanda wawu na kuwatula muvisasa. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Kumbiti woseri walii yawalisheriti ndiri shilii shakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu, wawalekiti wamanda wawu pamuhera na wankanyama wawu mumalambu.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gulitalipisiyi liwoku lyaku kulyera, su nvula ya mabuwi haitowi muisi yoseri ya Misri, haiwatoweri wantu na wankanyama wawu pamuhera na vimeru vya mumalambu.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Su Musa kalitalipisiya luhonga lwakuyi kulyera. Mtuwa Mlungu katenda nvula ya mabuwi itowi muisi ya Misri. Viraa kuweriti na milindimiru pamuhera na mimeta ya milindimiru. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Nvula nkulu ya mabuwi paiweriti yankutowa, kuweriti na mlindimiru pamuhera na mimeta ya milindimiru muisi. Ntambu ayi hayeni lawiri kwanjira Misri iweri isi. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Nvula ayi ya mabuwi yagamiziyiti kila shintu shashiweriti mumalambu muisi ya Misri, kila nkanyama na kila muntu. Nvula ya mabuwi yagamiziyiti vimeru vyoseri pamuhera na mitera mumalambu. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Mkowa gwa Gosheni gweka yakuwi, wantu wa Israeli kwawaweriti wankulikala, kuweriti kwahera nvula ya mabuwi.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Su Falawu kamtumiti muntu yumu kawashemi Musa na Aruni. Womberi pawiziti kwakuyi, yomberi kawagambiriti, “Shaka ashi, neni ntenda vidoda. Shilii shakatenditi Mtuwa Mlungu sha teratera, neni pamuhera na wantu wangu tutenda shintu shifaa ndiri. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Mumluwi Mtuwa Mlungu! Twenga hapeni tuhepeleri ng'anji mulilindimiru ali na nvula ya mabuwi ayi! Hanuwaleki wantu waku wawuki, namulikala panu kayi.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Musa kamwankula, “Katepu hera pandawa kunja kwa lushi alu, hantalapisiyi liwoku lyangu na kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Shakapanu milindimiru haipeli, nvula ya mabuwi haileki kutowa. Ayi hailawiri su guvimani kuwera pasipanu ndo pa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Kumbiti nivimana kuwera gwenga pamuhera na wakulu wayagu mumtira ndiri Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Nvula ya mabuwi paitowiti, nganu pamuhera na pamba, vyoseri viharabisiwituwi toziya nganu iweriti na mikunguwa na pamba iweriti na uluwa. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Kumbiti mpunga na vimeru vyamonga vyavilifana na mpunga viharabisiwituwi ndiri toziya vikawa kukamala.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Su Musa kawukiti ukaya kwa Falawu, kagenditi kunja kwa lushi. Shakapanu kalitalipisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Su malindimiru ganyamaliti na mabuwi galekiti kutuluka na nvula ilekiti kutowa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Kumbiti Falawu pakawoniti kuwera nvula ya mabuwi na malindimiru ganyamala, yomberi katenditi kayi vidoda. Mweni pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi wendereyiti kuwera na mtiti. Kulindimira kuleka, kawuyiriti vidoda vyakuwi kayi, hakaweri shiburi, yomberi pamuhera na maafisa wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Su gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamgambiriti Musa, Falawu kalemiti kuwalekeziya wantu wa Israeli wawuki.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Komangu lya wanjombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gugendi kayi kwa Falawu. Neni nimtenda kaweri na mtiti pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi. Su ntenda hangu mpati kulanguziya mawuzawuza ga kutiliziya pakati pawu, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />na mwenga viraa mpati kuwatambira wananguta wenu na wazukulu wenu, mawuzawuza ga kutiliziya gantenditi kwa wantu wa Misri. Shakapanu mwawoseri mwenga hamuvimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu yakawera na makakala goseri.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Su Musa na Aruni wamgenderiti Falawu kuliboma lyakuyi na wamgambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu yawamguwira Waeburaniya, kalonga hangu, haguleki ndii kuwera na mtiti kwa kugalema galii gantakula na gwenga? Guwaleki wantu wangu wawuki, wagendi kushiwala kunguwira! <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Pagwendereya kulema kuwalekeziya womberi kuwuka, nukuberiziya kuwera shilawu hanuwajegi wanjombi muisi yaku. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Wanjombi hawaigubiki isi yoseri, su gwenga hapeni guwezi kuwona litapaka lya isi. Hawaliyi kila shintu shashisigaliti mukugwamiziya kwa nvula ya mabuwi. Hawaliyi kila shintu shashisigaliti mumitera yaiweriti yankwenderya kukula. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Wanjombi hawaguluki mnumba zaku na mnumba za wakulu wayagu na mnumba za wantu woseri wa Misri. Hawaweri wanjombi wavuwa nentu, gwenga ama walera waku ama wambuyi waku hawenipati kuwawona kwanjira kuwera kwa isi ayi mpaka vinu.’” Su Musa kalawa kwa Falawu, kawukiti pakawera na Aruni.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Wakulu wayaguwi na Falawu, wamgambiri Falawu, “Hashi muntu ayu hakendereyi kutugaziya mpaka ndii? Muwaleki wantu wa Israeli wagendi zawu kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu. Hashi, gwenga guyambura ndiri kuwera muntu ayu kayiharabiya Misri?” <verse eid="EXO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Su womberi wawashemiti Musa na Aruni kwiza kwa Falawu. Falawu kawagambiriti, “Vinu muweza kugenda kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu. Kumbiti gaa hakagendi pamuhera na mwenga?” <verse eid="EXO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Musa kamwankula, “Kila muntu, wantemba na wazewi, hatuwuki na wananguta wetu wapalu na wadala, wakondolu na wambuzi na vipinga vya wang'ombi wetu, toziya tufiruwa kutenda msambu kumgohelila Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Musa kavimaniti kuwera wantu wa Israeli hapeni wawuyi nakamu muisi ya Misri, vulaa Falawu kavimaniti hapeni wawuyi. Su Falawu kawankula, “Handa mwawoseri pamuwuka, haimaniki paweru kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kwatanga, kumbiti neni hapeni nuwalekeziyi mwenga muwatoli wananguta wenu pamuhera na wadala wenu kuwuka. Ayi ya paweru, muwera na nfiru kuwera hapeni muwuyi. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Su hapeni nuwalekeziyi muwuki. Wantu wapalu wa Israeli muweza kugenda kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu, ayi ndo ntambu yamfira.” Shakapanu Falawu kawawingiti kuliboma lyakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gulitalipisiyi liwoku lyaku kuwashemera wanjombi. Wanjombi hawizi muisi ya Misri na kuliya kila shimeru shashisigaliti mulitapaka, vulaa hawaliyi kila shimeru shilii shashiharabisiwituwi ndiri kwa nvula ya mabuwi.”<verse eid="EXO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Su Musa kalitalapisiyiti luhonga lwakuyi pa isi ya Misri. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kajegiti lyega likulu kulawa kwagulawa mshenji. Lyega livumiti pa isi paluwala poseri na pashiru poseri. Paushiyiti mandawira, lyega lii lijegiti wanjombi. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Wanjombi waweriti kila pahala muisi ya Misri. Waweriti wavuwa nentu, hawenipati kuwoneka na hapeni walawiri kayi ntambu ayi. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Wayigubikira isi yoseri ya Misri na litapaka liwoneka kuwera ntiti. Waliyiti vimeru vyoseri na kila shintu mumitera shashiharabisiwituwi ndiri shaka nvula ya mabuwi paitowiti. Kwahera shimeru shoseri shiwisi shashisigairiti ama mutera goseri, kila pahala muisi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Kamukam Falawu kawashemiti Musa na Aruni na kawagambila, “Neni nimtenda vidoda Mtuwa Mlungu, mlungu gwenu, viraa kwa mwenga wawili. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Su vinu nuwaluwa munegeziyi mala yimu hera toziya nana vidoda na munduwili kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, mlungu gwenu kunuwusilira magamiziwu aga gagagenda kundaga.”<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Su Musa na Aruni wawukiti kwa Falawu, Musa kagenditi kumluwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kagalambuziyiti lyega livumi kulawa kwaguzyeta mshenji. Lyega liwawusiyiti wanjombi walii na kwa waweguliluwa kugenda mubahari ya Shamu. Kuweriti kwahera njombi yoseri yakasigaliti muisi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Falawu kaweri kayi na mtiti, su kalemiti kuwalekeziya wantu wa Israeli wawuki.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komangu lya luwindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gulitalipisiyi liwoku lyaku kulyera, luwindu haliweri muisi yoseri ya Misri, luwindu totoru muntu hakagendi kwa kupapasiya.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Su Musa kalitalipisiya liwoku lyakuyi kulyera, luwindu totoru lilawiriti muisi ya Misri kwa mashaka matatu. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Wantu waweziti ndiri kuwona kila muntu na muyaguwi. Woseri wasigaliti mnumba zawu mushaka shoseri. Kumbiti ulangala uweriti Gosheni kwawalikaliti wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Shakapanu Falawu kamshemiti Musa, kamgambira, “Mgendi mwakamguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu. Wadala wenu pamuhera na wananguta wenu waweza kugenda pamuhera na mwenga. Kumbiti vipinga vya wakondolu wenu na wambuzi na vipinga vya wang'ombi wenu havisigali panu.” <verse eid="EXO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Kumbiti Musa kamgambira, “Ndala, gwenga gufiruwa gutulekeziyi tutoli wakondolu pamuhera na wambuzi, su twakamlaviliri tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwetu. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Wankanyama wetu hawagendi pamuhera na twenga, hapeni tumleki ata yumu gwawu kumbeli. Hatuwatoli wankanyama wetu kugenda kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. Hapeni tummani nkanyama gwa kulaviya tambiku mpaka patusoka kulii patugenda.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda Falawu kendereyi kuwera na mtiti, kawalekeziya ndiri wantu wa Israeli wawuki. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Falawu kamgambiriti yomberi, “Guwuki paulongolu paneni. Nagwiza panu kayi nagwiza kundola! Lishaka pagwiza kundola neni kayi, hanukulagi!”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Musa kamwankula, “Yina! Hapeni nizi kayi kwa gwenga.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Komangu lya kulaga wapanta njira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Hanjegi komangu lyamonga limu kwa Falawu pamuhera na wantu wakuyi. Pa aga hakawaleki muwuki, nakaka hakawawingi mwenga woseri. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Su vinu muwagambiri wantu woseri wa Israeli, wawaluwi wapakwegera wawu wapalu na wadala, wapananwi vintu vyavinyawiwa kwa madini ga feza na zahabu.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenditi wantu wa Misri wawapanani ligoya nentu wantu wa Israeli. Mnu ga aga, wakulu wayaguwi na Falawu pamuhera na wantu woseri wamtenditi Musa kuwera muntu mkulu nentu.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Shakapanu Musa kamgendiriti Falawu na kumgambira, “Shintu ashi ndo shilii shakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu, pashiru leru, hampiti pakati pa isi ya Misri, <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />na hantendi kila shipanta njira kahowi. Awa hawaweri shipanta njira gwaku mpalu na shipanta njira gwa mmanda gwaku mdala yakasyaga mulwala na mwana mpalu gwa kila muntu. Viraa handagi wavipanta njira wa wankanyama waku. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Pavilawira avi, wantu woseri wa Misri hawagutangi shiwembu. Viwembu avi havyenilawili na hapeni vilawili kayi. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Kumbiti pakati pa wantu wa Israeli hakuweri jii ata wang'ang'a hapeni wabweti! Shakapanu hamuvimani nakaka neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, hantuli gweka ntambu yantenda kwa wantu wa Misri na ntambu yantenda kwa wantu wa Israeli.” <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Shakapanu wakulu yawagu woseri hawizi na kukusuntamalira gwenga na kulonga, “Shondi shondi, guwuki muisi ya Misri, gwenga pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli! Pa aga, haniileki isi ya Misri.” Su Musa kawukiiti kwa Falawu pakawera na maya.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Falawu hapeni kawasheri mwenga mushilii shamtamkula. Malawiranu gakuyi kuwera hanjegi makomangu gamonga muisi ya Misri.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Su Musa na Aruni watenditi mawuzawuza aga goseri kulongolu kwa Falawu. Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kendereyiti kutenda yomberi kaweri na mtiti na kalemiti kuwalekeziya wantu wa Israeli wawuki muisi yakuwi.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni kulii muisi ya Misri, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Kwanjira vinu, mwezi agu haguweri mwezi gwa kwanja mushinja shenu. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Muwagambiri wantu woseri wa Israeli kuwera mkila kaya, muntu yakawera mkulu gwa kaya, hakatoli mwana gwa kondolu ama mwana gwa mbuzi kwajili ya kaya yakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Handa kwahera wantu yawatosha mukaya yakuwi kuliya mwana gwa kondolu ulii, shakapanu kaya yakuwi pamuhera na kaya ya shiwogu shashifata, hawaliyi pamuhera kondolu ulii. Hayiweri wana wa wakondolu waninga yawafiruwa kulawiranan na muntu ntambu hakawezi kumalila kuliya. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Mwana gwa kondolu ama mwana gwa mbuzi yagumsyaguliti mpaka kaweri washipalu na gwa shinja shimu, viraa nakawera kana shilema shoseri. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Mwenga hamuwaloleri weri mumashaka lilongu na msheshi mumwezi agu. Mulishaka lya lilongu na msheshi, wantu woseri wa Israeli hawawalikituli wakondolu pamuhera na wambuzi pamihi. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Shakapanu womberi hawatoli mwazi gwa wakondolu pamuhera na wambuzi, hawagutyelemeki mwazi gulii pampindi pa mpanda mbili za magomi na pampindi pa magomi ga numba zawu zyawalikaliti kuliya vinofu. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Womberi hawaviwoshiyi vinofu, hawaviliyi pamuhera na mabumunda gawalekera ndiri simika pamuhera na likolu lya mahamba gakalipa. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Namuliya vinofu viwisi ama vyavipwasiwa mumashi, kumbiti vifiruwa viwoshiwi vyoseri mumotu pota na kulikitula kuwusiya mtuwi ama magulu ama kuwusiya vinofu virii vyaviwera mkati mwa nkanyama ulii. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Mfiruwa muviliyi vinofu virii pamihi, namuvisigala kuviliya vinofu virii vilikali mpaka mandawira lishaka lyalifata. Handa shinofu shoseri pashisigala mpaka mandawira lishaka lyalifata, hagushilunguziyi nakamu mumotu. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Pamuliya avi, mwenga muvali nguwu na kuwera kala kwa mwanja. Muvali vilwatu vyenu na muweri na luhonga lwa kutyangira mumawoku mwenu. Hakuweri msambu gwagushemuwa Pasaka kumpanana ligoya neni Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Pashiru panu neni hang'endi muisi yoseri ya Misri, haniwalagi vipanta njira muisi ya Misri, wantu wapalu na wankanyama washipalu. Kwa kutenda hangu, hanuwazibu milungu yoseri muisi ya Misri. Hantendi hangu toziya Neni Mtuwa mlungu, ndo Mlungu yakawera na makakala goseri. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Mwazi yagutyelemeka pampindi pamagomi, hagulanguziyi numba zyawalikala wantu wa Israeli. Panuguwona mwazi, hapeni mpiti mnumba azi, viraa hapeni nagi wantu yawalikala amu, shaka panuwazibu wantu wa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Kila shinja, mwenga hamvini msambu mulishaka ali, kushihola shashitendituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu kwa mwenga. Muvileri vyoseri vyavizaku, kila shinja hamvini msambu agu. Shitwatira ashi hashyendereyi mumashaka goseri.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa mabumunda gagalekeruwa ndiri simika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />“Kwa mashaka saba, mwenga hamliyi mabumunda gagalekeluwa ndiri simika. Mulishaka lya kwanja mulijuwa, muntu yoseri pakaliya libumunda lyalilekerituwi simika, yomberi hakafiruwi kuwusiwi pakati pa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Lishaka lya kwanja na lishaka lya saba hamuweri na lijojoniru lya kunguwira neni. Mumashaka aga mawili wantu nawatenda mahengu, kumbiti walekeziwa hera kutandira shiboga. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Kila shinja, mwenga hamvini msambu agu gwa kuliya libumunda lyalilekeruwa ndiri simika, toziya lishaka ali haliwaholuziyi mwenga kuwera viyiwuku vya mwenga woseri mlaviwituwi kulawa muisi ya Misri. Su kila shinja muvileri vya mwenga vyoseri vyavizaku, hamuvini msambu mulishaka ali. Shitwatira ashi hashyendereyi mashaka goseri. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Mumwezi gwa kwanja mwega hamuliyi mabumunda gagalekeruwa ndiri simika, hamuliyi kwanjira pamihi mulishaka lya lilongu na msheshi mpaka pamihi mulishaka lya malongu mawili na yimu mumwezi agu. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Mumashaka aga saba, mwenga namuwera na simika yoseri mnumba zyenu. Mushaka ashi, muntu yoseri ulii, muntu gwa Israeli ama muhenga pakaliya libumunda lyalilekeruwa simika, hakalaviwu kulawa pakati pa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Poseri palii pamulikala, mwenga namuliya shintu shoseri shashilekeruwa simika mumashaka aga saba.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya kwanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Su Musa kawashemiti wakulu woseri wa wantu wa Israeli. Yomberi kawagambiriti, “Kila kaya isyaguli mwana gwa kondolu ama mwana gwa mbuzi na kumlikitula, mwenga hamumliyi pamuvina msambu gwagushemuwa Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Mtoli mwazi gwa mwana gwa kondolu na mgutuli mushiwiga, mwenga mwapi shintambi sha mivumbeza na mushitoteri mumwazi. Shakapanu mutyelemeki pampindi pa ligomi na pampindi pa mpanda mbili za ligomi za numba. Wantu wafiruwa kulikala mnumba zawu mpaka shilawu mandawira lishaka lyalifata. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakapita kugenda kuwalaga vipanta njira mukaya za wantu wa Misri, su hakawoni mwazi pampindi pa magomi ga numba zyenu, yomberi hakaleki na kuloka numba zilii. Mlungu hapeni kamlekeziyi ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yakalaga kwingira mnumba zyenu kuwalaga. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Mwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shenu mfiruwa kushilola weri shitwatira ashi kuwera lilagaliru mashaka goseri. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Mwenga pamwingira muisi ilii Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kuwapanana ntambu yakalagiliti, mwenga hamshitendi shitwatira kuwera shitiba kila shinja. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Wana wenu pawawakosiya, hashi, shitiba ashi shiwera na mana gaa?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Mwenga hamuwagambiri, shitiba ashi sha kulihola wambuyi wetu ntambu yawalaviyiti tambiku ya mwana gwa kondolu paluwala, ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu pakagulukiti pampindi pa numba za wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti kulii muisi ya Misri. Yomberi kawalagiti wana vipanta njira mnumba za wantu woseri wa Misri, kumbiti kawalekiti wana mnumba za zyetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Musa pakawagambiriti womberi shitwatira ashi, su womberi wasuntamiti makukama na kumguwira Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Shakapanu wantu wa Israeli watenditi shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakawagambiriti Musa na Aruni wawagambiri womberi.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankuwalaga vipanta njira vya wantu wa Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Pashiru nentu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagiti vipanta njira wa wantu woseri wa Misri. Wantu awa waweriti mwana shipanta njira gwa Falawu na shipanta njira gwa muntu yakatatilituwi mushibetubetu na shipanta njira washipalu gwa kila nkanyama. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Pashiru palii, Falawu na wakulu wayaguwi pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Misri wimukiti na kyambula shilii shashilawiriti. Womberi waliliti shiwembu shikulu muisi yoseri, toziya mukila numba, mwana shipanta njira kahowiti.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Pashiru palii Falawu kawashema Musa na Aruni kawagambiriti, “Mwenga pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli, mlawi pakati pa wantu waneni. Mgendi mwakamguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yamlongiti. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Mtoli vipinga vya wakondolu na wambuzi na wang'ombi, su muwuki! Mumluwi Mtuwa Mlungu viraa kantekeleri!”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Shakapanu wantu wa Israeli watenditi ntambu yawagambiritwi na Musa. Womberi walongiti, Patutenda ndiri hangu, nakaka hatuhowi! Womberi wagenditi kwa wapakwegera wawu wantu wa “Misri na wawaluwi vintu vyavinyawiwa kwa madini ga feza pamuhera na zahabu, viraa wawaluwi nguwu.” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenditi wantu wa Misri wawapanani ligoya likulu wantu wa Israeli, su womberi wawapananiti vyoseri vyawaluwiti. Kwanjira ayi, wantu wa Israeli watoliti ulunda woseri wa wantu wa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Waisraeli waweriti watenditi kala handa Musa ntambu yakatakuriti, na wawaluwiti Wamisri wawapanani vito vya mbiya na zahabu na vivalu. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Nayomberi Mwenyezi Mlungu kaperiti kuwatenda Waisreli wafilwi na Wamisri, nawomberi Wamisri wawapanana kila shintu shawaluwiti. Ndo Wamisri ntambu yawawapokiti Misri ulanda wawu.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankulawa muisi ya Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Wantu wa Israeli wagenditi mwanja kulawa mlushi lwa Ramesesi kugenda mlushi lwa Sukoti. Kuweriti na wapalu elufu miya sita, pota kuwawalanga wadala na wana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Kuweriti viraa na wantu wavuwa wamonga yawaweriti ndiri wantu wa Israeli, wagenditi mwanja pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli, wagenditi pamuhera na wakondolu wawu na wang'ombi wawu na wankanyama wavuwa nentu. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Pawaweriti munjira, womberi wawoshiyiti mabumunda kwa ubumu yawautoliti pawaweriti wankuwuka kulawa muisi ya Misri. Ubumu uweriti wahera simika, toziya wagambirituwi wawuki kalongola, su waheriti shaka sha kutandira shiboga sha kuwuka nashu, ama shaka sha kuhanganya simika muubumu.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Wantu wa Israeli walikaliti muisi ya Misri kwa mivinja miya msheshi na malongu matatu. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Mushinja sha upeleru sha shinja sha miya msheshi na malongu matatu, lishaka lilaa lilii, makabila goseri ga wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu galawiti muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Pashiru palii Mtuwa kawaloleriti eri wantu wa Israeli pakawalaviyiti womberi kulawa muisi ya Misri. So pashiru panu pafiruwa kuholuziwa na wantu wa Israeli pamuhera na viyiwuku vyawu vyoseri gambira pashiru pa kulikala msu toziya ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Mlungu kakeshiti iri kuwalaviya Waisraeli isini Misri; utakiwa kuazimisha na Waisraeli woseri na vireli vyawu vyoseri kulihola ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu kawaloleriti weri wambuyi wetu.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpangu gwa Pasaka yayiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni, “Aga ndo malagaliru ga shitiba sha Pasaka. Namumleka muhenga kaliyi shiboga sha Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Kumbiti mpalu yoseri mmanda yamumuhemiriti, kaweza kuliya shibogapa kuwayingiziya jandu. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Namuwaleka wantu yawalikala na mwenga kwa shaka shididini hera ama walii watenda lihengu wa shibenamgongu sha lishaka limu, walii shiboga ashi. <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />Namtola shiboga shoseri sha Pasaka kushijega kunja kwa numba. Ila kaya ifiruwa kuliya shiboga sha Pasaka mnumba mwawu weni ama kushimega shifupa shoseri. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli wafiruwa kuvina msambu agu. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Muhenga yoseri pakiza kulawa muisi yamonga, pakafira kulikala na mwenga na kafira kuvina msambu gwa Pasaka, muwawayingiziyi jandu wapalu woseri mukaya zawu. Shakapanu womberi waweza kuliya shiboga sha Pasaka na muweza kulikala nawu gambira muntu muyenu gwa Israeli. Kumbiti Namuwaleka wantu yawayingiziwa ndiri jandu kuliya shiboga sha Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Malagaliru aga gawera ga wantu wa Israeli pamuhera na wahenga yawalikala pakati penu.”<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli wawajimiriti Musa na Aruni na watenditi shilii shashilagalirituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Lishaka lilaa ali Mtuwa Mlungu kawalaviyiti wantu wa Israeli kulawa muisi ya Misri.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Shipanta njira kutuluwa kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Guwatuli gweka wapanta njira wapalu waweri kwajili ya neni. Shipanta njira wapalu wa wantu wa Israeli na shipanta njira wa wankanyama wawu hawaweri kwajili ya neni.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa mabumunda yagatulwa ndiri simika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Musa kawagambiriti wantu, “Namulyaluwa lishaka ali! Lishaka ali ndo lyamlawiti muisi ya Misri. Lishaka ali ndo lyamlekeziwa kulawa muumanda. Mtuwa Mlungu kawalaviyiti mwenga kulawa muisi ya Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu. Namuliya libumunda lyoseri lyalitulitwi simika patutenda msambu mulishaka ali. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Lishaka ali mwankugenda kuwuka muisi ya Misri, lishaka lya kwanja, mumwezi yagushemuwa Abibu. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakawajega muisi ya wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Kanaani na wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Hiti na wantu washiyiwuku sha Amori na wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Hivi na wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Yebusi vinu yawalikala amu, isi ayi yakalagiliti kuwapanani mwenga, isi hayiweri iherepa kwa kuyiliziya mifugu yenu na kuyala viboga, mfiruwa kuvina kwa kutenda msambu mumwezi agu kila vinja. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Kwa mashaka saba hamliyi mabumunda yagalekelwa ndiri simika. Na mulishaka lya saba hamtendi msambu toziya yakumpanana ligoya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Namuliya libumunda lyoseri lyalilekeruwa simika kwa mashaka saba. Namuwera na simika ama libumunda lyalilekeluwa simika muisi yenu. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Lishaka pamuyanja kutenda msambu, muwagambiri wananguta wenu, twankutenda hangu tushihola shilii shakatenditi Mtuwa Mlungu kwa wambuyi wetu pawawukiti muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Shitiba ashi hamushitendi kulihola ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu pakawalaviyiti wambuyi wenu kulawa muisi ya Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu. Shitiba ashi sha kulihola hashiweri gambira shimaniziru shashitawaliluwa mumtuwi gwaku ama muliwoku lyaku. Hashiwaholuziyi mwenga mlongi kwa wamonga shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakawalagaliriti. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Su mfiruwa kutenda msambu kila shinja mushaka shakatuliti Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu shipanta njira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />Musa kendereyiti kuwagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu hakawajegi mwenga muisi yawalikala shiyiwuku sha wantu wa Kanaani, ntambu yakawalagiliti mwenga pamuhera na wambuyi waku mekawapanani. Pakawapanana isi ayi, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />mfiruwa kumtulira Mtuwa Mlungu, shipanta njira shimpalu wa wankanyam wenu. Awa hawaweri kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Kila shipanta njira gwashipalu gwa nkanyama punda hagumuhemeri kwa mwana gwa kondolu. Pagufira ndiri kumuhemera nkanyama punda, gufiruwa gumlagi kwa kummindula singu. Gufiruwa gumuhemeri kila yumu gwa shipanta njira gwa wana waku wapalu. <verse eid="EXO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />Mumashaka ga kulongolu wana waku pawakukosiya, shitwatila ashi shiweria na mana gaa? Gwenga hagumgambiri, Mtuwa Mlungu kawalaviyiti wambuyi wetu kulawa muisi ya Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu na kutulaviya kulawa muumanda kulii. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Falawu kaweriti na mtiti, kalemiti kuwalekeziya womberi wawuki muisi yakuwi, su Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagiti vipanta njira woseri wapalu muisi ya Misri, kawalagiti wantemba pamuhera na vipanta njira vya mifugu yawu. Ndo mana vinu twankumlavilira tambiku Mtuwa Mlungu, shipanta njira sha wankanyama wetu, kumbiti twenga tuhemera shipanta njira wana wapalu wetu. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Mbuyira kulonga kuwera msambu agu gukuholuziya Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawalaviyiti wambuyi wetu kulawa muisi ya Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu, shitwatira ashi hashiweri gambira shintu shagulitawa mushunu shaku ama mumtuwi gwaku kukuholuziya.”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kugenda kubahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Falawu pakawalekeziti wantu wa Israeli wawuki, Mlungu kawalongoziyiti ndiri womberi waigenderi njira ya kugenda muisi ya wantu wa Filisti. Njira yaiweriti ya pakwegera, kumbiti Mlungu kalongiti, “Meyiweri shintu shidoda handa wantu wangu kugalambula maholu gawu pawayambula kuwera hawafiruwi kulikomangi ngondu na wantu wa Filisti pawatola isi yawu, shakapanu waamuwi kuwuya muisi ya Misri.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Badala yakuwi, Mlungu kawalonguziya womberi njira ntali kupitira kushiwala kugenda kubahali nsheri. Wantu wa Israeli pawawukiti muisi ya Misri, watoliti silaha zawu za kulikomanga na wangondu wawu.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Musa katoliti mafupa ga Yusufu wagendi naga, toziya Yusufu pamberi pa kuhowa kwakuyi, kawatenditi wantu wa Israeli walagili kuwera mewagatoli. Yusufu kawagambiriti, “Mlungu hakashilaviyi shiyiwuku shenu shilawi muisi ya Misri. Pamlawa amu, mugatoli mafupa gangu mgendi naga.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Su wantu wa Israeli wawukiti Sukoti na wagenditi kugonjera mwanja Etihamu, mumpeku kushiwala. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Pawagenditi mwanja paluwala, Mtuwa Mlungu kagenditi pamuhera na yomberi pakawalongolera mulihundi lifufu kuwalanguziya njira. Pashiru, kawalongoleriti womberi mulihundi lyaliwera gambita mpanda yalilifana na motu. Kwa kutenda hangu, kawatenditi womberi wawezi kugenda mwanja paluwala na pashiru. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Lihundu lyaliwera gambira mpanda liwalekiti ndiri womberi. Shaka shoseri liwalongoleriti womberi, liweriti lifufu paluwala na pashiru liweriti gambira motu.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuloka bahari ya Shamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli wawuyi kumbeli na wagonjeri mwanja kulongolu kwa lushi lwa Pihahiroti. Lushi alu luwera pakati pa Migidoli na bahari Shamu, pakwegera na lushi lwa Baalizepihoni. Mnyawi malingu genu kulii pakwegera na bahari. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Falawu pakavimana kuwera mulikala aku, yomberi hakaliholi, wantu wa Israeli wamana ndiri njira, shiwala shiwatenda nawamani njira yawu. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Kumbiti hanimtendi Falawu kaweri kayi na mtiti, na hakalagaliri mashonta gakuyi gawafati. Shakapanu wantu wangu hawankwisi kwa kumkanka Falawu pamuhera na mashonta gakuyi. Na wantu wa Misri hawavimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera na makaka goseri.” Su Musa kawagambiriti wantu wa Israeli na womberi shilii shawagambirituwi.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mashonta ga wantu wa Misri gankuwafata wantu wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Muntu yumu kamgambiriti Falawu kuwera wantu wa Israeli wawukiti pashiru, yomberi pamuhera na wakulu wayaguwi wagalambukiti mumaholu gawu na walongiti, “Twenga tutenda hashi? Wantu wa Israeli hapeni waweri wamanda wetu kayi!” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Su Falawu kawatandiriti kala mashonta gakuyi pamuhera na mbutuka za ngondu zyazikwegwa na farasi. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Shakapanu kazisyaguliti mbutuka ziherepa miya sita zyazikwegwa na farasi, mukila mbutuka kamtuliti mlonguziya farasi na shonta yumu na mkulu gwa mashonta, na womberi wawukiti. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Falawu kaweri na mtiti, mweni pamuhera na mashonta gakuyi wagenditi kuwafata wantu wa Israeli yawawukiti kwa ukanka. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Mashonta ga wantu wa Misri na farasi woseri wa Falawu na mbutuka zyazikwegwa na farasi na walonguziya farasi, woseri wawafatiti wantu wa Israeli. Su wawawoniti wantu wa Israeli wagonjera mwanja pakwegera na bahari, pakwegera nentu na Pihahiroti, kulongolu kwa Baalizepihoni.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Mashonta ga Falawu pagaweriti pakwegera, wantu wa Israeli walikangashiti nentu pawawoniti wankuwaizira. Su watiriti nentu, wanjiti kumlilira Mtuwa Mlungu kawatangi. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Wamgambiriti Musa, “Hashi, kuweriti kwahera pahala muisi ya Misri kwa twenga megawezi kufindirwa mpaka gutujega kushiwala kuhowa? Guloli shilii shagututenderiti kutulaviya twenga muisi ya Misri! <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Shintu ashi tukugambiriti gwenga patuweriti muisi ya Misri! Tukugambiriti, gutuleki gweka yetu na guleki tuwatenderi lihengu wantu wa Misri! Meyiweri mbaka twenga kuwera wamanda kwa wantu wa Misri kuliku kuhowa panu kushiwala!”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Musa kawawankula wantu wa Israeli, “Namtira! Mgoloki weri, hamuwoni ntambu Mtuwa Mlungu pakagenda kuwakombola! Hakawalopoziyi mwenga leru na malawiranu gakuyi hagaweri wantu wa Misri yamuwawona leru, hapeni muwawoni kayi! <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Mtuwa Mlungu mweni hakalikomangi ngondu badala ya mwenga! Mwenga mnyamali jii. Kwahera ntambu yingi yamuweza kutenda.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kagatenda mashonta ga wantu wa Misri kumiruwa mubahari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guwagambiri wantu waleki kundilira niwatangi, wendereyi kugenda kulongolu. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Gunyasuli luhonga lwaku na gulitalapisiyi gambira gulitalipisiya mubahari. Mashi hagalibaguli, su wantu wa Israeli wawezi kugenda pakati mubahari, pawagendagenda mulitapaka liyuma pakati pa vibambaza viwili vya mashi kila wega. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Hanuwatendi wantu wa Misri waweri na mtiti, su womberi hawajeri kuwafata mwenga. Malawiranu gakuyi shintu shang'enda kumtenda Falawu pamuhera na mashonta gakuyi na mbutuka zyazikwegwa na farasi pamuhera na walonguziya farasi, wantu wangu hawankwisi neni. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Na pampata ukanka yauwera na ukwisa, wantu wa Misri hawavimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera na makakala goseri.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Shakapanu ntumintumi gwa kumpindi yakawalongoleriti wantu wa Israeli, kagenditi kumbeli kwa womberi. Lihundi lilii lyaliweriti gambira mpanda liweriti kulongolu kwawu, viraa ligenditi kumbeli kwawu. <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />Lihundi liwabaguliti wantu wa Israeli na mashonta ga wantu wa Misri. Pashiru lihundi lilii lyaliwera gambira mpanda liweriti mpanda ya motu, liwalangaliriti wantu wa Israeli. Kumbiti lituliti ntiti kwa wantu wa Misri mpaka wasinditi kuwawona wantu wa Israeli. Malawiranu gakuyi kwahera shipinga shashiweziti kushisegerera shipinga shamonga pashiru poseri.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Pamihi, Musa katalipisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi gambira kankulitalipisiya pabahali. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kajegiti lyega likulu kulawa kwagulawa mshenji. Lyega livumiti pashiru poseri na liweguliti mashi kumbwega na kutenda pakati pa mwashi kuweri na njira yaiyumiti. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Shakapanu wantu wa Israeli wapititi munjira yaiyumiti pakati pa bahari. Mashi gambira vibambaza uwega wa kumshigi na uwega wa kumliwu. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Mashonta ga wantu wa Misri wawafatiti womberi, na wayingiriti mubahari pa womberi kwingira mubahari pamuhera na farasi wawu na mbutuka zawu zyazikwegwa na farasi na walonguziya farasi. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Pakwegera kushiya, Mtuwa Mlungu kagasunguriti mashonta ga wantu wa Misri mulihundi lilii lya mpanda ya motu, su kawatenditi womberi washashatiki. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Kagatenditi magudulumu ga mbutuka zyazikwegwa na farasi gakwami mulikandiga, su womberi wasinditi kugendagenda weri. Su wantu wa Misri watakuliti, “Mtuwa Mlungu kankuwalolera weri wantu wa Israeli na kankutukoma twenga kwa kugawusiya maguludumu ga mbutuka panu.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gutalapisiyi liwoku lyaku gambira gulitalapisiya pabahali yoseri. Shakapanu mashi hagawuyi na kuwamiluwa wantu wa Misri na mbutuka zawu pamuhera na walonguziya farasi.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Su Musa kalitalapisiya liwoku lyakuyi pabahali na papawushiyiti, mashi ga bahari gawuyiti na kuwera gambira kwanja. Wantu wa Misri wajeriti kushapira, kumbiti wamiluwiti woseri mubahari. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Mashi gawuyiti na kugubuka mbutuka zoseri na walongoziya farasi pamuhera na mashonta ga wantu woseri wa Misri, walii yawajeriti kuwafata wantu wa Israeli mubahari. Kila yumu kwa wantu wa Misri kamiluwiti mumashi. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Kumbiti wantu wa Israeli walokiti kala mubahari kwa kugendagenda munjira iyuma, mumashi yagaweriti gambira vibambaza viwili, shimu uwega wa kumliwu na shamonga uwega wa kumshigi.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Ntambu ayi Mlungu kawalopoziyiti wantu wa Israeli kulawa mumashonta ga wantu wa Misri mulishaka ali. Wantu wa Israeli wagawoniti mauti ga wantu wa Misri gankuyeruka pambeku pa bahari. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Wantu wa Israeli woniti shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakashitenditi kwa wantu wa Misri kwa makakala gakuyi makulu, womberi wamkwisiti Mtuwa Mlungu. Su womberi wamjimiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, viraa wamjimiriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankuvina msambu kwa kukomboluwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Musa pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli wimbiti lwimbu halweniimbuwi lishaka loseri lilii.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">“Hanumwimbiri Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya kakanka kwa ukwisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">Kawawasiliti farasi pamuhera na walonguziya farasi mubahari!<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo ulii yakantenda neni weri mgangamala, ndo ulii yanumwimbira</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Mweni ndo yakanopoziyiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Yomberi ndo Mlungu gwangu, neni Hanimkwisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Mlungu ndo ulii wambuyi wangu wamguwiriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">na hanuwagambiri wamonga ukulu yakawera nawu.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu gambira muntu gwa ngondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">Mtuwa Mlungu ndo litawu lyakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Yomberi kaziyasiliti mbutuka zyazikwegwa na farasi za Falawu pamuhera na mashonta gakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">mubahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">Wakulu wayaguwi waherepa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">woseri wamiluwiti mubahari ya Shamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Mashi gagubikiti gambira mashi makulu ga mafuriku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">womberi walidibiti mumashi gambira mabuwi.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, liwoku lyaku lya kumliwu lyana makakala ga ukwisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">kwa makakala gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwasoniziyiti wangondu muvipandi vipandi.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Guwera na ukwisa gwaguwagamiziyiti wangondu waku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">Toziya guwakaliriti womberi, gwagawamiziyiti womberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">gambira motu gwagulunguziya uhakata.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Gwenga gupulila mubahari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">mankapala ga mashi gagolokiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">mashi gagolokiti gambira vibambaza viwili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">Pasi nentu mubahari, mashi gakamaliti.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Wangondu wa twenga walongiti, hatuwafati womberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">na hatuwakamuli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Hatulaviyi magumba getu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">hatuwalagi womberi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Patuwakamula kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">hatuugawi ulunda wawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Hatutoli kwa womberi shoseri shatufira.<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Kumbiti gwenga guvumishiti lyega lyaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">na bahari iwagubika womberi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">Womberi walidibiti mumashi mavuwa gambira mabuwi.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu, pakati pa milungu yawu, kwahera mlungu gambira gwenga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Gwenga gukwisuwa, nakaka gwa tambu ya gweka na vyoseri vyaguvinyawiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Hashi, gaa yakalifana na gwenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Kwahera ata yumu yakalifana na gwenga, yakaweza kutenda mawuzauza ga ntambu yoseri ilii. <verse eid="EXO 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Pagulitalipisiyiti liwoku lyaku lya kumliwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">wangondu wetu wamilituwi na pasipanu!<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Gwenga kwa uheri waku guwalongoziya wantu gwaguwakomboliti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">kwa makakala gaku gwenga guwalonguziyiti womberi muisi yagulikala.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Wantu wa isi zimonga hawapikaniri shilii shagutenditi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">na womberi hawalendemeri.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Wakulu wa Edomu hawalikangashi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">Wakulu wa Moabu hawaweri na lyoga, hawashashatiki. Woseri yawalikala muisi ya Kanaani moyu yawu hayiweri na lyoga.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Womberi hawaweri shashatika pamuhera na lyoga toziya ya makakala gaku makulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Kumbiti hawaweri jii gambira mabuwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mpaka wantu waku pawapita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">wantu yaguwakomboliti kulawa muumanda muisi ya Misri, <verse eid="EXO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />wagendi muisi ya Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">Haguwatendi womberi wawezi kulikala mulugongu lwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">pahala palii gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gupasyaguliti paweri ukaya kwaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">mupahala pananagala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">gwenga gamweni gupanyawiti.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, hagukolimlima mashaka goseri!”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa Miriamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Farasi wa Falawu na mbutuka zyazikwegwa na farasi pamuhera na walongoziya farasi pawajeriti kwingira mubahari, Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi mashi gawuyi na kuwagubika woseri. Kumbiti wantu wa Israeli wagenditi kupitira pakati pa bahari munjira iyuma. <verse eid="EXO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Miriamu mbuyi gwa Mlungu, ulii yakaweriti dada mkulu gwa Aruni, katoliti ng'oma ndidini yakuwi, <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />na kamwimbiriti Mtuwa Mlungu lwimbu alu, su wadala woseri wamgendiriti kumbeli kwakuyi pawavina na pawawera na ng'oma zawu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">“Mwimbiri Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">toziya kakankiti kwa ukwisa kulawa kwa wangondu wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">Yomberi kawawasiliti farasi pamuhera na walonguziya farasi mubahari.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kagalambula mashi gakalipa gaweri mashi maherepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Shakapanu Musa kawalongoziyiti wantu wa Israeli kulawa mubahari ya Shamu. Womberi wagenditi kushiwala lwalushemuwa Shuri. Wagenditi mwanja gwa mashaka matatu, pota kuwona mashi. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Kuweriti na mashi palii, kumbiti womberi wasinditi kugalanda toziya gaweriti gakalipa. Ndo mana pahala palii pashemuwa Mara, kwa Shieburaniya mana yakuwi ikaripa. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Wantu woseri wamuhinginikiiti Musa na kulonga, “Hashi, hatulandi shishi?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Su Musa kamliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamlanguziyiti mtera. Su yomberi katoliti lutambi lumu na kalyasiti mumashi na mashi gagalambikiti kuwera maherepa kwa kugalanda. Kulii Mara, Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti womberi malagaliru ga ntambu yingi yingi kugalongoziya makaliru gawu. Viraa Mtuwa Mlungu kawajeriti kulii kuwayambura handa womberi mewamjimiri, <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />kwa kulonga, “Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu. Handa pamunjimira weri neni panuwagambira, na kutenda shilii shitwatira shanushimana kuwera shiherepa, kugalola weri goseri ganuwalagalira, neni haniwaloleri weri kulawa mumalweli ganugajegiti kwa wantu wa Misri. Namulyaluwa kuwera ndo ulii yakawaponiziya.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Patulawiti Mara, twiziti pahala papashemuwa Elimu. Kulii kuweriti na mbwiru za mashi lilongu na mbili pamuhera na mitera ya mitendi malongu saba kulii. Su womberi wanyawiti malingu gawu kulii.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Wampongu wangwari na shiboga mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Womberi wawukiti mlushi lwa Elimi, wantu woseri wa Israeli wiziti kushiwala shashishemuwa Sini. Shiwala ashi shiweriti pakati pa Elimi na lugongu lwa Sinai. Shaka ashi shiweriti lishaka lya lilongu na muhanu, mwezi gwa pili pawawukiti kala muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Kushiwala aku, wantu woseri wa Israeli wamuhinginikiti Musa na Aruni. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Womberi wawagambiriti, “Mbaka Mtuwa Mlungu mekatulagi muisi ya Misri! Kulii kuweriti na vinofu pamuhera na kila ntambu ga mabumunda galii gatufiriti. Kumbiti gwenga gutujega twenga kushiwala panu su tutabiki na kuhowa!”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gupikanili shilii shang'enda kutenda. Nankugenda kujega shintu kulwa kulyera hashilifani na mabumunda kwa mwenga. Pantenda hangu, wantu wafiruwa kugenda kunja kwa malingu gawu kila lishaka kusola shiboga shashitosha kuliya lishaka limu. Su pantenda hangu, hanivimani kuwera womberi hawagajimili malagaliru gangu ama ndala. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Mulishaka lya sita, pantenda kala shitwatira ashi, womberi hawasoli na shiboga sha lishaka lya saba. Shakapanu womberi hawashitandiri kushiliya.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Su Musa na Aruni wawagambiriti wantu woseri wa Israeli, “Pamihi panu hamuvimani kuwera ndo twenga ndiri kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu yakawalaviyiti mwenga kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Shilawu mandawira hamuwoni ukulu yakawera nawu Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya kapikaniriti shilii shamtuhinginikiti twenga. Yomberi ndo yumu mwenga nakaka yamumuhinginikiiti, toziya twenga twawantumintumi wakuyi.” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Shakapanu Musa kalongiti, “Kila pamihi, Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapanani vinofu muliyi, na kila mandawira hakawapanani shintu shashiwera gambira mabumunda, toziya kapikaniriti shamuhinginika. Twenga ndiri yamtuhinginikiiti, kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu ndo ulii nakaka yamumuhinginikiiti. Twenga twawantumintumi wakuyi.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Musa kamgambira Aruni, “Guwagambiri wantu woseri wa Israeli, wizi panu wagoloki kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya yomberi kapikanira shilii shawahinginikiti.” <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />So Aruni kawagambiriti womberi. Na pakaweriti kankuyowera na wantu wa Israeli, womberi waloliti kushiwala na walikangashiti kuwona ukwisa wa Mtuwa Mlungu mulihundi lilii lyaliwalongoziyiti. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Mpikanira shilii wantu wa Israeli shawahinginikiti. Su guwagambiri, pamihi hamuliyi vinofu, na shilawu pamandawira hamusoli vintu gambira mabumunda ga kuliya. Shakapanu hamuvimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu yakawera na makakala goseri.”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Su pamihi wampongu wangwali walawiriti, waweriti wavuwa nentu na kugubika pahala poseri pawalikaliti pamalingu gawu. Shilawu yakuwi kuweriti na vintu gambira mangami phala pa malingu gawu. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Mangami aga pagayumiti, pashiwala kuweriti na vintu vyavilifana na mabumunda gatopa ndiri. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Wantu wa Israeli pawawoniti vintu avi, toziya womberi waweriti haweniviwoni pamberi, su wavimaniti ndiri, womberi walikosiyiti weni kwa weni, “Shintu gaa ashi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Musa kawawankura, “Shintu ashi Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti mwenga mliyi, shintu shashilifana gambira mabumunda. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalagalira hangu, kila muntu kasoli shiboga shashimtosha kuliya. Kasoli makopu mawili kwajili ya kila muntu yakalikala mulilingu lyaku.”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Hangu ndo wantu wa Israeli ntambu yawatenditi. Wamu wasoliti ng'anji na wamonga wasoliti kidogu. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Kumbiti woseri pawapimiriti shilii shawasoliti, woseri wayambuliti kuwera ulii yakasoliti vivuwa kaweriti ndiri na shigubikiru na ulii yakasoliti kidogu kapungukiwituwi ndiri. Kila muntu kasoliti shiboga shashimtoshiti kuliya.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Musa kawagambiriti womberi, “Namleka shigubikiru sha kuliya shilawu mandawira!” <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Kumbiti wantu wamonga walisheriti ndiri shilii shakatakuliti Musa. Womberi watuliti shigubikiru mpaka shilawu mandawira. Su shiboga shilii shiworiti na shiwera na wambikinyu na shinunkiti. Musa kawakalariti nentu womberi.<verse eid="EXO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Kila mandawira wajojoniriti shiboga shashimtosha kila muntu. Kumbiti shakapanu, mshenji paguwaliti, shilii shawashisigaliti mulitapaka shiyeyukiti.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Mulishaka lya sita, wantu wa Israeli wanjiti kujojonira shiboga, kila muntu kaweziti kujojonira pishi za msheshi kuliku ntambu yawatenditi mumashaka gamonga. Wakulu wa wantu pawawiziti kwa Musa na kumgambira shitwatira ashi, <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />yomberi kawagambira, “Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti, shilawu haliweri lishaka lyenu la kwoyera nakamu. Haliweri lishaka lyalitulituwi kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Su leru, mmtereki ama mposiyi shiboga shilii shamfira kuliya leru na shilawu. Shilii shashisigala pamihi leru, mushituli shigubikiru na hamushiliyi shilawu.”<verse eid="EXO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Su womberi watenditi ntambu yawalagaliritwi na Musa. Shilii shashisigaliti, womberi washituliti mpaka lishaka lyalifatiti. Shiboga shilii shiwoliti ndiri ama kuwera na wambikinyu! <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Mulishaka ali, Musa kawagambiriti, “Leru muliyi shilii shashisigariti lishu, toziya leru liwera lishaka lyalitulituwi kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Leru hapeni msoli shintu shoseri kunja. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Kila lijuwa, mwenga hamsoli kwa mashaka sita, kumbiti mulishaka lya saba haliweri lishaka lya Kwoyera, hapeni msoli shoseri.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Mulishaka lya saba wantu wamu walawiti kugenda kusola shiboga, kumbiti washipatiti ndiri. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa kawagambiri wantu, “Hashi, mpaka ndii mwenga wantu hamlemi kupikanira shilii shanuwagambira? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Mpikaniri! Neni Mtuwa Mlungu nuwapananiti mwenga lishaka lya Kwoyera. Su mulishaka lya sita kila lijuwa, yomberi haniwapanani mwenga shiboga shitosha kwa mashaka mawili. Kila yumu gwenu kafiruwa kalikali mulilingu lyakuyi nakatenda lihengu mulishaka lya saba.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Su wantu woyeriti mulishaka lya saba.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Wantu wa Israeli washishemiti shiboga ashi mana, shipikanirika gambira shisoweru mulikabila lyawu lyaliwera na mana ashi ndo shishi? Shiboga ashi shiweriti gambira mbeyu ndidini ya usaka na unoga wakuyi uweriti gambira libumunda lyalitulituwi lwashi. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa kawagambiriti, “Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti, mtuli makopu mawili ga shiboga shashishemuwa mana kwajili shileri sha mwenga sha shakapanu, su womberi hawawoni shiboga shashilifaniti na mabumunda shanuwapananiti wambuyi wenu panuwalaviyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri.” <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Musa kamgambiriti Aruni, “Gutoli shombu na gulituli pishi mbili za shiboga shashimuwa mana. Shakapanu gutuli pahala Mtuwa Mlungu kaweza kuwona. Ashi hashituluwi kwajili ya shileri shenu shoseri sha shakapanu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Mumivinja ivuwa, Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa, Aruni kashituliti shombu shilii kulongolu kwa lisabduku lyaliweriti na mabuwi gagalembituwi malagaliru lilongu. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Wantu wa Israeli waliyiti shiboga sha mana kila lishaka kwa mivinja malongu msheshi, mpaka pawayingiriti mumipaka ya isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Shipimu ashi womberi washitendiriti mpaka shaka sha vinu.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu katenda mashi galawi mulitalawu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="NUM 20:1-13">Mawalanga 20:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Mjimiri shilii shakalagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu, wantu woseri wa Israeli walawiti kushiwala lwalushemuwa Sini. Womberi wagenditi mwanja kulawa pahala pamu kugenda pahala pamonga. Waomberi wagonjeriti mwanja pahala papashemuwituwi Repihidimi, kumbiti pahala palii kuweriti kwahera mashi ga kuranda. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Su wantu wamuhinginikiiti Musa pawalonga, “Gutupanani mashi ga kulanda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musa kawakosiya, “Iwera ashi mwankuhinginikiya neni? Iwera hashi mwankumjera Mtuwa Mlungu handa kawera na makakala ga kuwapanana?” <verse eid="EXO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Kumbiti wantu woseri waweriti na kwimuluwa, wendereyiti kumuhinginikiya Musa. Womberi walongiti vitwatira avi, “Iwera hashi gutulaviyiti muisi ya Misri? Gutujega panu su twenga pamuhera na wananguta wetu tuhowi toziya kwahera mashi ga kulanda.”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Su Musa kaluwiti kwa kumlilira Mtuwa Mlungu. Su kalongiti, “Nushimana ndiri shintu shakuwatendera wantu awa! Womberi wakala kunaga kwa kungumanga mabuwi!” <verse eid="EXO 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankuliti Musa, “Guwatoli wakulu wamu wa wantu wa Israeli, muwagambiri wantu wakufati kulugongu lwa Sinai. Gutolu luhonga lulii lwalusyatangiti lushemba lwa Naili. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Gupikanili weri! Hangoloki kulongolu kwaku panani pa litalawu likulu mulugongu. Gusyatangi litalawu kwa luhonga lwaku. Pagutenda hangu, wantu hawapati mashi ga kulanda kulawa mulitalawu ali.” Womberi pawasokiti palugongu, Musa katenditi ntambu ilii uganu wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli pawalola, mashi galawiti mulitalawu. <verse eid="EXO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Musa kapashema pahala palii kwa Shieburaniya “Masa”, mana yakuwi gujeri, na “Meriba” mana yakuwi kuhinginika. Yomberi kapananiti litawu ali toziya wantu wa Israeli wamjeriti Mtuwa Mlungu pawalonga, “Hashi, Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera natwenga na kaweza kututanga nakaka ama ndala?” Viraa kapananiti litawu Meriba toziya womberi wendereyiti kuhinginika.<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankuwakoma ngondu wantu wa Maleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Shakapanu shiyiwuku sha shipinga sha wantu wa Maleki, shiziti kulikoma ngondu na wantu wa Israeli aku Repihidimi. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Musa kamgambiriti Yoshuwa yakaweriti mkulu yumu gwa wantu wa Israeli, “Gusyaguli wapalu gugendi mwakalikomi ngondu na shipinga sha wantu wa Maleki shilawu. Neni hangoloki pashidunda, hanyasuli luhonga Mlungu lyakang'ambiriti njegi.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Su Joshuwa katenditi gambira Musa ntambu yakamgambiriti. Yomberi kawatoliti wapalu wamu kulikoma ngondu na shipinga sha wantu wa Maleki. Womberi pawaweriti wankulikoma ngondu, Aruni na Huri pamuhera na Musa wagenditi palugongu, su womberi mewezi kuwona pahala pa ngondu yoseri. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Shiweriti shaka shoseri Musa pakalitalipisiyiti liwoku lyakuyi kumpindi, wantu wa Israeli wakankiti, kumbiti pakalisulusuyiti liwoku lyakuyi, wantu wa Maleki wakankiti. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Su mawoku ga Musa gatokiti. Aruni pamuhera na Huri walikwegiti libuwi likulu su Musa kalivagiri, womberi wawili wagatalipisiyiti mawoku gakuyi. Kwanjira ayi, womberi wawili waganyasuliti mawoku ga Musa mpaka mshenji paguzyetiti. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Su Yoshuwa pamuhera na wapalu yakaweriti nawu, washikomiti ngondu shipinga wa wantu wa Maleki, waitendiriti misumenu yawu kuwadumulanga womberi.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gushilembi shitwatira ashi mushintola, shakapanu gushibetuli kwa Yoshuwa. Viraa gulembi kuwera lishaka limu hanushyagamiziyi nakamu shipimga sha wantu wa Maleki.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Shakapanu Musa kanyawiti shitalawanda kutambikira sha mabuwi kulii kashipananiti litawu “Mtuwa Mlungu ndo gambira bendera yaneni.” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Yomberi kalongiti, “Muyinyasuli kumpindi bendera ya Mtuwa Mlungu! Mtuwa Mlungu hakendereyi kulikomanga ngondu na shipinga sha wantu wa Maleki, mashaka goseri!”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Yetiru mganafu gwa Musa kiziti kumtyangira Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Yetiru ulii yakaweriti mtambika gwa shipinga sha wantu wa Midiyani, viraa kaweriti mganafu gwa Musa, yomberi kapikaniriti goseri Mlungu gakatenditi kwa wantu wa Israeli. Yomberi kapikaniriti Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawalaviyiti wantu wa Israeli kulawa muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Musa kamuwuziyiti ukaya Sipora mdala gwakuyi pakawuyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri. Kumbiti Yatiru kamwiziriti yomberi, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />pakamjega Sipora pamuhera na wana wakuyi wawili. Mwana yumu kashemwa Gerishoni, kwa Shieburaniya mana yakuwi muhenga, toziya yomberi kalongiti, “Neni weriti muhenga nilikaliti muisi yamonga.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Mwana gwakuyi gwa pili kashemwa Eliezeri, kwa Shieburaniya mana yakuwi Mlungu kantanga, toziya yomberi kalongiti, “Mlungu, ulii wambuyi wangu wamguwiriti, yomberi kantanga neni na kanopoliti kulawa kulaguwa na Falawu muisi ya Misri.”<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Musa pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli pawanyawiti malingu kushiwala pakwegera na Sinai lugongu lunanagala, Yatiru kamwiziriti yomberi pakamjegera Musa mdala gwakuyi pamuhera na wana wapalu wakuyi wawili. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yatiru katumiti ujumbi kwa Musa, “Neni mganafu gwaku Yatiru, nankwiza kukulola, nakwiza pamuhera na mdala gwaku pamuhera na wana wapalu waku wawili!” <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Su Musa kalawiti kunja kumalingu kugenda kumwanka mganafu gwakuyi. Yomberi kasuntamaliriti kulongolu kwa yomberi, kamnonera musingu. Woseri walikosiyana, gwakashina mwatu? Shakapanu womberi wagenditi muliringu lya Musa. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Musa kamgambiriti Yetiru kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamtenditi Falawu pamuhera na wantu wa Misri toziya ya wantu wa Israeli. Viraa kamgambiriti ntabiku zyawazipatiti munjira, pamuhera na Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawatangiti. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yetiru kanemeleriti nentu pakapikaniriti kuusu Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatenditi kwa kwantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Yomberi kalongiti, “Kazyumuwi Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii yakawakomboliti mwenga kulawa mumakakala ga mfalumi wa wantu wa Misri pamuhera na mashonta gakuyi! <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Vinu nyambula kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu mkulu kuliku milungu yoseri, toziya kawakombola mwenga kulawa mumakakala ga mtiti gwa wantu wa Misri palii pawawatenditi mtabiki.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Shakapanu Yetiru kamlaviyiti nkanyama kwajili ya kulunguziya mushitalawanda sha kutambikira kuwera tambiku, viraa kamlaviyiti tambiku zyamonga kwa Mlungu. Aruni pamuhera na wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli, wagenditi pamuhera na womberi kuliya shiboga pamuhera na Yetiru.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwasyagula watoza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Shilawu yakuwi, Musa kalikaliti pahala pakuwatozera wantu. Wantu wendereyiti kujega matatizu gawu kwa Musa, kwanjira mandawira mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Yetiru pakawoniti kila shintu Musa shakatenditi kwa wantu, yomberi kalongiti, “Iwera hashi gwankutenda vintu avi kwa wantu? Iwera hashi gwankutenda gweka yaku, wantu woseri wankukugolokera gwenga kwanjira mandawira mpaka pamihi, pawakuluwa guwatozi?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa kamwankula, “Nankutenda hangu toziya wantu wanizira pawasakula shilii shakafira Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Pawawera na ndewu yoseri, womberi wiza kwaneni na wanduwa ntozi ga kateratera pakati pawu. Viraa neni nuwafunda malagaliru ga Mlungu pamuhera na malagizu.” <verse eid="EXO 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Yetiru kamgambiriti Musa, “Shilii shagutenda shifaa ndiri kwa gwenga ama kwa wantu. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Gwenga pamuhera na wantu awa hamtoki! Lihengu ali likamala nentu kwa mwenga. Hapeni muwezi kulitenda gweka yenu. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Vinu gupikanili visoweru viherepa vyang'enda kukugambira. Handa pagutenda shang'enda kukugambira, Mlungu hakakutangi. Gwenga gufiruwa kwendeleya kumluwa Mlungu na kumgambira kuusu matatizu. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Viraa gwenga gufiruwa kuwafunda womberi shilii Mlungu shakalagaliriti na gakakugambiliti. Gwenga gufiruwa viraa kugatakulira kwa womberi ntambu yawafiruwa kulikala mumakaliru gawu, pamuhera na vintu vyawafiruwa kuvitenda. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Kumbiti muvitwatira vyamonga, guwasyaguli wantu wamonga wakutangi. Guwasyaguli wantu yawamtira Mlungu, yawawera waminika na yawajimira ndiri finda. Guwasyaguli muwamu mwawu watendi utoza mushipinga sha wantu lilongu, shipinga shamonga sha wantu malongu muhanu, shipinga shamonga sha wantu miya na shipinga shamonga sha wantu elufu. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Guwalekeziyi womberi watendi mashaka goseri kutoza matatizu ga wantu. Shintu shashiwera shikamala, wakujegeri gwenga, kumbiti virii vyaviwera vikamala ndiri, womberi waweza kumalira weni. Ntambu ayi hayiweri mbaka mulihengu lyaku handa womberi pawakutanga kutenda lihengu ali. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Handa Mlungu kakugambira gutendi hangu, gwenga hapeni gutoki na wantu woseri hawawuyi ukaya kwau pawawera na ponga, mataizu gawu pagamaliruwa kalongola.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Musa kajimiriti shilii shakagambirituwi na Yetiru mganafu gwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Musa kawasyaguliti wantu yawafaa kulawa pakati pa wantu wa Israeli na kawatenditi waweri watoza mushipinga sha wantu lilongu, shipinga shamonga sha wantu malongu muhanu, shipinga shamonga sha wantu miya na shipinga shamonga sha wantu elufu. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Womberi wasyagulituwi kuwera mashaka goseri hawagatozi weri matatizu ga wantu. Su womberi kwa galii matatizu makulu wamjegiriti Musa, kumbiti matatizu galii makulu ndiri wagamaliriti wawu weni. <verse eid="EXO 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Shakapanu Musa kamgambiriti kwahere Yatiru mganafu wakuyi, su yomberi kawuyiti muisi yakuwi.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Litapanu pamuhera na Malagaliru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Wantu wa Israeli pawawukiti Repihidimu, pa myezi miwili shakapanu pawalawiti muisi ya Misri, womberi wasokiti kushiwala pakwegera na lugongu Sinayi. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Womberi wanyawiti malingu gawu aku pakwegera na lugongu lwa Sinayi. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />“Musa kakweniti kulugongu kuyowera na Mlungu. Mtuwa Mlungu kamshemiti kulawa palugongu na kalongiti, ashi ndo shanfira kuwagambira wantu wa Israeli, shiyiwuku sha Yakobu, <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />mwenga mwoniti ntambu yanuwatenditi wantu wa Misri. Mwoniti shanuwatendiriti mwenga na ntambu yanuwajegiti panu kwa neni. Nuwatoriti gambira ndapu yakawatola wana wakuyi mumbapatiru. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Su vinu pamtenda shanuwagambira na kujimira vyoseri vyanuwalagalira mwenga, hamuweri wantu wa neni. Wantu woseri wa pasipanu, wa neni,” kumbiti hamuweri wagweka kwaneni kuliku vipinga vya wantu wamonga. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />“Mwenga hamuweri muufalumi waneni wa watambika, mwenga hamuweri woseri watambika na hamtuluwi nakaka kwajili ya neni. Ntambu ayi mfiruwa kuwagambira wantu wa Israeli.”<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Su Musa kasulukiti kulawa kulugongu na kawashemiti wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli. Yomberi kawagambiriti kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu shakamgambiriti su kawagambiri womberi. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Wantu woseri walongiti, “Hatutendi kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu shakatugambiriti.” Shakapanu Musa kakweniti kugenda kulugongu na kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu shilii shawalongiti wantu.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gumpikaniri weri. Neni nankugenda kukulawira gwenga mulihundi litopa. Payowera na gwenga, wantu hawapikaniri na hawajimiri mashaka goseri shilii shaguwagambira.” Shakapanu Musa kasulukiti kulawa kulugongu na kawagambiriti wantu shilii shakalongiti Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">Musa kagenditi kayi kulugongu na kumgambira Mtuwa Mlungu shilii shawatakuliti wantu. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gusuluki kayi kugenda kwa wantu. Guwagambiri walipungi leru na shilawu. Guwambiri wagululi nguwu zawu vulaa. <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />Su waweri kala shilawu, toziya mulishaka ali hansuluki kwiza palugongu lwa Sinai, wantu hawawezi kumona. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Haguwatulili wantu mipaka kuzyengeta lugongu na guwagambiri, Muliloli weri namkwena kulugongu ama namulisegelera pakwegera. Muntu yoseri yakalushinkula lugongu alu hakahowi. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Naguleka muntu yoseri ama nkanyama yoseri yakalokiti mipaka na kulisegelera lugongu alu. Gumlagi muntu yoseri ama nkanyama yakaloka na kulisegelera lugongu kwa kumgumanga kwa mabuwi ama kumkomanga misali. Kumbiti pampikanira liziwu likulu lya mbalapi, wantu waweza kwiza pakwegera nentu kulugongu.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Su Musa kaselera kayi kulawa kulugongu na kawagambiriti wantu walipungi weni. Womberi watenditi shilii shawagambirituwi na Musa, vulaa wagululiti nguwu zawu. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Shakapanu Musa kawagambiriti wantu woseri, “Mulikali kala mulishaka pashilawu. Mwenga wapalu namuliwona na wadala wenu.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Mashaka mawili shakapanu, mandawira, kuweriti na malindimiru na mimeta ya malindimiru na kuweriti na lihundi litopa palugongu. Mbalapi ipikaniriti kwa liziwu likulu nentu, malawiranu gakuyi wantu mumalingu walendemeriti nentu toziya watiriti nentu. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Shakapanu Musa kawalongoziyiti wantu kunja mumalingu su wakaliwoni na Mlungu. Womberi wagolokiti pawaluzyengeta lugongu. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Lugongu lyoseri lwa Sinai lugubikituwi na lyosi, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kasulukiti palugongu kaluzyengeta kwa motu. Lyosi lifukiti gambira lyosi la litanuru, lugongu lyoseri lilendemeriiti nentu. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Liziwu lya mbalapi lyenderiti kuwera likulu nentu gambira lupanda. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kasulukiti kwiza palugongu lwa Sinai, kamshemiti Musa kukwena kulugongu, su Musa kagenditi. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guseleri kayi kugenda pasi gwakawaberiziyi wantu nawaloka mipaka kwiza kulugongu su wandoli. Handa pawatenda hangu, wavuwa wawu hawahowi. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Viraa watambika yawayiza pakwegera na neni Mtuwa Mlungu, su walipungi huti, nayiza kuwazibu.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Wantu awa hapeni wakweni kwiza kulugongu, toziya guwalagalira pagulonga, Mtuli mipaka kuluzyengeta lugongu, kulutenda lupunguwi.”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawankula, “Guseleri pasi, gumtoli Aruni. Kumbiti naguwalekeziya watambika ama wantu wamonga waloki mipaka kwiza kwaneni. Handa pawaloka, haniwazibu.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Su Musa kaselera kayi kugenda pasi na kawagambiriti wantu wa Israeli shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakatakuriti.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankuwapanana wantu Malagaliru lilongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Liholu 5:1-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Shakapanu Mlungu katakuliti visoweru avi kwa wantu wa Israeli, <verse eid="EXO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Neni Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii yamumguwira. Neni ndo ulii yaniwalaviyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri. Neni ndo ulii yanuwakomboliti kulawa muumanda kulii.”<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Su munguwiri neni gweka yangu, namuwaguwira milungu yamonga.”<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Nagulinyawira shinyagu shashilifana na shintu shoseri kulyera ama muisi ama mumashi pasi nentu pa pasipanu. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Nagushisuntamalira shinyagu shoseri na kushiguwira, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu, nfira gunguwiri neni gweka yangu. Hanuwazibu woseri yawatenda vidoda na kunkalalira neni. Hanuwazibu ndiri gweka yawu, kumbiti hanuwazibu pamuhera na wana wawu na wazukulu wawu na wazukulu wa wana wawu. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Kumbiti neni hanuwafiri maelufu ga shiyiwuku sha walii yawanfira neni na kugajimira malagaliru gangu.”<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Nagulitendera hera litawu lyaneni muukontola, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii yanfiruwa kumguwira, haniwazibu walii yawalitendera litawu lyaneni muukontola.”<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Nagulyaluwa lishaka lya Kwoyera mukila lijuwa kuwera ndo lyaneni, su mugatuli mashaka aga kwajili ya neni. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Kwana mashaka sita kwa gwenga kutenda mahengu gaku, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />kumbiti lishaka lya saba haliweri lishaka lya Kwoyera, lishaka lyalitulituwi kwajili ya neni Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii yamfira kumguwira. Mulishaka ali namtenda lihengu lyoseri. Gwenga na wana wapalu waku na wahinga waku na wamanda waku wapalu na wadala, namtenda mahengu. Naguwatenda kwa makakala wankanyama waku watendi mahengu, viraa nagulekeziya wahenga kutenda mahengu, pamuhera na woseri yawalikala muisi yaku. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu numbiti lyera na pasipanu na bahari na kila shintu shashiwera mubahari kwa mashaka sita. Shakapanu ndeka kutenda lihengu lyangu lya kuumba kila shintu na kwoyera mulishaka lya saba. Toziya ayi neni Mtuwa Mlungu nulitekeleriti kuwera lishaka lya Kwoyera na kulitenda liweri lishaka linanagala.”<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Guwapanani ligoya tati gwaku na mawu gwaku, su gwenga guwezi kulikala makaliru gavuwa muisi neni Mtuwa Mlungu yang'enda kukupanana gwenga.”<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Nagulaga.”<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Naguwumba.”<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Nagwiwa shintu shoseri.”<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Nagutakula ukapitawu wa upayira kwa muntu yoseri.”<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Naguwera na matamata na shintu shoseri sha wapakwegera gwaku ama mdala gwa muntu yoseri ama mpalu gwa muntu yoseri ama mmanda mdala ama mpalu gwa muntu yoseri ama wankanyama wa muntu yoseri ama wankanyama punda wa muntu yoseri ama shintu shoseri shilii sha wantu wamoga.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lyoga lya wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Wantu pawapikaniriti kulendemera na mimeta ya milendemeru na pawapikaniriti liziwu lya mbalapi na kuwona lyosi palugongu, womberi watiriti nentu na kulendemera. Su womberi wagolokiti kutali, <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />wamgambiriti Musa, “Handa paguyowera na twenga, twenga hatukupikaniri. Kumbiti nagulekeziya Mlungu kayoweri shintu shoseri kwa twenga. Twenga twankutira nentu kuwera handa pakatakula na twenga, hatuhowi.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Musa kawawankula, “Namtira! Mlungu kiza kuwajera su lyoga kuusu Mlungu haliweri pamuhera na mwenga kuwatenda namtenda vidoda.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Su wantu woseri wagolokiti kutali Musa pakagenditi pakwengera netu mulihundi litopa lilii kwakaweriti Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga shintalawanda sha kutambikira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiri Musa, “Guwagambiri aga wantu wa Israeli, mpikaniriti neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yantakuliti na mwenga kulawa kumpindi. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Niwagambiriti kuwera namulinyawira shinyagu shoseri sha madini ga feza ama mlungu yamgenda kumguwira kuliku neni. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Mwenga munyawili neni shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha litapaka, mulaviyi nkanyama kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziya nakamu. Viraa mulaviyi nkanyama kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziya kidogu, hayiweri tambiku ya ponga kwa wantu. Munguwiri neni pahala poseri yanuwasyagula mwenga kunguwira neni, pamtenda hangu, neni hanizi kwa mwenga na kuwatekelera. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Handa pamulinyawira shitalawanda sha mabuwi sha kutambikira, namshinyawa kwa mabuwi gamgasongola gawoneki gaherepa, toziya pamtendera vyombu vya kusongolera, hamuidodiziyi. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Namunyawira neni shitalawanda shashiwera na lukweneru, toziya pamtenda hangu, wantu mewawoni shivula sha muntu yakakwena mulukeneru.”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Ntambu ya kulikala na wamanda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Liholu 15:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Aga ndo malagaliru gamonga guwapanani wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />Pagumuhemera mmanda, muntu gwa Eburaniya, yomberi kakutendera gwenga kwa mivinja sita. Kumbiti mvinja gwa saba gumlekeziyi nakawera mmanda gwaku, na hapeni kakulipi gwenga shintu shoseri kwa kumlekeziya. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Handa mmanda kahemiritwi pamberi pa kuyuga, hakawuki gweka yakuwi. Kumbiti handa kiziti na mdala gwakuyi, su hakawuki na mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Handa mtuwa gwakuyi kamuyugiliriti mdala na mdala kawiyura wana wapalu na wadala uganu mpalu gwakuyi pakawera mmanda, mpalu gweka yakuwi hakaweri mlekeru. Mdala gwakuyi pamuhera na wana hawendereyi kuwera wamanda kwa mtuwa gwawu. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Kumbiti mushaka sha kumleka mmanda kaweri mlekeru, mmanda ulii pakalonga, neni numfira mtuwa gwangu pamuhera na mdala gwangu na wana wangu, neni nfira ndiri kuwuka, <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />shakapanu mtuwa gwakuyi hakamjegi kugenda pahala womberi kwawamguwira Mlungu. Shakapanu hakamjegi kuligomi ama pampanda za ligomi, yomberi hakashitenderi shintu sha shuma shashisongoka kumtobola likutu. Su mtuwa ulii hakamvalisiyi shintu kulanguziya kuwera yomberi hakaweri mmanda kwa mtuwa gwakuyi mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Muntu pakamshuwuza muhinga gwakuyi kaweri mmanda, hapeni kaweri mlekelu pamivinja sita ntambu yaiwera kwa mmanda mpalu. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Handa muntu yakamuhemeriti muhinga ayu, pakafira kaweri mdala gwakuyi, shakapnu pakaherepeziwa ndiri na muhinga ayu, yomberi kafiruwa kamshuwuzi kwa tati gwa muhinga ayu. Yomberi kafiruwa ndiri kamshuwuzi kwa wahenga, toziya yomberi hakagaleki majimiliranu gakagatenditi na tati gwa muhinga ayu. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Handa muntu yakamuhemeriti muhinga ayu kaweri mdala gwa muntemba gwakuyi, su yomberi kafiruwa kamloleri weri gambira muhinga gwakuyi mweni. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Handa mtuwa pakamtola mmanda mdala kaweri mdala gwakuyi yumonga, yomberi kafiruwa kendereyi kumpanana mmanda mdala shiboga na nguwu ntambu yakampananiti kwanja, vulaa kendereyi kugonja nayu ntambu yaiweriti kwanja. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Handa mpalu ayu pakatenda ndiri vitwatira vyoseri avi vitatu kwa mdala ayu, su kafiruwa kamlekeziyi kulawa muumanda na yomberi kafiruwa ndiri kamlipi shintu shoseri kwa kumtenda kaweri mlekeru.”<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu kuwakalalira wantu wamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Yakamkoma muntu na kumlaga, yomberi hakalagwi. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Kumbiti handa kaweriti ndiri kamnyatira, ila kwa kutendewa, su, mlaga ayu hakawezi kutugira uponera pahala panfira kuwasyagulirani. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Kumbiti muntu pakamkomanga myaguyi kwa ng'anjihera na kumlaga kwa shibuli, ata pakatugira kumazabahu, hamlaviyi kumazabahu paneni na kumlaga.”<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Yakamkoma tati gwakuyi awu mawu gwakuyi mpaka kalagwi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Yakamteka muntu nyala su kamwuzi awu kumtenda mmanda gwakuyi mpaka kalagwi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Yakampangira tati gwakuyi ama mawu gwakuyi, yomberi mpaka kalaguwi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Wantu wawili pawalikomanga, shakapanu yumu kamguma myaguyi libuwi awu ngumi bila kumlaga. Kumbiti kamtenda padidika na kumtenda kalwali na kugonja mshitanda, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />Handa ayu yakakomitwi pakapata nafuwu na kaweza kugendagenda kwa kulitumbira luhonga, ayu yakamtenditi hakalekeziwi. Kumbiti, hakamlipi toziya ya shaka shoseri shakagonjiti mushitanda na hakamlwaziyi mpaka kaponi nakaka. <verse eid="EXO 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />Muntu pakamkoma mmanda gwakuyi mpalu ama mdala kwa luhonga na kumlaga palaa panu, ndo mpaka kazibiwi. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Kumbiti mmanda ayu gwa shipalu ama gwa shidala pakasigala mkomu lishaka limu ama mawili, mpalu wakuyi hakazibiwi, Toziya ayu kaweriti ndo mlunda gwakuyi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Wapalu pawalikomanga na kumtenda mdala kana yinda, ata yinda yakuyi iwuka pota kutenduwa kumonga nentu, ulii yakamtenditi hakalundwi ntambu yakafira mpalu gwakuyi mdala ayu na handa watoza ntambu yawaamuwiti. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Kumbiti handa hagaweri matenduwa gamonga, su mpaka kamlipi ukomu kwa ukomu, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />lisu kwa lisu, linu kwa linu, liwoku kwa liwoku, ligulu kwa ligulu, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />kuluguziwa kwa kulunguziwa, likweshulu kwa likweshulu, likomangu kwa likomangu. <verse eid="EXO 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />Muntu pakamkoma lisu mmanda gwakuyi mpalu ama mdala na kulihalibisiya lisu lyakuyi, ndo mpaka kamlekiziyi kagendi zakuyi lekeru pota malipu toziya ya lisu lyakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Handa muntu yoseri pakalimega linu lya mmanda gwakuyi, yomberi kafiruwa kamlekeziyi mmanda ulii toziya ya shilii shakatenditi mulinu lya mmanda ulii.”<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu usalama wa wamonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Ng'ombi pakamkoma muntu kwa ligoli na kumlaga, ng'ombi ayu hakalagwi kwa kugumangwa mabuwi na minofu yakuyi hawaliyi ndiri. Mweni kana ng'ombi ayu hapeni kalawumiwi. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Kumbiti handa ng'ombi ayu kazowelera kukoma wantu pembi na mweni kaberiziwa kumbiti kamtawa ndiri, handa ng'ombi ayu pakamlaga muntu kafiruwa kalaguwi kwa kugumwa mabuwi na mweni yakana ng'ombi hakalagwi viraa. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Ata hangu, muntu ayu pakalundwa su kulopola ukomu wakuyi, ndo mpaka kalipi shashifiruwa shakalundwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Ng'ombi pakamkoma pembi mwana mpalu ama mwana mdala, lagiru ali halitumiki vilaa. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Handa ng'ombi ayu pakamkoma pembi mmanda gwa shipalu ama gwa shidala, yakana ng'ombi hakamlipi mtuwa gwa mmanda ayu feza zyana samani ya magwala selasini ga madini ga feza na ng'ombi ayu mpaka kalaguwi kwa kugumangwa mabuwi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“Muntu pakalileka lirindi pota kuligubika, ama pakabawa lirindi shakapanu kaligubika ndiri, ng'ombi ama nkanyama punda pakatulukira amu, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />yakana lirindi kafiruwa kalipi, hakamlipi yakana nkanyama ayu feza na nkanyama yakafuwiti hakaweri gwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />Ng'ombi gwa muntu pakamtenda ng'ombi gwa muntu yumonga na kumlaga, su wantu hawamwuzi ng'ombi yakasigaliti mkomu na kubagulana beyi yakuyi; viraa hawabagulani ng'ombi ulii yakafuwiti. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Kumbiti ng'ombi ayu handa kaweriti kazowelera kukoma wamonga pembi na mweni kamtawa ndiri, mweni hakalipi ng'ombi kwa ng'ombi na ulii yakalagitwi hakaweri gwakuyi.”<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga shibena mgongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Mtuwa Mlungu viraa kalongiti, muntu yoseri pakiwa ng'ombi ama kondolu, kamlikitula su kumshuwuza ama kumlaviya tambiku, yomberi hakafiruwi kulipa wang'ombi wamuhanu kwa ng'ombi ulii yakamwiwiti na hakalipi wakondolu wamsheshi kwa kondolu ulii yakamwiwiti. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Mwivi pakabatwa kankubomolanga numba ya muntu pashiru, handa muntu ulii yakambatiti pakamlaga, ulii yakamlagiti hapeni kaweri na likosa. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Kumbiti aga pagalawira paluwala, ulii yakamlaga mwivi hakaweri na likosa lya kulaga. Mwivi mpaka kalipi shilii shakiwiti. Handa yomberi pakahera nkanyama gwa kulipa, su hawamshuwuzi kwa muntu gwingi kaweri mmanda, mpiya zyawapatiti hawazilipi kwa ulii yawamwiwiriti. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />Handa nkanyama yawamwiwiti kankali mkomu, ng'ombi ama kondolu, su yomberi kafiruwa kalipi nkanyama wawili kwa nkanyama ulii yakamwiwiti.”<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Handa muntu yoseri pakawalekeziya wankanyama wakuyi waliyi mahamba mulirambu lyakuyi, ama mulirambu lya mizyabibu, pakawalekeziya wingiri mulirambu lya muntu gwingi, yomberi hakalipi vintu viherepa vya mulirambu lyakuyi mweni ama mizyabibu yakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />Muntu pakapamba motu na pagulunguziwa mitera ya misontu na pagulipalasiya mpaka kulunguziya mboku za viboga ama viboga vya muntu yumonga vyeni havenebenangwi ama lilambu loseri lilungulira. Muntu yakagupambiti motu agu, kafiruwa kalipi asara yoseri ayi.”<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Handa muntu pakampanana muyaguyi mpiya ama vintu vyaviwera na beyi nkulu kamtulili, shakapanu pawaviwa mnumba mwakuyi, na mwizi pakawoneka kafiruwa kalipi samani yakuyi mara mbili. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Kumbiti mwivi pakawonekana ndiri, yakana numba hakasegeleri kulongolu kwa Mlungu su kutakula handa kiwa ndiri lunda ya muyaguyi.”<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Papawera na likakatala kuusu ng'ombi ama nkanyama punda ama kondolu ama nguwu ama shintu shoseri yashihowiti sheni kila yumu kashonga ndo shakuyi, weni hawajegwi kulongolu kwa Mlungu. Ulii mweni Mlungu hakalongi kakosa, hakamlipi myaguwi mala mbili.”<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Handa muntu pakampanana muyaguwi ng'ombi ama nkanyama punda ama kondolu ama nkanyama yoseri ulii kamloleleri, wankanyama walii pawahowa ama kutenduwa ama pawatoluwa pota na yoseri kuwona, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />shakapanu ulii yakapananitwi kuwalolera wankanyama walii, hakalirapi pahala pa kumguwira mlungu, uganu pakavimana Mlungu kankupikanira kuwera yomberi kiwiti ndiri wankanyama walii. Paiwoneka kuwera yomberi kiwiti ndiri wankanyama walii, ulii yakawera na wankanyama kajimiri kuwera muntu ulii kalonga unakaka, su hapeni kamlipi ulii yakawera na wankanyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Kumbiti muntu ulii yawampananiti wankanyama walii pawamwiwira, su yomberi hakamlipi ulii yakawera na wankanyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Handa yomberi kalonga kuwera nkanyama kalaguwa na nkanyama gwa kuntundu, su hakavijegi vinofu vyavisigariti vya nkanyama ulii na kumlanguziya ulii yakawera na nkanyama, shakapanu ulii yawampananiti kawaloleri hapeni kamlipi shoseri ulii yakawera na wankanyama.”<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Muntu pakamuwanda nkanyama kwa muyaguwi, na nkanyama ulii katenduwa ama kufuwa uganu yakawera na nkanyama kawera ndiri palii, su ulii yakamuwanditi nkanyama hakamlipi ulii yakawera na nkanyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Kumbiti ulii yakawera na nkanyama pakawera palii uganu nkanyama wakuyi katenduwa na kufuwa, hapeni wamlipi shoseri. Payiwera nkanyama ulii kawanditwi kwa kumlipira mpiya, su yomberi hakajimiri mpiya za kutulila uwanda kwa nkanyama ulii.”<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu makaliru ga kila lishaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Muntu pakamtongoza muhinga luyenja yakahetituwi ndiri, yomberi kafira kamuyugi ama kagonji nayu, su hakamposi na hakaweri mdala gwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Tati gwa muhinga ayu pakalema nakamu muhinga gwakuyi kayuguwi na muntu ayu, tati ayu hakawuziyi posa ilii.”<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Nagumleka mdala muhawi kalikali.”<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Kalaguwi muntu yoseri yakagonja na nkanyama.”<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Muntu yoseri yakalaviya tambiku kwa mlungu yumonga badala ya kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi hakalagwi.”<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Namumtabisiya muhenga ama kumgaziya, toziya mwenga viraa muweriti wahenga muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Nagumgaziya mkenja ama mwana mshiwa. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Handa pamuwatabisiya womberi na pawandilira, hanuwapikaniri. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />Neni haweri na maya kwa mwenga, su hantendi mwenga mulaguwi mungondu. Na wadala wenu hawaweri wakenja, viraa wana wenu hawaweri wahera tati.”<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Muntu muhushu pakati pa wantu wangu pakawanda mpiya kwaku, gwenga naguwera gambira muwandira mpiya, nagufira mpiya zaku pamuhera na mota yakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Handa muyagu pakakupanana nguwu yakuwi poni, gwenga gufiruwa guyiwuziyi pamberi pa mshenji kuzyeta, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />toziya yomberi kayifira nguwu imgubiki nakawona mpepu pashiru. Nguwu ayi ndo ya gweka hera kuwera wantu wahushu wawera nazi pawagonja pashiru.”<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Naguntakulira neni makontola, ama kuwapangila mkulu gwa wantu waku.”<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Nagukawa kujega viboga vya kwanja kukamala vyaguvibeniti pamuhera na divayi yaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Hagumlaviyi mwana gwaku mpalu shipanta njira kaweri kwajili ya neni. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Ntambu iraa ayi, hagumlaviyi shipanta njira waku wa shipalu wa wang'ombi na wakondolu waweri kwajili ya neni. Wankanyama awa pawiyuka kala, guwaleki walikali na wankyanyama wamawu wawu kwa mashaka saba. Mulishaka lya nani, guwalaviyi kwaneni kuwera tambiku.”<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Mwenga mwawantu wangu wananagala. Su namuliya vinofu vya nkanyama yakalagwiti na nkanyama mkalipa gwa kuntundu, mwenga vinofu avi mumwasilili ng'ang'a kaliyi.”<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Guwasheri wantu pamuhera na wankanyama teratera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Nagulaviya shisoweru sha upayira kwa wantu. Nagumtanga muntu yoseri yakatenda ukondola kwa kulaviya ukapitawu wa upayira kwa shilii shashilawiriti. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Nagulikolerana pamuhera na shipinga sha wantu yawalihola kutenda vintu vya ukondola. Nagulaviya ukapitawu wa upayira mushisoweru shoseri kwa kuleka unakaka toziya womberi watenda ntambu iraa ayi. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Muntu muhushu pakawera mushizyungu, nagulaviya ukapitawu gwa kumpanana upendelewu toziya yomberi kawera muhushu na gwenga gumwonera lusungu.”<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Pagumwona ng'ombi ama nkanyama punda gwa mngondu gwaku kagamira, gwenga hagumuwuziliri mweni. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Handa pagumwona ng'ombi ama nkanyama punda gwa muntu yakakukalalira gwenga kaguwa pasi kulawirana na shisanka shitopa shakapapiti, nagumleka palii, kumbiti gumtangi.”<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Nagupotuziya shilii shashifiruwa kwa muntu muhushu mumasitaka gakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Gulituli patali na masitaka ga upayira ama kuwalaga wantu yawahera likosa ama walii yawawera na ligoya, toziya neni hapeni numlekeziyi muntu yakawera na ukondola. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Nagufira finda, toziya wakulu yawawanka finda hapeni watendi shilii shashiwera teratera.”<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Namuwagaziya wahenga yawalikala pakati penu. Mwenga muvimana wantu ntambu yawalikala nawu, toziya mwenga muweriti wahenga muisi ya Misri.”<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga lishaka lya Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Gulimi lirambu lyaku na kubenanga viboga kwa mivinja sita. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Kumbiti mushinja sha saba, naguyala shintu shoseri mulirambu layku. Viboga vyavikula pota kuviyala, kuwalekeziyi wantu wahushu wavibenangi na kuviliya. Handa paviwera viboga mulirambu womberi wavibeniti ndiri, gwenga guwalekeziyi wankanyama wa kuntundu waviliyi. Gutendi ntambu iraa ayi mulirambu lyaku lya Mizyabibu pamuhera na mizyetuni.”<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Gwenga guweza kutenda mahengu kwa mashaka sita mukila lijuwa, kumbiti mulishaka lya saba gwoyeri nagutenda lihengu. Mulishaka lya saba guwalekeziyi wankanyama waku yawatenda lihengu na wamanda waku yawalikala pakati pa mwenga viraa woyeri na wanemeleri.”<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Guliloleri weri kutenda kila shintu shanukugambiriti gwenga. Naguwaluwa wamilungu yamonga. Nagugakanta ata matawu gawu.”<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misambu mikulu mitatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Kila shinja gufiruwa guvini misambu mitatu kumpanana neni ligoya. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Msambu gwa kwanja haguweri msambu gwa mabumunda gagalekeruwa ndiri simika. Mvini msambu agu mumwezi gwagupananuwa litawu Abibu. Toziya mumwezi agu mwenga mlawiti muisi ya Misri. Muntu yoseri nakakiza kwa neni mawoku hera.” <verse eid="EXO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Msambu gwa pili haguweri msambu gwa mabenu. Mumsambu agu mwenga hamundaviliri mabenangu ga kwanja kukamala mulirambu lyaku. Na msambu gwa ntatu haguweri msambu gwa visasa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">“Msambu agu haguweri pamumalila kala kubenanga viboga vyenu mumalambu. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Kila shinja mukila msambu, wapalu woseri wafiruwa kujojonika pamuhera kunguwira neni, Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Gwenga pagundavilira tambiku ya nkanyama, nagulaviya mabumunda gagalekeruwa simika. Pagulaviya tambiku gulunguziyi lipaki lya nkanyama lishaka lilaa ali. Naguleka lipaki lisigali mpaka shilawu yakuwi mandawira.”<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Kila shinja gwenga pagubena viboga vyaku, guvijegi viboga vya kwanja mumabenu gaku pahala pagunguwira neni, Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Gwenga pagumlikitula mwana gwa kondolu ama mbuzi, naguteleka vinofu avi mumaweri ga mawu gwakuyi.”<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumintumi gwa Mlungu kankutandira njira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Guloli, neni nankumtuma ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kawalongoleri mwenga na kawaloleri munjira na kuwajega pahala panupatandiriti. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Muliloli weri na kumpikanira neni shilii shanuwagambiriti. Namumlema tembera yomberi hapeni kawalegeziyi kulema kwa mwenga, toziya neni numtuma kwa litawu lyangu. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Kumbiti pampikanira weri shilii shakawagambira na pamtenda goseri gantakula, neni haweri mngongu kwa wangodu wenu na hanuwapingili woseri yawawapingira mwenga. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Ntumintumi gwangu gwa kumpindi hakawalongoleri na kuwajega muisi ya wantu wa Amori na Hiti na Perizi na Kanaani na Hivi na Yebusi, neni hanuwagamaziyi nakamu. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Namuwasuntamalira makukama ama kuwaguwira milungu yawu ama kutenda vitwatira vyawu. Kumbiti hamuwagamiziyi nakamu wamlungu wawu na kubomolanga vitalawanda vyawu vya kutambikira vya mabuwi.<verse eid="EXO 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Mwenga hamunguwiri neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu. Handa pamtenda hangu, hanuwatekeleri kwa kuwapanana viboga pamuhera na mashi, haniwaponiziyi malweli. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Kwahera mdala muisi yako hakaweri na wana shakapanu wana wahowi, viraa hapeni kuweri na mdala mpendi. Neni haniwapanani mwenga mulikali mashaka matangala.”<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Hanuwatendi wantu walii yawawakalalira mwenga waweri na lyoga kwaneni. Viraa hanuwatendi wantu walii yamulikoma ngondu nawu washashatiki. Shakapanu hanuwatendi womberi wawuyi kumbeli na kutuga. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Hanuwajegi manondola kulongolu kwa mwenga wawawingi wantu wa Hivi na Kanaani na Hiti. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Hapeni nuwawusiyi wantu awa woseri mushinja shimu, isi naisigala hera, wankanyama wa kuntundu hawawongereki na mwenga hapeni muwezi kuwakanka. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Kumbiti hanuwawusiyi kidogu hanuwawusiyi mpaka mwenga pamumwongereka na kulikala kila pahala muisi ayi. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />Hantendi mipaka ya isi ya mwenga yongereki kulawa mubahari ya Shamu uwega wa kusika mpaka mubahari ya Meditereniyani uwega wa kushana. Na kwanjira shiwala sha Sinayi uwega wa kusika na kwaguzyeta mshenji mpaka mulushemba lwa Eufulati muisi ya uwega wa kushana na kwagulawa mshenji. Haniwapanani makakala ga kuwawinga wantu yawalikala kulii, su muweri na isi nkulu. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Namtenda lipatanu lyoseri nawomberi, ama na milungu yawu. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Namuwalekeziya womberi walikali muisi yenu, womberi nawiza kuwatenda mwenga mtendi vidoda kwa neni. Handa mwenga pamuwaguwira wamlungu yawu, mwenga hapeni muwezi kushapira kuwaguwira womberi na kutenda vidoda.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankulijimira lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gwizi kwaneni kulugongu alu, gwenga na Aruni pamuhera na Nadabu na Abiwu wana wa Aruni. Viraa guwatoli wakulu malongu saba wa wantu wa Israeli. Pamuhera mwankali patali kidogu kusoka palugongu, mwenga munguwiri. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Musa, hanukulekeziyi gweka yaku kwiza pakwegera na neni. Wamonga yaguwera nawu nawiza pakwegera, wantu wamonga woseri yawasigaliti nawasegelera pakwegera na lugongu alu.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Musa kagenditi na kuwagambira wantu woseri kila shintu shakagambirituwi na galii gakalagalirituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. Wantu woseri wamwankuliti pawalonga, “Twenga hatutendi kila shintu shakatugambiriti na kutulagalira Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Shakapanu Musa kalembiti kila shintu shakalagalirituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Mandawira shilawu yakuwi, Musa kanyawiti kwa mabuwi pahala pa kutambikira palwanjira lugongu. Viraa yomberi kagagolosiyiti mabuwi lilongu na mbili kulawirana na viyiwuku lilongu na mbili vya Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Shakapanu kawatumiti wantemba wa wantu wa Isaraeli, su womberi walaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziya na kulaviya tambiku ya mwana gwa ng'ombi kuwera tambiku ya ponga kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa katoliti mwazi gumu gwa wankanyama yakawalikituliti na kugutula muviwiga. Na mwazi gwingi kitiriti pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Shakapanu katoliti shintola shilii shakashilembiti kila shintu shakagambirituwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, su kagabetuliti kwa liziwu, uganu wantu woseri pawapikanira. Su wantu woseri walongiti, “Twenga hatugatendi goseri Mtuwa Mlungu gakatugambiriti. Twenga hatujimiri kila shintu.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Su Musa katoliti mwazi gulii gwagusigaliti muviwiga na kuwamishira wantu. Yomberi kalongiti, “Agu ndo mwazi gwa lipatanu Mtuwa Mlungu kalitenditi pamuhera na mwenga pakawapananiti malagaliru aga.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Shakapanu Musa na Aruni na Nadabu na Abiwu pamuhera na wakulu malongu saba wa wantu wa Israeli, womberi wakweniti kulugongu, <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />na wamwoniti Mlungu, ulii wantu wa Israeli yawamguwira. Mumagulu gakuyi kaweriti na shintu shashinyawitwi kwa madini ga mabuwi ga beyi nkulu gagashemuwa samawati, ilangalira ndaa gambira lyera paliwera lyahera mahundi. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Mlungu kawatenduwiti ndiri wakulu walii wa wantu wa Israeli. Womberi wamwoniti Mlungu, waliyiti na kulanda! Shakapanu womberi woseri waseleriti kulawa kulugongu.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kapalugongu lwa Sinayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gwizi kwaneni kayi palugomgu alu. Paguwera uganu, hanikupanani mabuwi mawili gagasonguluwa na mukila libuwi nulilemba malagaliru goseri ganukupanana gwenga kuwafunda wantu wa Israeli.” <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Su Musa kagenditi pamuhera na Joshuwa ntumintumi gwakuyi, kukwena kulugongu kulongolu kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Yomberi pakawagambiriti kala walii wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli, “Mulikali panu pamuhera na wantu wamonga mpaka pambuya aku! Namulyaluwa Aruni pamuhera na Huri hawaweri pamuheri na mwenga. Muntu yoseri pakawera na shitwatira shoseri, kagendi kwa wantu awa wawili.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Musa pakagenditi kulugongu, lihundi ligubikiti lugongu. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Ukwisa wa Mtuwa Mlungu usulukiti palugongu na kulugubika kwa mashaka sita. Mulishaka lya saba, Mtuwa Mlungu kamshemiti Musa kulawa pakati pa lihundi. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Kwa wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti wankulola palugongu, ukwisa wa Mtuwa Mlungu uweriti gambira motu mkulu gwaguweriti gwankwaka kulii. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa kingiriti pakati pa lihundi lilii palugongu. Yomberi kaweriti kulii kwa mashaka alubayini.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Malaviwu kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:4-9">Kulawa 35:4-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli wanjegeri neni malaviwu. Gwenga haguwanki malaviwu kwajili ya neni kulawa kwa kila muntu yakalaviya kwa moyu. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Aga ndo malaviwu gagugenda kugawanka kulawa kwa womberi. Haguwanki madini ga zahabu na feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />sufi ya buluu na zambalawu na njeri, nguwu ya nfufu iyerepa na mibayira ya mbuzi, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />lukuli lya kondolu gwa shipalu zyazitulitwi langi nsheri, lukuli za mbuzi na mbawu za mtera gwa mjohoru, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />lipaki kwajili ya shikoluboyi, viungu kwajili ya lipaki lya kuvityeka vintu viweri kwajili ya Mlungu, viraa kwajili ya ubani yauwera na ununkira uherepa, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />mabuwi ga beyi nkulu yagashemuwa sadoniki pamuhera na mabuwi gamonga ga beyi nkulu kwajili ya malembu malembu ga shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa sha lihabiti lya Mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Shakapanu wantu wa Israeli wanyawiri neni Liringu Linanagala, su wezi kulikala pamuhera na womberi. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Womberi wanyawiri Liringu ali pamuhera na vintu vyakuwi ntambu yang'enda kuwalanguziya.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya lipatanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli wanyawi lisandiku lya mbawu za mitera ya mjohoru, lisanduku ali liweri na utali wa sentimita miya na lilongu, upana wakuyi sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Hagulityelemeki lisandiku ali madini ga zahabu iyerepa mkati na kunja, su gulinyawiri ukingu wa zahabu wega zoseri. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Shakapanu mnyawi bangili za msheshi za zahabu na kuzitula mumagulu mwa lisanduku ali, kila ligulu gutuli bangili yimu. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Hagunyawi mipiku ya mjohoro na kuyityasiya zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />na mipiku hayi utaipitiziya pakati pa peti zyaziweri pandi mbili za lisanduki. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Honga azi za kupapira hazisigali shaka shoseri muzibangili zilii. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Mkati mwa lisandiku ali hagutuli mabuwi galii gagasongulituwi na gagalembituwi malagaliru gangu.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />Gunyawi mfiniku gwa kugubika lisanduku kwa zahabu iherepa, mfiniku agu haguweri pahala pa kulekeziya wantu vidoda vyawu. Mfiniku agu haguweri na utali wa sentimita miya na lilongu, upana wakuyi sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Viraa hagunyawi kwa zahabu mfanu wa viwumbi vikomu wawili vyaviwera na mbapatiru, guwatuli muupeleru mwa mfiniku gwa lisanduku lilii. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Shiwumbi yumu upeleru umu na shiwumbi shamonga kaweri upereru wamonga. Guvituli viwumbi avi muupeleru mwa mfiniku agu kumbiti guvinyawi pavilimamatila pamuhera na mfiniku agu. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Viwumbi avi havilolani na mbambatiru zawu zigubutuka pawalolana. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Gufintiki mfiniku agu palisanduku ali na gutuli mabuwi galii mawili mulisanduku ali lya lipatanu, mabuwi galii ganukupanana gwenga. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Neni haniliwoni nagwenga panu, kulawa pampindi pa shigoda ashi sha kulekeziya pakati pa viwumbi yawawera pampindi pa lisandiku lya mapatanu, hanyoweri nagwenga na kukupanana malagaliru goseri kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda sha mabumunda gananagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />Gunyawi shitalawanda sha mbawu za mtera gwa mjohoru, utali wakuyi sentimita malongu nani na nani na upana wakuyi sentimita malongu msheshi na msheshi na utali kugenda kumpindi sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Shitalawanda ashi washigubiki kwa madini ga zahabu na muupeleru mwakuyi wazyengeti kwa lwiniku lwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Viraa gunyawi shipandi sha mbawu kuzyengeta shitalawanda, shipandi ashi shiweri na utali kugenda kumpindi senitmeta malongu sita na sita na gushityelemeki zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Hagunyawi peti za msheshi za zahabu na kuzitula muwega zakuyi mumagulu gakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Peti azi haziweri pakwegera na shipandi sha mbawu shilii shashizyengeta shitalawanda na hazikoleri mibiki ilii ya kupapira shitalawanda ashi. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Hagunyawi mibiki ya mtera gwa mjohoru na kutyemeleka kwa zahabu, mibiki ayi hayiweri ya kupapira shitalawanda ashi. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Viraa guwagambiri womberi wanyawi sahani na vikombi na viwiga na mabakuli vyavitulwa na watambika pawawitira divayi kuntavilira neni. Womberi wafiruwa wavinyawi kwa zahabu iherepa. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Shitalawanda ashi hagushituli kulongolu kwa lisanduku lya lipatanu, panani pashitalawanda ashi hagutuli mabumunda mananagala, shaka shoseri.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shintambi sha shikoluboyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />Hagunyawi shintambi sha shikoluboyi kwa zahabu iherepa, shikaliru shakuyi na mpanda yakuwi havinyawiwi kwa kuponda kuwera shintu shimu. Ntambu iraa ayi vikombi vyakutulila lipaki na vitumba vya uluwa pamuhera na uluwa vyavilembiziya muvintambi vya vikoluboyi, shikaliru na mpanda havipondwi kuwera shintu shimu shikoluboyi sha zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Vintambi sita vyaviwera mumpanda ilii, vimpanda vitatu vya uwega umu na vimpanda vitatu uwega umonga. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Mushila shintambi hakuweri vikombi vitatu mfanu wa uluwa yaushemuwa mlozi, kila shintambi hashiweri na shitumba shakuyi na uluwa wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Mumpanda hakuweri na vikombi vyamsheshi mfanu wa uluwa gwa mlozi, pamuhera na fifundu vyakuyi na uluwa wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Kila uwega hakuweri na shitumba shimu mukila shintambi. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Vikonyu avi pamuhera na vintambi vyakuyi, haviweri shintu shimu na shintambi sha shikoluboyu ashi hashinyawiwi kwa zahabu iherepa. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Hagunyawi viraa vikoluboyi saba toziya ya shitambi ashi na kuvitula pashintambi ashi kulangalira kulongolu. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Viraa gunyawi kwa zahabu iherepa, vibaniru vya kuwusilira utambi wa shikoluboyi na sahani zakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Hagutumii kilu malongu matatu na muhanu za zahabu iyerepa kunyawira shintambi ashi na vintu vyakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Guloli weri kuwera womberi wakunyawa vintu avi kulawirana na galii ganukulagalira kulugongu kulii.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kulawa 36:8-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />Guwagambiri wantu wanyawi Liringu Linanagala kwa mapaziya lilongu ya nguwu nfufu. Mapaziya aga ganyawiwi kwa nguwu ya langi ya buluu na ya zambarawu na ya nsheri. Mapaziya aga hagugasoni kwa kugalembiziya pisha ya viwumbi virii vyaviwera na mbapatiru. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Kila lipaziya haliweri na utali wa futi malongu msheshi na mbili na upana wakuyi hauweri futi sita. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Hagugakolaniziyi mapaziya muhanu gaweri shipandi sha kwanja sha lipaziya na mapaziya gamonga muhanu gaweri shipandi sha pili. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Hagusoneri vitanzi vya buluu muluwuniku lwa kumbwega mwa shipandi sha lipaziya lya kwanja, viraa hagusoneri vitanzi vyamonga walanga ilaa ilii muluwiniku mwa lipaziya lya pili. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Haguvituli vitanzi lilongu muhanu mulipaziya limu na vitanzi vimonga lilongu muhanu kuluseperu lwa lipaziya lya pili, vipandi vyoseri vielekiani. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Hagunyawi kulabu muhanu za zahabu su kuwunganishiya virii vya mapaziya, hangu lihema haliweri shintu shimu.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />Viraa guwagambiri antu wanyawi mifiniku liringu linanagala kwa mapaziya lilongu na limu lyalisonuwa kwa mibayira ya wambuzi. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Kila lipaziya haliweri na utali wa futi malongu msheshi na muhanu, upana wakuyi futi sita. Mapaziya aga lilongu na limu hagaweri na shipimu shilaa shilii. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Hagusoni kugakolaniziya mapaziya muhanu pamuhera, viraa mapaziya sita gugakolaniziyi pamuhera. Lipaziya lya sita hagulimindi mala mbili kulongolu kwa liringu linnanagala. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Shakapanu hagunyawi vitanzi lilongu muhanu mumwiniku mwa lipaziya lya lupereru lya shipandi sha kwanja, na vitanzi lilongu muhanu mmwiniku mwa lipaziya lya shipandi sha pili. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Hagunyawi vigoweru malongu muhanu ga shaba na kuziyingiziya muvitanzi malongu muhanu su kuvikolera pamuhera vipandi virii viwili vya mapaziya na kutenda liweri lipaziya limu. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Nusu lya lipaziya lyalisigaliti hagulikoweki uwega wa kumbeli wa liringu. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Nusu mita ya utali wa mapaziya yagasigaliti haguimindi kugakoweka wega mbili za liringu lyaligubikituwi.<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />Viraa hagunyawi mfiniku umonga wa liringu, mfiniku agu hagunyawiwi kwa lukuli inama lya kondolu gwa shipalu na lukuli inama lya mbuzi.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />Hagunyawi fulemu za mbawu za mtera gwa mjohoru zyakuvigolusiya kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Kila fulemu hayiweri na utali wa mita msheshi na upana wakuyi hauweri sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Kila fulemu hashiweri na mbawu mbili zyazisongoka. Mbawu azi zyakukolaniziya haziweri pasi pa kila shizingiti. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Gunyawi fulemu ntambu ayi. Fulemu malongu mawili uwega wa kusika kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />na vikaliru vya madini ga feza, viweri malongu masheshi pasi pa vizingiti avi ishilini, su vikaliru viwili viweri pasi pa fulemu shamonga. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Uwega wa kushana mwa liringu linanagala, hagunyawi fulemu za mbawu malongu mawili, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />vikalilu vyakuwi malongu msheshi, viweri vya madini ga feza, vikalilu viwili viweri pasi pa kila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala, uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji, gunyawi fulemu sita. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Viraa guwagambiri wantu wanyawi fulemu zimonga mbili, kila yimu muupeleru wakuyi yauwera muliringu linanagala, hayitangi kulikolera Liringu ali kumbeli. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Fulemu azi za kumbwega zilekani pasi, kumbiti zilikonaliziyi kwa kumpindi mupeti za kwanja. Fulemu zoseri vya kumbwega zitendwi ntambu iraa ayi su ziweri na pembi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Su hakuweri na fulemu nani pamuhera na vikalilu viwili pasi pa fulemu yamonga.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />Hagunyawi migomba ya mtera gwa mjoholu, migomba muhanu kwajili ya mbawu za uwega umu wa Liringu Linanagala <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />migomba muhanu kwajili ya uwega umonga wa Liringu Linanagala, migomba muhanu hayiweri kwa fulemu yaziwera uwega wa kushana mwa Liringu Linanagala na migomba muhanu imonga hayiweri uwega wa kusika na migomba muhanu hayiweri mufulemu za kulongolu mwa Liringu Linanagala, uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Guwagambiri wazitawalili pamuhera mbawu zyazilikolerana pamuhera zyazilawira uwega wa kushana na kusika na kwaguzyeta mshenji upeleru wumu na upeleru umonga mwa Liringu Linanagala, <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Fulemu zoseri haguzityelemeki zahabu na kutulira peti za zahabu zyazikolera migomba ayi, migomba ayi haguyityelemeki zahabu viraa. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Hangu hangunyawi Liringu ali kulinganira na mfanu yanukulanguziyiti kuligongu.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />Hagulipoti lipaziya limonga lya ubunda wa langi ya buluu na zambarawu na nsheri na nfufu yayipotitwi. Lipaziya ali hagulisoni kwa kulilembiziya pisha ya viwumbi walii wakomu yawawera na mbapatiru. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Lipaziya ali hagulikoweki mumpanda za msheshi zyazinyawiwa kwa mtera gwa mjohoru na kuzityemeleka zahabu. Mpanda azi haziweri na vikoweru vya zahabu pampindi. Vikalilu vyakuwi haviweri vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Hagulikoweki lipaziya ali muvikoweru, shakapanu gulijegi mkati Llisanduku lya Lipatanu lyaliwera na mabuwi galii mawili, kumbeli kwa lipaziya ali. Mkati mwa Liringi Linanagala, lipaziya ali halituli gweka Pahala pananagala na Pahala nanagala netu. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Gutuli mfiniku yagushemuwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda, pampindi pa Lisandiku lya Lipatanu Pahala pananagala nentu. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Pahala pananagala hagutuli shitalawanda sha mabumunda mananagala uwega wa kushana, viraa hagutuli shintambi sha vikoluboyi pakwegera na shitalawanda uwega wa kusika Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />Guwagambiri womberi wanyawi lipaziya litopa lya ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. Hawanyawi kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambarawu na nsheri na nfufu na kusonwa weri. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Viraa virii hagunyawi mpanda muhanu za mtera gwa mjohoru na kuzityemeleka zahabu. Mpanda azi haziweri na vikoweku vya zahabu, kila mpanda hayiweri na shikalilu sha madini ga feza.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda sha kutambikira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />Hagunyawi shintu gambira lisanduku utali na upana uweri teratera kwa mbawu za mtera gwa mjohoru, lyaliwera shitalawanda sha kutambikira. Hashiweri sha pembi za msheshi, utali wakuyi mita mbili na lobu, na upana wakuyi mita mbili na lobu, utali wakuyi kugenda kumpindi hashiweri mita yimu na lobu. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Mukila pembi ya shitalawanda ashi, hagunyawi magoli yawunyauwa kulawirirana na shitalawanda sheni. Shitalawanda shoseri hagushityelemeki madini ga shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Hagunyawi viwiga vya kutulila malivu na sepetu na mabakuli na mabeseni ga kutolera motu. Vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri haguvinyawi kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Shakapanu hagunyawi wavu wa shaba yauwera na peti zyamsheshi za shaba mupembi zyakuwi msheshi. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Wavu awu haguwutuli muukingu pasi mushitalawanda sha kutambikira su ufiki nusu ya shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Hagunyawi viraa mipiku ya mtera gwa mjohoru ga kupapira shitalawanda sha kutambikira, mipiku ayi haguityemeleki madini ga shaba, <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />na mipiku ayi guiyingiziyi muzilii peti kila uwega wa shitalawanda sha kutambikira shaka sha kushipapa. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Hagunyawi kwa mbawu shitalawanda sha kutambikira, shiweri na livungu mkati, kulawirana na mfanu yagunukulanguziyiti kulugongu.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdamu gwa Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />Hagunyawi mdamu gwa liringu Linanagala. Uwega wa kusika wa mdamu hakuweri na vyandaluwa vyavinyawituwi kwa nguwu mfufu iyerepa yayipotituwi, yeni hayiweri na utali wa meta malongu msheshi na msheshi kwa uwega gumu. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Mapaziya aga agakoleruwi na mpanda malongu mawili ga shaba, vyaviwera na vikaliru vya shaba. Kumbiti vikwambikwambi vya mpanda azi pamuhera na vikoweku vyakuwi haviweri vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Ntambu iraa ayi uwega wa kushana, utali wa lipaziya hauweri meta malongu msheshi na msheshi, mpanda zakuwi malongu mawili ga shaba, kumbiti vikwambikwambi vya mpanda na vikoweku vyakuwi haviweri vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji kwa mdamu, hakuweri na lipaziya lyaliwera na utali meta malongu mawili na mbili, mpanda zyakuwi lilongu pamuhera na vikaliru vyakuwi lilongu. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji kwakuwera na ligomi, mdamu hauweri na upana wa meta malongu mawili na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Lipaziya lya uwega gumu wa mlyangu haliweri na upana wa mita sita na nusu, pamuhera na mpanda tatu na vikaliru vyakuwi vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Viraa virii muwega wa pili muligomi, lipaziya haliweri meta sita na nusu, pamuhera na mpanda tatu na vikaliwu vyakuwi vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Ligomi lya mdamu haliweri na lipaziya lyaliwera na utali meta tisa, lyalinyawitwi kwa nguwu mfufu iyerepa na kulembwa kwa langi ya buluu na zambarawu na nsheri. Lipaziya ali halikolerwi kwa mpanda za msheshi zyaziwera na vikaliru vya msheshi. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Mpanda zoseri kuzyengeta mdamu hazikolaniziwi kwa vikwambikwambi vya madini ga feza, vikaliru vyakuwi haviweri za madini ga shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Mdamu agu haguweri na utali wa meta malongu msheshi na msheshi, upana wa meta malongu msheshi na msheshi. Mapaziya gakuyi hagaweri ga nguwu mfufu iyerepa na vikaliru vyakuwi haviweri vya madini ga shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Vyombu vyoseri vyavitenderuwa Muliringu Linanagala na mumdamu, pamuhera na vigingi vyoseri haviweri vya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipaki lya vikoloboyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />Haguwagambiri wantu wa Israeli wakujegeri lipaki liherepa nentu kwajili ya vikoloboyi, kuweri na shikoloboyi yashiyaka mashaka goseri. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Muliringu Linanagala, kunja kwa lipaziya, kulongolu kwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawashiloleri weri shikoloboyi shashiyaka kulongolu kwaneni kwanjira pamihi mpaka mandawira. Lilagaliru ali haliweri lya wana woseri wa Israeli, shiyiwuku na shiyiwuku.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Nguwu za watambika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 39:1-7">Kulawa 39:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />Guwashemi Aruni mlongu gwaku pamuhera na Nadabu na Abiwu na Eleazari na Itamali wana wakuyi. Gwenga haguwasyaguli womberi kulawa pakati pa wantu wa Israeli, su wantenderi neni gambira watambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Gwenga hagumsoneri mlongu gwaku Aruni mahabiti mananagala yampanani ukwisa na ligoya. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Guwalagaliri wantu yawamana kusona nguwu, walii yaniwapananiti mahala ga kutenda hangu, su wamumnyawiri Aruni mahabiti ga kumtenda kawoneki mtambika yanimsyaguliti. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Guwagambiri wasoni vintu avi, shihaku sha pashifuwa na shipandi sha nguwu ndidini sha kugubika shifuwa na kanzu na lihabiti lyalilembeziwitwi, viraa shilemba na lufunga lukulu. Aruni mlongu gwaku pamuhera na wana wakuyi, hawavali su wantenderi lihengu lya watambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Wantu yawasona nguwu awa hawatenderi nguwu ya zahabu na ya langi ya buluu na ya zambarawu na ya nsheri na wa ubunta wa zahabu na nguwu nfufu yaisonituwi.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shizibawu sha mtambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />Mafundi hawashinyawi shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa sha mtambika kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambarwu na nsheri na nguwu nfufu yaisonuwa na kuilembeziya. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Shipandi sha nguwu ashi hashiweri na ngoyi mbili kutawalira mumakombi. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Ngoyi za kushikolera shipandi sha nguwu ashi hazisonwi kwa vintu viraa virii. Womberi hawatenderi ubunta wa zahabu na nguwu ya buluu na zambarawu na nsheri na nguwu nfufu yainyaituwi na kuwera shintu shimu mushipandi sha nguwu ashi.<verse eid="EXO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />Shakapanu hagutoli mabuwi mawili ga madini ga beyi nkulu gagashemuwa saridoniki, mabuwi aga hagugalembi matawu lilongu na mbili ga wana wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Matawu gaweri ntambu yawiyukiti, matawu sita gugalembi mulibuwi limu na matawu sita gamonga gugalembi mulibuwi lyamonga. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Hagugalembi matawu aga kwa kugasongola mumabuwi aga gambira msongola vintu ntambu yakasongola shimaniziru. Shakapanu gugatuli muvikoleru vyavinyawitwi kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Mabuwi aga mawili hagatawaliruwi mumkanda gwa mumakombi kuwera liholu kwa viyiwuku lilongu na mbili vya Israeli. Su Aruni hakavali matawu aga viyiwuku avi mumakombi gakuyi gaweri liholu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Hagunyawi kwa zahabu vintu viwili vya kutulira mabuwi aga, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikufu miwili ya zahabu iherepa yayipotituwi gambira lugoyi, haguyitawi muvitulilu vya mabuwi aga.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhaku gwa pashifuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />Guwagambiri mafundi wanyawi muhaku mnanagala toziya ya Aruni kavali pashifuwa shakuyi. Muhaku agu hagunyawiruwi kwa vintu viraa virii ntambu yainyawituwi shizibawu. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Muhaku agu wega zakuyi zoseri za msheshi hazilinganiri, utali wakuyi haguweri sentimita malongu mawili na mbili, upana wakuyi haguweri sentimita malongu mawili na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Muhaku agu hagulembeziwi mumisitari ya msheshi ya mabuwi ga madini ga beyi nkulu. Msitari gwa kwanja haguweri na mabuwi ga beyi nkulu gagashemuwa akiki na topazi na alimasi nsheri, <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />msitari gwa pili haguweri na mabuwi gagashemuwa zumaridi na yakuti samawati na alimasi. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />Msitali gwa ntatu haguweri na mabuwi gagashemuwa yasintu na akiki nsheri na ametisitu, <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />msitali gwa msheshi haguweri na mabuwi gagashemuwa zabarajadi na shohamu na yasipi, goseri aga hagatuluwi muvitulilu vya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Su hapaweri na mabuwi lilongu na mbili yagalembwa matawu lilongu na mbili ga wana wa Israeli. Kila libuwi limu haliweri gambira shimaniziru, kulanguziya viyiwuku lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />Kwajili ya muhaku hagu gwa pashifuwa hagunyawi mikufu ya zahabu iyerepa yayipotitwi gambira lugoyi. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Viraa virii hagunyawi peti mbili za zahabu na kuzitula muukingu mwa muhaku hagu pashifuwa, <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />na mikufu miwili ya zahabu guitawi mupeti mbili za muhaku gwa pashifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Zilii kingu mbili za mkufu wa zahabu haguzikolaniziyi muvituliru virii vilikoli pamuhera na shipandi shilii sha mumakombi sha shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa sha uwega wa kulongolu. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Viraa hagunyawi peti mbili za zahabu na kuzitula kweni incha mbili za pasi uwega wa mgati mwa mhaku wa pashifuwa pakwegera na shizibawu. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Hagunyawi peti zimonga mbilizya zahabu na kuzituli palongolu muicha za pasi za vipandi vya shizibawu, maala shizibawu pashiwunganika na mkanda wawupotitwi kwa unakaka. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Mhaku wa pashifuwa hashitawi kweni shizibawu kwa kutawilwa peti zyakuwi na shizibawu kwa lugoyi lwa langi ya buluwu, su muhaku agu wa pashifuwa nashiyopoki ndiri su shikaliri gulii mkanda wagupotitwi kwa unakaka.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />Aruni pakingira Pahala Pananagala, yomberihakavali muhaku gwa matakuliru ga kutoza shashilembiziwa matawu ga wana wa Israeli, kwantambu ayi neni Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni niwalyaluwi mwenga nakamu. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Mumuhaku agu hagutuli mabuwi ga utoza gadyengeziyi pashifuwa pa Aruni kila pakiza kulongolu kwaneni. Mushaka ashi kila mala yomberi hakaweri pakavala muhaku agu, su kawezi kugamana galii ganfira kuusu wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguwu zyamonga za watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />Hagunyawi lihabiti lya kuvalira shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa kwa ubunta kulawa mumibaila ya wakondolu yaulekerwa langi ya buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Hayiweri na lupenyu lwa kupitiziya mtuwi pakati, lupenyu alu haluzyengetiruwi luwiniku su naludegeka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Muukosi wakuyi wa pasi, kuzyengeta wega zoseri hazilembiziwi kwa makomamanga ga langi ya buluu na ya zambalawu na ya nsheri na hakuweri viraa na viyoyu vya zahabu pakati pa makomamanga aga. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Pakati pa kila lilembiziwu, womberi hawatawi shiyoyu sha zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Aruni pakingira Pahala Pananagala Muliringu Linanagala kutenda lihengu lya utambika, viyoyu havigombi pakagendagenda. Ntambu ayi hayilanguziyi kuwera yomberi kahowa ndiri.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />Guwagambiri wanyawi shibati sha zahabu iherepa na kulemba visoweru avi, mnanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Shibati ashi hagushitawi palongolu pa shilemba lugoyi lwa buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Aruni hakashivali shibati ashi pasheni shakuwi, mushibati ashi hakatoli ukondola wa yawautenditi wantu wa Israeli pawandaviliti tambiku nanagala, su neni hanizijimiri tambiku zawu. <verse eid="EXO 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />Hagumnyawiri Aruni lihabiti liherepa lya nguwu iherepa na kumgubika shilemba sha nguwu iherepa na mkanda guherepa.<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />Haguwanyawiri wana wa Aruni mahabiti na mifunga na kofia su woneki wawera na ukwisa na uherepa. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Hagumvalisiyi mlongu gwaku Aruni na wana wakuyi nguwu azi, shakapanu guwaswagi lipaki na kuwatulila mawoku su kuwatula kwajili ya lihengu lyangu, wantenderi gambira watambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Viraa haguwasoneri kaputula, su kugubika shivula shawu. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawavali kaputula azi kila pawingira Muliringu Linanagala, ama pawawera pakwegera na sitalawanda sha kutambikira, kutenda utenderu wa shitambika Mupahala Pananagala. Su kwa ntambu ayi hapeni walanguziyi shivula shawu na kuwera muukondola na kulaguwa. Lilagaliru ali haliweri lya mashaka goseri kwa Aruni pamuhera na viyiwuku vyakuwi.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga kuwatyeka Aruni na wana wakuyi kuwera watambika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 8:1-36">Walawi 8:1-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />Havi ndo vitwatira vyagugenda kuwatendera Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi su kuwatyeka watendi lihengu kulongolu kwangu gambira watambika. Hagutoli mwana gwa ng'ombi gwa shipalu pamuhera na wakondolu wa shipalu wawili yawahera shidoda shoseri. <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />Hagutoli viraa mabumunda yagalekeruwa ndiri simika, maandazi yagalekeruwa ndiri simika, kumbiti galii yagatemelekuwa lipaki. Vyoseri vinyawiwi kwa ubumu unama gwa nganu. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Shakapanu gugatuli mabumunda aga mulijamanda limu na gundavilili shaka shimu pamuhera na mwana gwa ng'ombi gwa shipalu ulii na wakondolu wa shipalu wawili.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />Shakapanu guwajegi Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi paligomi lwa Liringu Linanagala na kuwapunga. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Su hagutoli nguwu zilii za utambika na gumvalisiyi Aruni, lihabiti na kanzu na shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa na shifuku sha pashifuwa na gumtawi mkanda gulii yagusonuwa weri. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Kayi hagumvalisiyi shilemba shilii mumtuwi na kutula pashilemba shibati shilii sha zahabu shashilembitwi mnanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Hagutoli lipaki, gumumiminiri Aruni pamtuwi pakuwi, kumtyeka katendi lihengu lyangu. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Haguwajegi wana wa Aruni na kuwavalisiya vipandi vya nguwu vya shati ndali nsheli igubika shifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />Guwatawi lufunga mushunu mwawu na kuwavalisiya kofia zawu. Ntambu ayi haguwatyeki Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kuwera watambika. Womberi hawaweri watambika shaka shoseri.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />Shakapanu hagumjegi mwana gwa ng'ombi ulii kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawatuli mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ulii <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />na kumlikitula kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Hagutoli shyasi sha mwazi na kuityemeleka mupembi za shitalawanda sha kutambikira kwa shyala shaku, na mwazi yagusigala haguguwitiri pasi pa shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Shakapanu hagutoli lipaki lyoseri lyaligubikira utumbu, semu iherepa matoga pamuhera na figu mbili na lipaki lyakuyi, guvilunguziyi vyoseri pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Kumbiti shinofu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi ayu pamuhera na lukuli lyakuyi na mavi gakuyi, haguvitoli na kuvulunguziya kunja kwa kambi ya mwenga. Ayi hayiweri tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda vyenu.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />Shakapanu hagumtoli yumu gwa wakondolu walii wa shipalu na kumgambira Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watuli mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ulii. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Su gwenga hagumlikituli na mwazi gwakuyi hagugumishiri mushitalawanda sha kutambikira wega zakuwi zoseri. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Hagumlikituli nanyama ulii vipandi vipandi, hagugululi utumbu wakuyi na magulu gakuyi, guvituli vyoseri pamuhera na mtuwi na vipandi vyamonga. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Shakapanu hagumlunguziyi kondolu ulii pashitalawanda sha kutambikira su kundavilira tambiku ya kulunguziya, ununkira wa tambiku yailaviwa kwa motu hainherepeziyi neni Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />Hagumtoli kondolu ulii yumonga, Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawatuli mawoku gawu pamtuwi gwa nkanyama ulii. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Su gwenga hagumlikituli na kutola shyasi sha mwazi na kumswaga Aruni mukingu ga makutu gawu ga kumliwu na muvyala vikulu vya mawoku gawu ga kumliwu na muvyala vikulu vya magulu gawu ga kumliwu. Mwazi yagusigala haguumishiri pashitalawanda sha kutambikira muwega zakuwi zoseri. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Shakapanu hagutoli shyasi sha mwazi yaiweri pashitalawanda sha kutambikira pamuhera na lipaki lilii gumumishiri Aruni na nguwu zakuwi, guwamishiri viraa wana wakuyi na nguwu zawu. Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawaweri watyekuwa pamuhera na nguwu zawu zoseri.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />Viraa hagutoli lipaki lya kondolu ulii gwa shipalu na mshira gwakuyi na lipaki lyaligubika utumbu na semu iherepa ya matoga na figu zakuwi mbili pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi na liwondu lya kumliwu. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Yagalekeruwa ndiri simika kulongolu nkwa neni Mtuwa Mlungu, hagutoli libumunda limu na liandazi limu lyalilekeruwa lipaki na libumunda linama limu. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Vyoseri avi hagumpanani Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi na womberi hawavinyasuli kumpindi kuwera lilangaliru lya kundavilira tambiku neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Shakapanu haguvitoli kayi kulawa mumawoku mwawu na kuvilunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira pamuhera na tambiku ilii ya kulunguziya, su viweri ununkira uherepa yaugenda kunherepeziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu. Ayi iwera tambiku yailaviluwa kwa motu.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />Shakapanu hagutoli shidali sha kondolu ulii wa kumtula kwajili ya kumtula Aruni kwajili ya lihengu lyaneni, na kutenda lilangaliru lya kundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu. Ashi hashiweri semu yawu. <verse eid="EXO 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />Mtambika pawamtyeka kwajili ya lihengu lya neni, shidari na lihondu lya kondolu gwa shipalu gwa kutekuwa, havijeguwi na kutuluwa kwajili ya lihengu lyaneni kuloongolu kwaneni kwa kutenda lilangaliru lya kundavilira, vyeni haviweri vya Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Su wantu wa Israeli mashaka goseri hawatoli semu hazi kulawa mutambiku zawu za ponga zawandavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu na nkumpanana Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi. Ayi hayiweri tambiku yawu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />Pa kuhowa Aruni, nguwu zyakuwi nanagala hawapananuwi wayuwuka wakuyi, su womberi hawazivali lishaka lawu lya kutekuwa na kutuliluwa mawoku. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Mwana gwa Aruni yakawera mtambika pahala pa tati gwakuyi, hakavali nguwu azi lishaka lya saba kutenda lihengu Muliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />Hagutoli shinofu sha kondolu ulii gwa kutekuwa na kuiteleka mupahala papawera Pananagala. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Shakapanu haguwapanani Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, na womberi hawaliyi paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, pamuhera na mabumunda gagasigaliti mulijamanda. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Womberi hawaviliyi vintu vyavitendirituwi kutekuwa kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, kumbiti muntu gwingi nakalekeziwa kuviliya toziya viwera vinanagala. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Handa vinofu vyoseri ama mabumunda aga pagasigala mpaka mandawira, su hagugalunguziyi kwa motu, nawaviliya toziya viwera vinanagala.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />Ntambu ayi haguwatenderi Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kulawirana na galii ganukulagaliriti, haguwatyeki kwa mashaka saba, <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Kila lishaka hagulaviyi ng'ombi gwa shipalu kaweri tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda su kutenda ukolaniziwu, kwa kutenda hangu hagushipungi shitalawanda sha kutambikira, shakapanu hagumishiri lipaki kushityeka. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Kwa mashaka saba hagushitenderi shitalawanda na kushityeka. Pa aga shitalawanda hashiweri shinanagala nentu na shoseri shashishinkula hashiweri shinanagala.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku za kila lishaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />Kila lishaka shaka shoseri shashiza, hagulaviliri tambiku pashitalawanda, hagulaviyi wana wa kondolu wawili yawawera na umuri gwa vinja gumu. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Mwana gwa kondolu yumu hagumlaviyi tambiku mandawira na yumonga hagumlaviyi pamihi. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Pamuhera na mwana gwa kondolu gwa kwanja, viraa hagulaviyi kilu yimu ya ubumu unama na lita yimu ya lipaki liherepa na lita yimu ya divayi handa tambiku ya shirandu. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Ntambu iraa ayi na mwana gwa kondolu ulii yumonga gwa pamihi hagumlaviyi tambiku pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga na shirandu handa ntambu yagutenditi mandawira, ununkira ya tambiku hayi yailaviwa kwa motu haiherepeziyi neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Tambiku ayi ya kulunguziwa hailaviwi mashaka goseri, shileri na shileri, kulongolu kwaneni Mtuwa Mlungu, kulongolu kwa ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala kweni aku hanuliwoni na mwenga na kuyowera na gwenga. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Panu ndo haniliwoni na wantu wa Israeli na ukwisa waneni haupatendi paweri pananagala. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Liringu Linanagala pamuhera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira hanuvitendi viweri vinanagala, viraa virii Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hanuwatyeki su wantenderi gambira watambika. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Hanulikali pakati pa wantu wa Israeli, neni haweri Mlungu gwawu. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Palaa womberi hawavimani kuwera neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu, yanuwajega kulawa Misri, su nilikali pakati pawu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwawu.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Kulawa 37:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />Hagunyawi shitalawanda sha kutambikira kwa mbawu za mtera gwa mjohoru, su paweri pahala pa kutumiziya ubani. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Shitalawanda ashi utali wakuyi na upana wakuyi uweri teratera, utali na upana wakuyi uweri sentimita malongu tisa. Magoli gakuyi ga kumpindi gaweri shintu shimu na shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Shitalawanda sha kutambikira shoseri hagushityemeleki zahabu iherepa, uwega wakuyi wa kupindi na wega zakuwi zoseri za kumbwega na magoli gakuyi hagugatyemeleki kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Hagushinyawili peti mbili za zahabu na kuzitula pasi ya ukingu wakuyi muwega mbili zyaziwera pakwegera, peti hazi hazitenderuwi kupapira mipiku shaka sha kushipapa. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Mipiku ayi iweri ya mtera gwa mjoholu na guityemeleki zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Shitalawanda ashi shituluwi kulongolu kwa lipaziya mumbwega mwa lisanduku lya lipatanu, kulongolu pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda kweni aku hanuliwoni na gwenga. <verse eid="EXO 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />Kila lishaka Aruni pakingira kuvitandira vikoluboyi palii, yomberi hakatumiziyi ubani yauwera na ununkira uherepa pashitalawanda ashi. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Kayi hakatumiziyi ubani shaka sha pamihi pakawasha vikoluboyi. Tambiku ayi ya ubani hailaviwi mashaka goseri pota kulekuwa muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Pashitalawanda ashi nakamu namtumiziya ubani yauwera ndiri mnanagala, ama namlaviya tambiku ya kulunguziya ama tambiku ya viboga ama kumiminira tambiku ya virandu. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Aruni hakatendi ukolaniziwu pamagoli ga shitalawanda ashi mala yimu kwa vinja. Yomberi hakaikolaniziwu kwa mwazi gwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda mala yimu kila vinja muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri toziya shitalawanda sha kutambikira shiwera shinanagala nentu kwaneni Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />Pamuwawalanga wantu wa Israeli, kila muntu hakalipi kodi kwajili ya makaliru gakuyi kulongolu kwa neni su napawera malweli madoda pakati pawu shaka sha kuwalangwa. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Kila yumu yakawalanguwa kafiruwa kalipi mpiya shyasi sha vipimu vya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Kila yumu yakawalanguwa, kwanjira umuli wa vinja malongu na mbili kafiruwa hakandaviliri kodi ayi. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Mlunda nakalaviya ng'anji na muhushu nakalaviya kidogu ya kodi shaka pamundavilira tambiku ayi ya kukolaniziya. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Gwenga hagwanki mpiya azi za kukolaniziya kulawa kwa wantu wa Israeli na gwenga haguitenderi kwa lihengu lya Liringu Linanagala na ayi iweri liholu kwa Wantu wa Israeli kulongolu kwaneni, kuwatenda wananagala mumakaliru genu.<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libeseni likulu lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />hagunyawi libeseni likulu lya shaba lya kunawira lyaliwera na shikaliru sha shaba, gulituli pakati pa Liringu Linanagala na shitalawanda sha kutambikira na kulilekera mashi. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawagatenderi mashi aga kwa kunawira mawoku na magulu, <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />pakwingira Muliringu Linanagala ama kwiza pakwegera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira su kunavilira tambiku neni Mtuwa Mlungu, tambiku zyazilaviwa kwa motu, hawatendi hangu nawiza kuhowa. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Ifiruwa wanawi mawoku na magulu gawu su nawiza kuhowa. Ayi hayiweri lilagaliru lya mashaka goseri kwa womberi, kwanjira Aruni pamuhera na shileri shakuwi, shiyiwuku na shiyiwuku.<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipaki lya kutyekuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />hagutoli viwungu viherepa avi, lipaki lya ungombu gwa mtera yagushemuwa manimani kilu sita na mdalasini yauwera na unukira uherepa kilu ntatu na miguwa yaiwera na ununkira uherepa kilu ntatu, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />na ntambu zimonga za mdalasini zyazishemuwa kida kilu sita, vipimu avi vyoseri vilawirani na vipimu vya Liringu Linanagala, gutoli viraa lita za msheshi za lipaki. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Kulawirana na viungu avi haunyawi lipaki linanagala gulihanganiki ntambu yawatenda mafundi wa utuli, aga hagatendeki kutyeka vintu. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Shakapanu lipaki ali haguliminiri Liringu Linanagala na Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />shitalawanda pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, shintambi sha shikoluboyi na vyombu vyakuwi, shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha tambiku za kulunguziya pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, libeseni likulu na likaliru lyakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Haguvityeki su viweri vinanagala nentu. Shoseri shashivishinkula vyombu avi hashiweri shinanagala. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Shakapanu gumswagi lipaki Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kuwatyeka su wantenderi gambira watambika. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli kuwera aga hagaweri lipaki lyaneni linanagala lya kuswaga muvileri vya mwenga vyoseri. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Lipaki ali nakamu nakamiminirwa muntu yoseri yakawera ndiri mtambika, viraa naganyawiwa lipaki lyamonga lya ntambu ayi, ali liwera lipaki linanagala na lifiruwa liweri linanagala mashaka goseri kwa mwenga. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Yoseri yakanyawa lipaki gambira ali, ama kumswaga muntu yakawera ndiri mtambika, muntu ayu hakatulwi gweka kutali kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, hagutoli vipimu vyaviwera teratera vya viungu vinoga avi, utuli wa natafi na utuli wa shekeleti na utuli wa kelibena na ubani uherepa. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Hagutenderi vintu avi kunyawira ubani gambira mafundi ntambu yawanyawa utuli, gutuli munu gupati kuwera uherepa na unanagala. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Shakapanu gusagi na kutenda ubumu unama, upati kutenderwa Muliringu Linanagala na kulityelemeka Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, pahala paniliwona na gwenga, agu hauweri ubani unanagala nentu kwa mwenga. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Nakamu namuutendera ubani yawuhanganikitwi hangu kwa vitwatira vyenu maweni tembera ubani awu hauweri unanagala kulongolu kwa neni. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Yoseri yakalinyawira ubani wa ntambu ayi na kuwutendera gambira utuli wakuyi mweni, yomberi hakatulwi gweka kutali na wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Mafundi wa kutandira Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 35:30-36:1">Kulawa 35:30-36:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />neni numsyagula Bezaleli, mwana gwa Uri, mzukulu gwa Huri gwa likabira lya Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />na kumumemiziya rohu gwaneni. Nimpanana uwezu wa gweka wa kunyawa vintu, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />su kabuni lihengu lya usanii wa kunyawa vintu kwa kutendera madini ga zahabu na madini ga feza na shaba. <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />Nimpanana umana wa kusongola mabuwi ga kulembeziya na kusongola mbawu na umana wa kila ntambu ya ufundi. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Viraa numsyagula Oholiabu mwana gwa Ahisamaki, gwa likabila lya Dani, yomberi katendi lihengu pamuhera na yomberi. Ntambu iraa ayi niwapanani uwezu mkulu wantu wamonga kwajili ya mahengu ga ntambu yingi yingi, su wanyawi vintu vyoseri vyandagalira wavitendi, <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Liringu Linanagala na lisanduku lya ukapitawu lyaliwera na mfiniku yauwera pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda, pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />shitalawanda na vyombu vyakuwi, shintambi shiherepa sha shikoluboyi shashinyawitwi kwa zahabu iherepa na vyombu vyakuwi, shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha tambiku za kulunguziwa pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, libeseni likulu lya mashi pamuhera na shikaliru shakuwi, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />nguwu nanagala za mtambika Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawatendi lihengu lya utambika, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />lipaki lya kutyekuwa na ubani uherepa kwajili ya Pahala Pananagala. Vintu avi vyoseri havinyawiwi kulawirana ntambu yanuwalagaliriti.<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lishaka lya Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli hangu, gujimiri malagaliru gangu yanuwalagalira kuusu lishaka lya Kwoyera. Mashaka aga hagawaholiziyi mwenga pamuhera na neni kwa viyiwuku vyenu vyoseri kuwera neni ndo yanuwapunga. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Mfiruwa kugajimira malagaliru gangu kuusu mashaka ga Kwoyera toziya womberi wawera wananagala. Muntu yoseri yakaitula uhumba hakalagwi. Na muntu yoseri yakatenda lihengu lyoseri mulishaka ali hakatuluwi gweka kutali kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Hamtendi mahengu genu kwa mashaka sita, kumbiti lishaka lya saba haliweri lishaka lya kwoyera, lishaka ali haliweri lishaka linanagala. Muntu yoseri yakatenda mahengu goseri galii mulishaka ali kafiruwa kalaguwi. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Su wantu wa Israeli hawaligoheleli lishaka lya Kwoyera muviyuwuku vyawu voseri kuwera lilangaliru lya lipatanu lya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Shitwatira ashi hashiweri lilangaliru lya mashaka goseri pakati pa wantu wa Israeli na neni, toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu nyawiti kumpindi na pasipanu kwa mashaka sita, kumbiti lishaka lya saba ndekiti kutenda mahengu, su noyeriti.<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu pakamaliliti kuyowera na Musa paligongu Sinai, su kampananiti Musa mabuwi galii mawili Mlungu yakagalembiti mweni malagaliru kwa shyala shakuwi mweni.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Shinyagu sha zahabu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 9:6-29">Liholu 9:6-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Wantu pawawoniti kuwera Musa kakawa kuwuya kulawa kuligongu, womberi wajojonikiti kulongolu kwa Aruni na kumgambira, “Gwizi gutunyawiri twenga milungu ya kutulonguziya toziya twenga tuvimana ndiri shashimlawiriti Musa yakatulaviyiti twenga kulawa Misri.”<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Aruni kawankula, “Mtoli zahabu zyawavala wadala wenu na wana wenu, su munjegeri neni.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Su wantu woseri walaviyiti zahabu zawu zyawavaliti na kumjegera Aruni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Yomberi katoliti vintu virii na kuvilembetiziya mumotu, su kanyawiti mfanu gwa mwana gwa ng'ombi. Shakapanu wantu pawawoniti wabotiti, “Gwee Israeli, ayu ndo mlungu gwetu yakatulaviyiti twenga kulawa Misri.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Shakapanu Aruni kanyawiti shitalawanda sha kutambikira kulongolu kwa mwana gwa ng'ombi gwa zahabu ulii na kubwera, “Shilawu hakuweri na msambu gwa kumgohelila Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Shilawu yakuwi mandawira wantu walaviyiti tambiku za kulunguziya pamuhera na tambiku za ponga. Wantu walivagiti pasi kuliya na kulanda, shakapanu wagolokiti na kuvina na kutenda vintu vidoda.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guseleri pasi toziya wantu waku yaguwajegiti kulawa Misri walipotuziya weni, <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />wayileka kamkamu hera njira yanuwalagaliriti, su walinyawira weni shinyagu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi. Womberi washiguwira na kushilavilira tambiku pawalonga, gwee Israeli, ayi ndo milungu yatwenga yaitulaviyiti twenga kulawa Misri. <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Nuwamana wantu awa wawera na mtiti. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Vinu gundeki, maya gangu gankugenda kuwagamiziya. Shakapanu hanikutendi gwenga pamuhera na shiyiwuku shaku muweri isi nkulu.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Kumbiti Musa kamuhigiti Mtuwa, Mlungu gwakuyi, pakalonga, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa ntambu gaa guwera na maya nkulu kwa wantu waku yaguwalaviyiti kulawa Misri kwa uwezu waku na makakala gaku makulu? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Pagutenda hangu, nakaka wantu wa Misri hawalongi, kawalaviyiti Misri su kuwajega kuwalaga kuligongu na kuwagamiziya nakamu pasipanu. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gwoyi maya gaku makulu, guleki shitwatira ashi shagufiriti kushitenda kwa wantu waku. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Guwaholi wantumintumi waku Abrahamu na Isaka na Israeli, gamweni guwalapiriti pagulongiti,hanishiyongeri shiyiwuku shenu kuwera gambira ntondu za kulyera na isi yanuwalagiliti Hanishipanani shileri sha mwenga washihali mashaka goseri.” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kalekiti kuwatendera wantu wakuyi shitwatira shilii shidoda shakaliholiti kuwatendera.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Shakapanu Musa kaseleriti kulawa kuligongu pakawera na mabuwi galii mawili gagalembituwi kulongolu na kumbeli malagaliru ga Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Mlungu mweni ndo yakaganyawiti mabuwi galii na malembu galii yakagalembituwi, gasongolituwi na Mlungu mweni.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoshuwa pakapikaniriti umatu wa wantu pawabotanga, kamgambiriti Musa, “Kwana umatu wa ngondu mukambi.” <verse eid="EXO 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Kumbiti Musa kamwankula, “Umatu ndiri wa ukanka ama kusinda, kumbiti umatu wa wantu yawimba.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Kamkamu hera Musa pakiziti pakwegera na kambi na kuwona shinyagu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi na wantu pawavina msambu, palaa maya gakuyi gatutumuka gambira motu na kagawasiti pasi mabuwi galii yagaweriti naga mumawoku mwakuyi, kagapantiti pasi palii palugongu. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Su, kamtoliti shinyagu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi ulii na kumkoziya motu, kashipuntiti nakamu kuwera ubumu, ubumu ulii kauhanganyikiti mumashi na kuwagambira wantu wa Israeli walandi.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa kamkosiyiti Aruni, “Wakutenditi shishi wantu awa mpaka guwayingiziya muvidoda vikulu avi?” <verse eid="EXO 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Aruni kamwankula, “Nikuluwa gwee mtuwa gwangu kuwera maya gaku naganizira neni ntumintumi gwaku. Guwamana wantu waku ntambu yawawera kala kutenda ukondora. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Womberi wiziti na kung'ambira, gututenderi twenga mlungu yakagenda kutulonguziya toziya Musa yakatulaviyiti Misri tuvimana ndiri shashimlawiriti. <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Su neni niwagambiriti womberi, muntu yoseri yakawera na zahabu, kavuli. Shakapanu womberi wampananiti neni zahabu zilii na neni nuzilembeleziyiti mumotu na nuwanyawiriti shinyagu ashi sha mwana gwa ng'ombi!”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Su Musa pakawoniti kuwera wantu wamleka Mlungu na kutenda ntambu yawafira weni toziya Aruni kawalekiti watenditi ukondola na kutenda ntambu yawafira na kulijegera weni soni kulongolu kwa wangondu wawu, <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Musa kagolokiti kulongolu kwa ligomi lya kambi na kakosiyiti, “Hashi gaa yakaweri uwega wa Mtuwa Mlungu? Su kizi kwaneni!” Wana woseri wa Lawi wajojanikiti pamuhera kulongolu kwa Musa. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Shakapanu Musa kawagambiriti womberi, “Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa wantu wa Israeli kalonga hangu, kila muntu na kalitawi ligumba lyakuyi mushunu, kagendi kila pahala mukambi, kulawa ligomi limu mpaka ligomi lyamonga, kila muntu kamlagi mlongu gwakuyi na ganja gwakuyi na gwapakwegera gwakuyi.” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Wana wa Lawi watenditi gambira Musa ntambu yakawalagiliriti. Mulishaka lilii womberi wawalagiti wantu elufu tatu. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Musa kalongiti, “Leru mlityeka maweni kumtendera Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya mtira ndiri kuwalaga wana wenu na walongu wenu. Mlungu kawatekeleri mulishaka ali.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwaluwira wantu wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Shilawu yakuwi Musa kawagambiriti wantu, “Mwenga mtenda vidoda vikulu. Kumbiti vinu hankweni kuligongu kugenda kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pamonga weza kuwakolaniziya toziya ya vidoda vyenu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Musa kagenditi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kamgambiriti, “Wantu awa watenda vidoda viluku. Womberi walinyawiriti shinyagu sha zahabu na kushiguwira. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Kumbiti vinu nukuhiga shondi guwalekeziyi vidoda vyawatenditi, paguwalekeziya ndiri gunuwusiyi mushintola shaku shaguwalembiti wantu waku.” <verse eid="EXO 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Hanumusiyi mushintola shangu muntu yoseri yakatenditi vidoda. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Vinu gugendi gwakawalonguziyi wantu mpaka pahala panakugambiriti, ntumintumi gwa kumpindi hakakulongoleri. Shaka pashiza sha kuwazibu, hanuwazibu womberi toziya ya vidoda vyawatenditi.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Mtuwa Mlungu katenditi wantu walwali ulweli yaushemuwa tawuni, toziya wamluwiti Aruni kawanyawiriti shinyagu sha zahabu sha mwana gwa ng'ombi.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Mlungu kankumlagalira Musa wanji mwanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gwanji mwanja guwuki panu, gwenga pamuhera na wantu yaguwalaviyiti Misri, mgendi muisi yanuwalagaliti kuwapanana Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakubu panongiti, haniwapanani shiyiwuku shenu isi ayi. <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Hanumlagaliri ntumintumi gwangu gwa kumpindi kawalongoziyi, hanuwawingi wantu Wakanaani na Waamori na Wahiti na Waperizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Mgendi muisi ayi yaiherepa kulima na kufuga wankanyama. Kumbiti hapeni ng'endi pamuhera na mwenga toziya pang'enda pamuhera na mwenga hanuwaagaiziyi munjira.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Wantu waliriti pawapikaniriti visoweru avi vidoda, kuweriti ndiri muntu yakavaliti malembiziya gakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Womberi watenditi hangu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli, mwenga mwawantu yamuwera na mtiti. Pang'enda pamuhera na mwenga kwa shaka shididini, haniwagamiziyi. Su mvuli malembiziya genu su neni hanivimani ntambu ya kuwatendera.” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Su wantu wa Israeli wavuliti malembiziya gawu palugongu Horebu, viraa lugongu alu lushemuwa Sinai.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Vinu Musa kaweriti na shitiba sha kulitola Liringu Linanagala na kulibawira kunja kwa kambi, Liringu ali kalipananiti litawu Liringu Linanagala. Muntu yoseri yakafira shoseri kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kagenditi Muliringu Linanagala kunja kwa kambi. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Musa pakaweriti kankugenda Kuliringu lilii, kila muntu kagolokiti muliringu lyakuyi pakamlola Musa mpaka kingiri Muliringu lilii. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Shaka Musa pakingiriti Muliringu lilii, mnara gwa lihundi lisulukiti na kugoloka paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala na Mtuwa Mlungu kayoweriti na yomberi. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Wantu woseri pawawoniti mnara gwa lihundi lilii ligoloka paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, kila yumu gwawu kagoloka na kuguwira paligomi lya liringu lyakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Hangu ndo Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakayoweriti na Musa sheni kwa sheni, gambira muntu na ganja gwakuyi. Shakapanu Musa kawuyiti kayi kukambi. Kumbiti Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni kalikaliti Muliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankulagila kuwera pamuhera na wantu wakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Musa kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Gwenga gung'ambiliti, guwalongoziyi wantu awa, kumbiti gung'ambiliti ndiri gaa yagumtuma kantangi. Pamuhera na hangu gutakula kuwera gumana neni kwa litawu, viraa mpata upendelewu kulongolu kwaku. <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Su vinu nukuhiga handa nakaka mpata upedelewu kulongolu kwaku, gunanguziyi njira zaku, su mpati kumana na kupata upendelewu kulongolu kwaku. Nikuluwa guholi kuwera guwasyagula isi ayi kuwera wantu waku.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Neni namweni hang'endi pamuhera na gwenga, na hanikutendi gulibwedi.” <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Musa kalongiti, “Handa gwenga gamweni pagugenda ndiri pamuhera na neni, su nagutuwusiya pahala panu. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Toziya hanivimani hashi kuwera mpata upendelewu kulongolu kwaku, neni pamuhera na wantu waku handa pagugenda ndiri pamuhera na twenga? Pagugenda pamuhera na twenga, ntambu ayi haitutendi neni pamuhera na wantu waku kuwera wantu wa gweka pakati pa wantu woseri pasipanu.”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Toziya gupata upendelewu kulongolu kwa neni, neni nukumana kwa litawu lyaku, shitwatira shilaa ashi shagulongiti hanishitendi.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Musa kaluwiti, “Nukuhiga gunanguziyi ukwisa waku.” <verse eid="EXO 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankula, “Hampiti kulongolu kwaku na kukulanguziya uheri woseri waneni pambwera litawu lyangu, Mtuwa Mlungu. Neni hanumlekeziyi ulii yanfira kumlekeziya na kumwonera lusungu ulii yanfira kumwonera lusungu. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Kumbiti hapeni guwezi kumona sheni shangu toziya kwahera muntu yoseri yaweza kumona na kulikala. <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, kwana pahala pakwegera na neni, peni apa hagugoloki palitalawu. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Ukwisa wangu paguwera wankupita, hanukutuli mumpanga mulitalawu na kukugubikira kwa liwoku lyangu, mpaka pampita kala. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Shakapanu hanuliwusiyi liwoku lyangu nagwenga hagumoni neni kumbeli, kumbiti sheni shangu hapeni gushiwoni.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Mabuwi ga syayi ga lipatanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Liholu 10:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gusongoli vibawu viwili vya mabuwi gambira virii vya kwanja, neni hanembi visoweru virii vyaviweriti mumabuwi gallii ga kwanja gagugapantiti. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Guweri kala shilawu mandawira, gwizi kuliwona naneni palugongu Sinayi. Gwizi gweka yaku kwaneni kulugongu kulii. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Muntu yoseri nakiza pamuhera na gwenga, ama nakawoneka pahala poseri kuligongu, wakondolu ama ng'ombi nawawaliziya pakwegera na lugongu alu.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Su Musa kasongoliti vibawu viwili vya mabuwi gambira virii vya kwanja. Su kawukiti mandawira pee, kakweniti kuligongu Sinai gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti, pakawera na vibawu virii viwili vya mabuwi mumawoku gakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kasulukiti mulihundi, kagolokiti pamuhera na Musa, su kalikantiti litawu lyakuyi, Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu kapititi kulongolu kwa Musa pakabwera kayi, “Mtuwa Mlungu, neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu yakawera na lusungu na manemu, mkaripa ndiri gwa kalongola, ndo yakawera na upendelewu uvuwa na mwaminika. <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />Neni nuwafira wantu maelufu kwa maelufu ga vileri. Nuwalegeziya wantu vidoda vyawu vyoseri vya ntambu yingiyingi. Wandumbira wanfira maelufu, panuwalegiziya ukondora na makosa pamuhera na vidoda, kumbiti kwa ntambu yoseri ilii hapeni ndeki kumwazibu muntu yakawera na ukondola, hanishyazibu shiyiwuku sha ntatu na sha msheshi.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Palaa palii Musa kasuntama pasi, kamguwira Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Shakapanu kalongiti, “Gwee Mtuwa gwangu, toziya gumanana upendewu kulongolu kwaku, nikuluwa gugendi pamuhera na twenga. Wantu awa waweraa na mtiti, kumbiti gutulekeziyi ukondola wetu na vidoda vyetu, gutuwanki gambira wantu waku mweni.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipatanu litendwa syayi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 23:14-19">Kulawa 23:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Liholu 7:1-5</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">16:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, neni nakutenda lipatapanu na gwenga. “Pamberi pa wantu wakuw woseri, hantendi makangashu hagenilawiri muisi yoseri ilii pasipanu. Na wantu woseri ymulikala pakati pawu hawagawo matendu gangu makulu. Toziya hantendi shitwatira sha kulikangasha kwajili yaku. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Gujimili shilii shankulagalira leru. Hanuwawingi kulongolu kwaku Waamori na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waperizi na Wahiti na wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Mulikali weri namwiza kutenda majimiliranu na wenikaya wa isi yamuigendera, toziya mapatanu aga hayaweri magomiziwu pakati pa mwenga. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Kumbiti hamuzibomolangi vitalawanda vyawu na kubomolanga mpanda zawu za kuguwira kwawu pamuhera na mlungu gwa shidala yakashemwa Ashera. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />Namumguwira mlungu yumonga yoseri ulii, toziya neni wera Mtuwa Mlungu numanikana kwa litawu, yakawera na weya, toziya hankalari pagumguwira mlungu yumonga. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Namtenda majimiliranu goseri galii na wenikaya wa isi ilii, toziya pawaiguwira milungu yawu ya upyota na kuyilavilira tambiku, hawashemerani mwenga na mwenga hamfiri kuliya viboga vyawalailavilira milungu yawu. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Wana wenu wapalu pawayuga wahinga wawu, na wahinga walii yawaguwira milungu yawu, hawawatendi wana wenu kuiguira milungu yawu.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />Namulinyawira milungu ya upyota ya shuma.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />Kila vinja hamvini msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekeruwa ndiri simika. Kwa shaka sha mashaka saba hamliyi mabumunda yauwi mumwezi gwa Abihu, gambira neni ntambu yanuwalagaliriti, toziya mumwezi agu gwa Abihu mwenga mlawiti Misri. <verse eid="EXO 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />Kila myiwuka gwa kwanja gwa shipalu hakaweri gwangu, pamuhera na wiyuka wa kwanja wa shipalu wa wankanyama waku woseri na wang'ombi na wakondolu. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Muyuka gwa kwanja wa nkanyama punda hagumgomboli kwa kundavilira kondolu. Handa pamgumkombola ndiri hagumuminduli nsingu. Wana wenu woseri wapalu yawawera wayuwuka wa kwanza hamuwakomboli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">Muntu yoseri nakiza kulongolu kwaneni mawoku hera.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />Mashaka sita hamtendi mahengu genu, kumbiti lishaka lya saba hamwoyeri, ata payiwera shaka sha kulima ama sha kubena.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />Hamvini msambu gwa lijuwa kwanjira shaka sha kubena nganu na kuvina msambu gwa kujojonira mabenu muupeleru mwa vinja.<verse eid="EXO 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />Mala tatu kwa vinja wapalu woseri hawajojoniki kulongolu kwaneni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Hanuviwingi vipinga vya wantu yawalikala muisi yamgenda kuihala, na kwongera mipaka yenu kuwera mikulu. Kwahera muntu hakaitoli isi yamwenga shaka pamjojonika kunguwira neni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu mala ntatu kila vinja.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />Namundavilira mwazi gwa tambiku pamuhera na shintu shoseri shashiwera na simika, viraa namleka tambku yoseri ya Pasaka isigali mpaka mandawira.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />Viboga vya kwanja mumalambu genu hagugajeji mnumba mwaneni Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwaku. Nagupwasiya vinofu vya mwana gwa kondolu ama mwana gwa mbuzi mumaweri ga mawu gwakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, gulembi visoweru avi, toziya kulawirana na visoweru avi, neni ntenda lipatanu ali na gwenga pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli.”<verse eid="EXO 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa kalikaliti kuligongu aku pamuhera na Mtuwa Mlungu kwa mashaka malongu msheshi, paluwala na pashiru, yomberi kaliyiti ndiri shintu ama kulanda mashi. Yomberi kavilembiti visoweru vyoseri na malagaliru galii lilongu.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuselera kulawa kuligongu Sinayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Musa pakaweriti kankuselera kulawa kuligongu Sinayi, pakawera na vibawu viwili virii vyaviweriti na visoweru vya lipatanu mumawoku mwakuyi, kavimaniti ndiri kuwera sheni shakuwi shiweriti shing'ereng'eta toziya kaweriti kankuyowera na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Aruni pamuhera na wantu woseri wa Israeli pawamwoniti, womberi watiriti kumwizira pakwegera, toziya sheni shakuwi shiweriti shankung'ereng'eta. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Kumbiti Musa kamshemiti Aruni pamuhera na wakulu wa vipinga vya wantu wa Israeli wagendi pakwegera na yomberi. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Pa aga wantu woseri wa Israeli wiziti pakwegera na Musa, na yomberi kawapananiti malagaliru goseri Mtuwa Mlungu gakampananiti kulugongu Sinayi. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Musa pakamaliliti kuyowera na wantu, kashigubikiti sheni yakuwi kwa shitambala. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Kumbiti Musa kila pakagenda kuyowera na Mtuwa Mlungu Muliringu Linanagala, kakiwusiyiti shitambala shilii mapaka pakalawiti kunja. Na pakalawiti kunja kawagambiriti wantu wa Israeli vitwatira vyoseri vyakalagaliritwi, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />na wantu wa Israeli washiwoniti sheni shakuwi shankung'ereng'eta. Su Musa kashigubikiti kayi sheni shakuwi kwa shitambala mpaka pakagenditi kuyowera na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga lishaka lya Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa kavijojoniriti vipinga vyoseri vya wantu wa Israeli na kawagambiriti, “Avi viwera vitwatira Mtuwa Mlungu kalagalira muvitendi. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Mumashaka sita hamtendi mahengu genu, kumbiti lishaka lya saba haliweri lishaka lya Kwoyera, lishaka lyawalityekituwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Muntu yoseri yakatenda lihengu mulishaka ali, hakalagwi. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Namukoziya ata motu mnumba zyenu lishaka lya Kwoyera.<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaviwu kwajili ya kunyawa Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa kawagambiriti wantu woseri wa Israeli, ashi ndo shitwatira Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagaliriti mushitendi. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Kulawa muvilii yamuwera navi, mlaviyi malaviwu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Kila muntu yakawera na moyu guherepa hakamjegeri Mtuwa Mlungu malaviwu ga zahabu na madini ga feza na shaba <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />ubunda wa buluu na ya zambalawu na nsheri na nguwu iherepa yaipotituwi na mibayira ya mbuzi, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />lukuli lwa kondolu gwa shipalu zyazilekeluwa langi nsheri na lukuli lwa mbuzi na mbawu za mtera gwa mjoholu, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />lipaki kwajili ya vikoluboyi na viwungu kwajili ya lipaki lya kutyekuwa kwajili ya ubani yauwera na ununkira uherepa, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />mabuwi ga beyi nkulu gagashemuwa saridoniki na mabuwi gamonga ga beyi nkulu kwajili ya malembiziwu ga shipandi sha kugubika shifuwa na shihaku sha pashifuwa.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vintu vya Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />Kila muntu yakawera na umana wa kuyawa shintu tunga pakati pa mwenga, hakizi ku vyoseri vyakalagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />Kunyawa Liringu Linanagala, shigubiku shakuwi na lipaziya lyakuyi, na vikoleru vyakuwi na vigoweru vyakuwi na mpanda zyakuwi na vikaliru vyakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />Lisandiku lya lipatanu pamuhera na mipiku yakuwi, mfiniku gwagushemuwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda na lipaziya lya Pahala Pananagala nentu. <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />Shitalawanda na mashera gakuyi pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri, mabumunda yagalekeruwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />shintambi sha vikoluboyi pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, vikoluboyi pamuhera na lipaki lyakuyi, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha ubani pamuhera na mipiku yakuwi, lipaki lya kutyekuwa na ubani yauwera na ununira uherepa, lipaziya lya paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />Shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kulunguziya pamuhera na wavu wa shaba na mipiku yakuwi pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, libeseni likulu pamuhera na shikaliru shakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />Mapaziya ga kuzyengetilira mdamu pamuhera na mpanda zakuwi na vikaliru vyakuwi na lipaziya lya ligomi lya mdamu, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />vigingi vya Liringu Linanagala na vigingi ya mdamu pamuhera na ngoyi zyakuwi.” <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />Nguwu ziherepa zyazisonuwa weri kwajili ya utenderu wa Pahala Pananagala, “Nguwu zilii zyaziwera nanagala za mtambika Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, toziya ya utenderu wawu wa shitambika.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wankujega malaviwu gawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Shakapanu wantu woseri wa Israeli wawukiti kulawa kulongolu kwa Musa. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Kila muntu kafiliti kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. Womberi walaviyiti malaviwu gawu kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala, utenderu wakuyi pamuhera na nguwu zakuwi nanagala. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Wantu woseri yawaweriti na moyu guherepa, wapalu na wadala, wajegiti vipini vyawavala mumpula na heleni na peti na ukufu na kila ntambu ya vyombu vya zahabu, kila muntu kamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu shintu sha zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Na kila muntu kajegiti shoseri shakaweriti nashu gambira ubunta langi ya buluu na ya zmbalawu na ya langi ya nsheri ama nguwu mfufu iherepa ama mibayira ya mbuzi ama lukuli lwa kondolu lyalitulituwi langi nsheri. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Kila muntu yakaweziti kulaviya mpiya ama shaba kaijegiti kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera laviwu lyakuyi. Kayi muntu yoseri yakaweriti na mbawu za mtera gwa mjohoru kajegiti viraa. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Wadala woseri yawaweriti na ufundi gwa kupota, wajegiti ubunta wa langi ya buluu na langi ya zambalawu na nsheri na nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Na wadala woseri waweriti na umana wapotiti mibayira ya mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Wakulu wajegiti vintu vya beyi nkulu vya langi pamuhera na mabuwi gamonga kwajili ya malembeziwu mushipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa na shihaku sha pashifuwa, <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />wajegiti viraa viwungu na lipaki kwajili ya vikoluboyi, lipaki lya kutyekuwa pamuhera na ubani yauwera na ununkira uherepa. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Wantu woseri wa Israeli, wapalu na wadala, yawafiriti kulaviya malaviwu gawu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa katendi, womberi walaviyiti kwa moyu gunanagala, handa malaviwu ga kumpanana Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundi wa kunyawa Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Musa kawagambiriti wantu wa Israeli, “Mpikaniri weri! Mtuwa Mlungu kamsyagula Bezaleli mwana gwa Uri, mzukulu gwa Huri gwa likabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Kamumemiziya rohu yakuwi, kampanana umana na mahala na ufundi, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />yomberi hakawezi kubuni kunyawa vintu vya zahabu na feza na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />kasongoli mabuwi ga kulembeziya mbawu kwajili ya lihengu lyamonga lyoseri lya shifundi. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Viraa kampanana uwezu Oholiabu mwana gwa Ahisamaki, gwa likabira lya Dani wawafundi wamonga. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Kawapanana kuvimana kutenda kila lihengu lya ufundi ama lyawatenda wantu wa kutenda umana ama mafundi wa kusona kwa ubunta langi ya buluu na nzambalawu na nsheri na nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi, kwa kuutendera ufundi woseri wa mtenda umana.”<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Bezaleli na Oholiabu pamuhera na kila muntu yakapananituwi umana na uwezu kuvimana ntambu ya kutenda lihengu lya kunyawa Liringu Linanagala, hakatendi lihengu kulawirana na goseri Mtuwa Mlungu yakagalagaliriti.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wankulaviya malaviwu gavuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Musa kamshemiti Bezaleli na Oholiabu na kila muntu yakapananituwi umana na Mtuwa Mlungu, na kila muntu kasoki kutenda lihengu ali. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Musa kawapananiti womberi vintu vyoseri vyavilaviwituwi na wantu wa Israeli kwajili ya lihengu lya kunyawa Liringu Linanagala. Hata hangu wantu wendereyiti kulaviya malaviwu gawu kila mandawira. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Wantu woseri yawawera na ufundi wa kutenda lihengu lya ntambu yingiyingi lya kunyawa Liringu Linanagala, walawiti na kumgendera Musa, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />su wamgambiriti, wantu wajega “Vintu vivuwa nentu ya virii vyavifiruwa kwajili ya lihengu lyakatulagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu tulitendi.” <verse eid="EXO 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Su Musa kalagalira, wantu woseri nawajega malaviwu ng'anji kwajili ya Liringu Linanagala. “Wantu walewelerituwi kujega vintu,” <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />toziya virii vyawavijegiti vitoshiti kwa lihengu ali na kusigala.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyawa Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Wapalu woseri yawawera na ufundi wanyawiti Liringu Linanagala kwa mapaziya lilongu ya nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi lilongu na ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri na kuvilembiziya viumbi vyaviwera na mbapatiru. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Utali wa kila lipaziya uweriti meta lilongu na mbili na upana meta mbili. Mapaziya goseri gaweriti na shipimu shimu. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Womberi wagakolaniziyiti mapaziya muhanu kutenda shiweri shipandi shimu na kutenda ntambu iraa ayi kwa galii gamonga muhanu. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Wanyawiti vikoweku vya buluu muluwiniku mwa lipaziya lwa upeleru lya shipandi sha kwanja, na vikoweku vyamonga mulipazya lya upeleru lya shipandi sha pili. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Watuliti vikoweku malongu muhanu mulipaziya lya kwanja lya shipandi sha kwanja na vikoweku malongu muhanu muluwiniku lwa lipaziya lya pili, vikoweku vyoseri vilolaniti. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Shakapanu wanyawiti vifungu malongu muhanu vya zahabu su kuvikolaniziya vipandi viwili vya mapaziya, su Liringu Linanagala liwera shintu shimu.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Viraa wanyawiti shifiniku sha Liringu Linanagala kwa mapaziya lilongu na yimu kwa mibayira ya mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Kila lipaziya liweriti na utali wa meta lilongu na ntatu na upana wa meta mbili. Mapaziya goseri lilongu na yimu yaweriti na shipimu shilaa shilii. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Su wagakolaniziyiti mapaziya muhanu pamuhera na mapaziya gamonga sita wagakolaniziyiti pamuhera. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Shakapanu wanyawiti vikoweku malongu muhanu muluwiniku mwa lipaziya lya upeleru lya shipandi sha kwanja na vikoweku malongu muhanu muluwniku mwa shipandi shamonga. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Shakapanu wanyawiti vifungu malongu muhanu vya shaba su kukolaniziya vipandi viwili virii vya mapaziya, su kutenda liweri lipaziya limu lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Su wanyawiti shifiniku sha likuli linama lwa kondolu gwa shipalu na panani pakuwi wanyawiti shifuniku shamonga sha lukuli linama lwa mbuzi. <verse eid="EXO 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Womberi wanyawiti fulemu za kuligosiya Liringu Linanagala kwa mbawu za mtera gwa mjoholu. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Kila fulemu iweriti na utali wa meta msheshi na upana wa sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Kila fulemu iweriti na lulimi mbili za kukolaniziya. Mafulemu goseri wagatuliti lulimi. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Fulemu azi za Liringu Linanagala zinyawituwi ntambu ayi, fulemu malongu mawili uwega wa kusika <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />na vikaliru malongu msheshi vya madini ga feza pasi pa fulemu azi malongu mawili, vikaliru viwili pasi pa kila fulemu su kukolaniziya lulimi zakuwi zilii mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Wanyawiti viraa fulemu malongu mawili kwa uwega wa kushana mwa Liringu Linanagala, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na vikaliru vyakuwi malongu msheshi vya madini ga feza, vikaliru viwili pasi pa kila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Uwega wa kumbeli wa Liringu Linanagala, uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji mwa Liringu Linanagala, wanyawiti fulemu sita. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Viraa wanyawiti fulemu mbili zyamonga kwajili ya pembi za Liringu Linanagala uwega wakuyi wa kumbeli. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Fulemu azi mbili za kumbwega zikolanizituwi kwanjira pasi mpaka kumpindi mupeti za kwanja. Mpanda mbili kwajili ya pembi azi zinyawituwi ntambu ayi. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Su kuweriti na fulemu nani pamuhera na vikaliru vyakuwi lilongu na sita, vikaliru viwili mukila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Womberi wanyawiti viraa vikoleru vya mtera gwa mjoholu, vikoleru muhanu kwajili ya fulemu za uwega umu wa iringu Linanagala <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />na vikoleru muhanu kwajili ya fulemu za uwega wa kumbeli wa Liringu linanagala, uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Wanyawiti shikoleru sha mkati yausokiti nusu ya Liringu Linanagala, lupeniti mkati kulawa upeleru umu mpaka upeleru umonga. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Fulemu zoseri wazityelemikiti zahabu, wanyawiti na peti za zahabu za kukolera vikoleru avi, wavityemelekiti zahabu viraa.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Womberi wanyawiti lipaziya lya nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi na kulembiziwa kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri. Lipaziya ali lilembiziwituwi weri viumbi vyaviwera na mbapatiru. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Wanyawiti fulemu za msheshi za mtera gwa mjoholu, wazityemelekiti zahabu na kuzitulia vikoweru vya zahabu. Viraa virii wanyawiriti vikaliru vya msheshi vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Kwajili ya ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, womberi wanyawiti lipaziya nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri, lipaziya ali lilembiziwituwi weri <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />na fulemu zyakuwi muhanu zyaziwera na vikoweru. Pavikoleru vya mpanda pamuhera na vikwambikwambi vyakuwi wavityemelikiti zahabu, kumbiti vikaliru vyakuwi muhanu viweriti vya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kunyawa Lisandiku lya Lipatanu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kulawa 25:10-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Bezaleli kanyawiti Lisandiku lya Lipatanu kwa mbawu za mtera gwa mijoholu, utali wakuyi uweriti sentimita miya yimu na lilongu na upana sentimita malongu sita na sita na utali wakuyi sentimita malongu na sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Kalityeremeka zahabu iherepa mngati na kunja, na kulinyawira ukingu wa zahabu wega zoseri. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Kanyawiti peti za msheshi za zahabu kwajili ya kulipapira na kazitula mumagulu ga Lisandiku, kazituliti peti mbili uwega umu na peti mbili zyamonga muuwega umonga wa Lisandiku. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Kanyawiti mipiku miwili ya mtera gwa mjoholi, na kuityelemeka kwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Mipiku ayi kayipeniziyiti mupeti zilii zyaziweriti wega mbili za lisandiku kwajili ya kulipapira. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Kanyawiti mfiniku kwa zahabu iherepa yagushemuwa pahala pa Mtuwa Mlungu kulekeziya vidoda, utali wakuyi uweriti sentimita miya na lilongu na upana wakuyi sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Kanyawiti viwumbi wawili yawawera na mbapatiru kulawirana na kwa kuponda zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />Shiwumbi shimu upeleru awu na yumonga upeleru umonga mwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu. Yomberi kanyawiti viwumbi vyaviwera na mbapatiru muupeleru wa mfiniku agu, paviwera shintu shimu na mfiniku. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Viwumbi avi viweriti pavilolana, mbapatiru zawu zigubutuka kushigubika mfiniku gwa Lisanduku, sheni sha kila shiwumbi shiweriti shankulola mfiniku gwa Lisanduku.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda sha mabumunda ya tambiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Bezaleli kanyawiti shitalawanda kwa mtera gwa mjoholu, shiweriti na utali wa sentimita malongu nani na nani, upana wakuyi sentimita malongu msheshi na msheshi, utali wakuyi kugenda kumpindi sentimita malongu sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Yomberi kashityemelekiti shitalawanda ashi kwa zahabu iherepa na kuyinyawira ukingu wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Kanyawiti kuzyengetera ubawu yauwera na upana wa milimeta malongu saba na muhanu na kuyizyengetera ukingu wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Kanyawiliti peti za msheshi za zahabu na kuzitula mupembi zyakuwi msheshi pahala pamagulu paipelera. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Peti azi za kukololera mipiku ya kupapira zitulituwi pakwegera na mzyengetu gulii gwa ubawu. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Kanyawiti mipiku miwili ya mtera gwa mjoholu ya kupapira, kayityemeleka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Kanyawiti vyombu vya zahabu viherepa vya kutula pampindi pa shitalawanda, mabeseni na bakuli na majagi na vikombi vyakuwi kwajili ya ntambiku ya shilandu.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shintambi sha vikoluboyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Kanyawiti shintambi sha vikoluboyi kwa zahabu iherepa. Shikaliru pamuhera na ufitu wakuyi uweriti shintu shimu pamuhera na vikombi vyakuwi, vitumba vyakuwi na uluwa wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Kuweriti na mitambi sita yagalawiliti kila uwega wa lubiki lwakuyi, ntambi ntatu uwega wumu na ntambi ntatu uwega umonga. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Mukila lutambi kuweriti na vikombi vitatu mfanu gwa uluwa wa mlozi, kila shimu na shitumba shakuwi na uluwa wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Mulubiki lwa shintambi kuweriti na vikombi vya msheshii mfanu gwa uluwa wa mlozi, pamuhera na vitumba vyakuyi na uluwa wakuyi. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Pahala palii papalawiriti mabunda matatu ga ntambi pasi pa kila libunda kuweriti na litumba limu. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Matumba galii na mitambi viweriti shintu shimu na shintambi ashi na shoseri shipondwa kwa zahabu iherepa. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Yomberi kavinyawiriti vikoluboyi saba na vikoleru na visaani vyakuwi kwa zahabu iherepa. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Kashinyawiriti shintambi ashi pamuhera na vintu vyakuyi kwa kilu malongu matatu na muhanu ga zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Bezaleli kanyawiti shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kutumiziya ubani kwa mtera gwa mjoholu. Utali na upana wakuyi uweriti teratera, sentimita malongu msheshi na muhanu na utali wakuyi kugenda kumpindi uweriti sentimita malongu tisa. Magoli ga shitalawanda ashi gaweriti shintu shimu na shitalawanda ashi. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Shitalawanda shoseri kashityemelekiyiti zahabu iherepa, uwega wakuyi wa kunani na wega zyakuwi za kumbwega pamuhera na magoli gakuyi, viraa kashinyawiriti ukingu wa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Kanyawiti peti mbili za zahabu pasi pa ukingu muwega mbili zyazikwegerana. Peti azi ziweriti za kukolera mipiku ya kupapira. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Kanyawiti mipiku miwili ya mtera gwa mjoholu na kuityeremeka zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Kanyawiti lipaki liherepa lya kutyeka na ubani uherepa yauwera na ununkira yauhanganyuwa weri gambira utuli.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha kulunguziya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Kulawa 27:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Wanyawiti alawanda sha kutambikira kwajili ya tambiku za kulunguziwa. Shitalawanda ashi utali na upana wakuyi uweriti teratera, utali na upana wakuw uweriti meta mbili na lobu na utali wakuyi kugenda kumpindi uweriti meta yimu na lobu. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Mukila ligoli lya shitalawanda ashi, kanyawiti ligoli lyaliweriti kulawirana na shitalawanda ashi. Shitalawanda ashi kashityemelekiti shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Viraa yomberi kanyawiti vyombu vyoseri kwajiri shitalawanda sha kutambikira, kanyawiti viwiga na sepetu na beseni nkulu na wavu na koleu lya kupalira motu. Vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri kavinyawiti kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Kanyawiti wavu wa shaba, kautula pasi pa ukingu wa shitalawanda sha kutambikira mpaka nusu ya shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Mupembi za msheshi yomberi kanyawiti peti za msheshi za kupapira shitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Wanyawiti mipiku ya mtera gwa mjoholu na kuityelemeka shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Wayituliti mipiku mupeti zilii yaziweriti kumbwega kwa pakutambikira su kuipapira. Pakutambikira apa panyawitwi kwa mbawu paweriti na livungu mngati.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunyawa libeseni likulu lya kunawira mashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Shakapanu kanyawiti libeseni likulu lya shaba na shikaliru shakuwi shiweriti sha shaba, vintu avi vinyawituwi kwa vipandi vya shaba vyavitendirituwi na wadala kuwera viloleru vyawu na vijegituwi na wadala yawaweriti wakuntenda lihengu muligomi lya Liringu Linanagala.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mdamu gwa Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Shakapanu kanyawiti mdamu. Mapaziya ga uwega wa kusika gaweriti ga nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi na yagawera na utali wa meta malongu msheshi na msheshi, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />mapaziya aga gakolerituwi kwa mpanda malongu mawili ga shaba zyaziweriti na vikaliru malongu mawili ga shaba. Kumbiti vikoweku vya mpanda azi na vikwambikwambi vyakuwi viweriti vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Uwega wa kushana utali wa lipaziya liweriti meta malongu msheshi na mpanda zyakuwi malongu mawili ga shaba, kumbiti vikoweku vyakuwi na vikwambikwambi vyakuwi viweriti vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji kuweriti na lipaziya shashiwera na meta malongu mawili na mbili na mpanda lilongu na vikaliru vyakuwi lilongu. Vikoweku vya mpanda na vikwambikwambi vyakuwi viweriti vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji, kwakuweriti na ligomi, kuweriti na upana wa meta malongu mawili na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Lipaziya lya kila uwega liweriti na upana wa meta sita na nusu. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Viraa uwega umonga uweriti na lipaziya lyaliwera na upana wa meta sita na nusu, pamuhera na mpanda tatu na vikaliru vyakuwi vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Mapaziya goseri kuguzyengeta mdamu gaweriti ga nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Vikaliru vyoseri vya mpanda viweriti vya shaba, kumbiti pashikoleru mumpanda azi na vikoweku vyakuwi viweriti vya madini ga feza. Vikwambikwambi vyakuwi viweriti vya madini ga feza. Su mpanda zakuwi zoseri viraa vikoleruwa kwa vikwambikwambi vya feza.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Lipaziya lya ligomi lya mdamu linyawituwi kwa nguwu mfufu iherepa na kulembiziwa kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri. Lipaziya ali liweriti na utali wa meta tisa na utali wakuyi kugenda kumpindi meta mbili kulawirana na mdamu agu. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Viraa mpanda zakuwi ziweriti msheshi na vikaliru msheshi vya shaba. Vikoweku vyakuwi na vikwambikwambi vyakuwi viweriti vya madini ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Vigingi vyoseri vya Liringu Linanagala na vigingi vya mdamu mumbwega mwa Liringu Linanagala viweriti vya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vyombu vyavitendirituwi Muliringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Ayi ndo walanga ya vyombu vyavitendirituwi kunyawuwa Liringu Linanagala, kulii kwakutuliwituwi mabuwi galii mawili ga malagaliru. Walanga ayi itulituwi na Walawi kwa lilagaliru lyalilaviwituwi na Musa pasi pa ukulu wa Itamari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni.<verse eid="EXO 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bezaleli mwana gwa Uri, mzukulu gwa Huri gwa likabila lya Yuda, yomberi katenditi kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu shakamgambiriti Musa. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Katangituwi na Oholiabu mwana gwa Ahisamaki, gwa likabira lya Dani, fundi yakawera na umana nentu wa kusongolana kulembeziya mumabuwi, kuyambula malembiziya ga nguwu mfufu iherepa na kulembiziya kwa ubunta wa mibahira ya kondolu, langi ya buluu na zambalawu.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Zahabu yoseri yawamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya kunyawa Liringu Linanagala, iweriti na utopa wa kilu miya nani na malongu saba na saba na glamu miya ntatu kulawirana na vipimu vya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Madini ga feza gagajojonikituwi na wantu gaweriti na utopa wa kilu elufu ntatu na lilongu na saba na gilamu miya saba na malongu muhanu kulawirana na vipimu vya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Kila muntu yakawalangitwi kwanjira umuli wa vinja ishilini na yimu, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi ga madini ga feza glamu muhanu, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti laki sita na elufu tatu na miya muhanu na amsini. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Kilu elufu ntatu za madini ga feza zitenderituwi kunyawira vikaliru miya vya Liringu Linanagala na lipaziya lilii, kilu malongu matatu mukila shikaliru shimu. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Kilu zilii lilongu na saba na glamu malongu saba na muhanu yazisigaliti, zitenderituwi kunyawira vikwambikwambi vya mpanda na kuvityeremeka pavikoleru vya mpanda na kuinyawira vikoweru. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Madini ga shaba gagalaviwituwi na wantu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, gaweriti kilu elufu mbili na miya yimu na malongu mawili na msheshi. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Bezaleli kaitenderiti shaba ayi kunyawira vikaliru vya ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala na shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha shaba pamuhera na wavu wakuyi wa shaba na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri vya shitalawanda sha kutambikira, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />vikaliru vya mdamu vyavizyengekiti Liringu Linanagala na vikaliru lya ligomi lya mdamu na vigingi vyoseri vya Liringu Linanagala na vya mdamu.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Kunyawa nguwu za Watambika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Kulawa 28:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Kwa kutendera ubunta wa sufu ya buluwu na zambalawu na nsheri, womberi wasoniti nguwu za kulifana za kuvala shaka sha kutendera Pahala Pananagala. Bazaleli na Oholiabu wapotiti nguwu nanagala gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Womberi wanyawiti shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa kulawa muubunta gwa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri na kuilembeziya munguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Womberi waiponditi zahabu imonga gambira lishuka na walihanjiti kupata ubunta ubabani na kuupota nguwu mfufu iherepa na kuilembiziya kwa ubunta yaulawirana na mibahira ya kondolu, ubunta langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Wanyawiti ngoyi mbili za kutawalira mumakmbi za shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa, wazisoniti mukingu zakuwi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Ngoyi yaipotituwi weri panani pakuwi kutawalira, iweriti shimu shimu na nguwu ayi ya kugubika shifuwa, shinyawituwi kwa nguwu mfufu iherepa na kutuluwa zahabu na ubunta gwa mibahiraya kondolu na kulembiziwa kwa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Shakapanu watandiriti mabuwi ga beyi nkulu gagashemuwa saridoniki na kuvitula muvituliru vya zahabu, vyeni visongolituwi handa muntu ntambu yakasongola shimaniziru,matawu lilongu na mbili ga wana wa Israeli. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Su womberi wagatawaliriti mabuwi galii mumakombi mushipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa kuwera liholu kwa wana wa Israeli gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shihaku sha pashifuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Mafundi wanyawiti shihaku sha pashifuwa ntambu yawanyawiti nguwu ya kugubika shifuwa, wapotiti nguwu mfufu iherepa kwa zahabu na kuilembeziya kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Shihaku ashi upana na utali wakuyi uweriti teratera, sentimita malongu mawili na mbili kwa sentimita malongu mawili na mbili, shakapanu kuiviliga mala mbili. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Shihaku ashi shilembiziwituwi mumimstari ya msheshi ya mabuwi ga beyi nkulu, musitari kwa kwanja kuweriti na mabuwi gagashemuwa akiki na topazi na alumasi nsheri. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Musitari gwa pili kuweriti na mabuwi gagashemuwa zumaridi na johari ya langi ya samawati na alumasi. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />Musitari gwa tatu kuweriti na mabuwi ga yasintu na akiki nsheri na ametisu, goseri aga gatulituwi muvituliru vya zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />na musitari gwa msheshi kuweriti na mabuwi ga zabalajadi na shohamu na yasipi, goseri gatulituwi muvituliru vya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Su paweriti na mabuwi lilongu na mbili gagasongolituwi matawu lilongu na mbili ga wana wa Israeli. Mabuwi aga gaweriti gasongoluwa gambira shimaniziru ntambu yashisongoluwa, kila libuwi limu pamabuwi galii gasonguluwa litawu kugolokera makabila lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Washinyawiriti shihaku shilii sha pashifuwa mikufu ya zahabu iherepa. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Wanyawiti vituliru viwili vya zahabu iherepa na peti mbili za zahabu na kuzitula peti azi mukingu mbili za pampindi pa shihaku ashi. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Mikufu ayi miwili ya zahabu waitawiti mupeti zilii za shihaku sha pashifuwa <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />na kingu mbili za mikufu ya zahabu wazituliti muvituliru viwili pawazikolaniziya na vipandi viwili vya mumakombi vya shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa, uwega wa kulongolu. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Wanyawiti peti mbili za zahabu na wazituliti mukingu mbili za pasi uwega wa mkati mushihaku ashi sha pashifuwa pakwegera na shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Shakapanu peti zimonga mbili za zahabu na kuzitula palongolu mukingu pasi pa vipandi vya nguwu ya kugubika shiifuwa, pahala papalikonaziya na mkanda ulii yaupotituwi weri. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Watawiti shihaku sha pashifuwa mushipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa kushitawalila peti zakuwina shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa shilii kwa ngoyi langi ya buluu, su shihaku shilii nashiyopoka kumbiti shiweri mumkanda yaupotituwi weri gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Kanyawiti lihabiti lya kuvala mngati mwa shipandi sha nguwu sha kugubika shifuwa sha langi ya buluu. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Lihabiti ali liweriti na lupenyu lya kupitiziya mtuwi mukati, nalu lizyengeteruwa lwiniku lwalupotituwi su naidegeka. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Mulwiniku lwa pasi lwa lihabiti nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi, walembeziyiti malembumalembu ga makomamanga ga langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Shakapanu wanyawiti viyoyu vya zahabu na kila pa likomamanga watuliti viyoyu muluwiniku lwa lihabiti. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Hazi njuga na komamanga vilifwatitit kuizyengeta ukosi wa lihabiti hali, handa Mtuwa Mlungu ndambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Shakapanu wawanyawiriti Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi mashati ga nguwu mfufu iherepa, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />shilemba sha nguwu mfufu iherepa na kofia za nguwu mfufu iherepa na kaputula za nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />na lufunga lwa nguwu mfufu iherepa yaipotituwi kwa ubunta wa langi ya buluu na zambalawu na nsheri kuilembeziya gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Su womberi wanyawiti lilembiziwu lya zahabu iherepa kwajili ya lijenjeri linanagala na kulemba panani pakuwi gambira wasongola ntambu yawasongola shimaniziru, “Mnanagala kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Shakapanu walitawa palongolu pa shilemba shilii kwa ngoyi ya langi ya buluu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupera kwa lihengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Su lihengu lyoseri lya kunyawa Liringu Linanagala liperiti. Wantu wa Israeli wagatenditi goseri gambira Mtuwa mlungu ntambu yakamlagalliriti Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Womberi wamjegeriti Musa Liringu Linanagala pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri na vikonyu vyakuwi na fulemu zyakuwi na vikwambikwambi vyakuwi na vikaliru vyakuwi, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />shifuniku sha lukuli lya kondolu gwa shipalu yaitulituwi langi nsheri na yainyawituwi kwa mibahila ya mbuzi, wamjegiriti lipaziya lya Pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />Lisandiku lya lipatanu, mashera gakuyi na shiti sha kulekiziya, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />shatalawanda na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri, mabumunda yagatulitwi kulongolu kwa Mlungu, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />shintambi sha lumiliku lwa zahabu iyerepa, miliku zakuyi, vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri pamuhera na mapaki toziya ya miliku azi, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />vitalawanda vya zahabu, lipaki lya kutyelemeka, ubani una nunkira iherepa na lipaziya lya ligomi lya liringu linagagala, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />vitalawanda vya shaba na wavu wakuyi wa shaba, mashera gakuyi na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri, bakuli na birika na shikalira shakuyi, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />mapaziya ga ligeliri, mpanda na vikalira vyakuyi, lipaziya lya ligomi lya ligeleri, ngoyi zakuyi na vikukuwa vyakuyi, vyombu vyoseri vyawafiruwitwi muutenderu wa liringu linanagala, ndo liringu lya kuliwona, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />na nguwu zoseri yazifumitwi weri nakamu toziya ya utendera wa pahala pananagala, ndo nguwu nanagala za mtambika Aruni na za wana wakuyi toziya ya tendera za utambika. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Wantu wa Israeli watenditi lihengu lyoseri handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Musa kakaguriti kila shintu, kajimira handa watenditi kila shintu handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamugambiriti. Hangu Musa kawatekelera.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Kulinyawa Liringu Linanagala na kulityekuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa kwanja, gunyawi Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Muliringu ali hagutuli Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, shakapanu gutuli lipaziya palongolu pakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Hagwingiziyi shitalawanda Muliringu Linanagala, guvituli weri vintu mngati mwakuyi vyavigenda kutendwa pamuhera navi. Shakapanu hagwingiziyi shintambi na kushitula vikoluboyi vyakuwi pampindi pakuwi. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Gunyawi shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha zahabu kwajili ya kutumiziya ubani kulongolu kwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu na gutuli lipaziya palugomi lwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Gutuli shitalawanda sha kutambikira kulongolu kwingilira Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Hagulituli libeseni likulu lya kunawira mashi pakati pa Liringu Linanagala na shitalawanda sha kutambikira, na gulimemiziyi mashi. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Gutuli lipaziya kuzyengetilira mdamu goseri, viraa gulidyengiziyi lipaziya pahala pa kwingilira.”<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Shakapanu gutoli lipaki lya kutyekuwa na kulimishira Liringu Linanagala pamuhera na vintu vyakuwi vyoseri vyaviweramu, vituluwi toziya ya lihengu lyaneni, su haviweri vinanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Viraa gushityekuwi shitalawanda sha kutambikira tambiku za kulunguziya, pamuhera na vyombu vyakuwi vyoseri kwa kuvimishira lipaki. Su shitalawanda sha kutambikira hashiweri shinanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Viraa guswagi shiwiga sha kunawira mashi pamuhera na shikaliru shakuwi, gushituli gweka.”<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Shakapanu guwajegi Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, wizi paligomi lya kwingilira Muliringu Linanagala, guwanaviyi kwa mashi. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Hagumvalisiyi Aruni lihabiti linanagala lya utambika, gumswagi lipaki na kumtyekuwa, su kawezi kuntendera gambira mtambika. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Viraa guwajegi wana wakuyi wamonga. Guwavalisiyi mahabiti <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />na guwaswagi lipaki ntambu yagumswagiti tati gwawu, su womberi hawantenderi neni lihengu gambira watambika. Kwa kuswaga lipaki womberi pamuhera na viyiwuku vyawu, gwenga hagutendi womberi waweri watambika kupitira vileri vyoseri vyaviza.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Musa kavitenditi vintu vyoseri nakaka gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi wa kwanja mushinja sha pili pakulawa muisi ya Misri, Liringu Linanagala libawirituwi. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Gagafata gawera malagaliru ga Musa, womberi wanyawiti Liringu Linanagala na kalibawiriti weri, katuliti mpanda na kawalawaliti mibiki na kalutuliti lubiki lya kukolera lipaziya. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Shakapanu walitandiziyiti kulizyengetila Liringu Linanagala, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Su Musa kagatoliti mabuwi mawili gagasongolituwi, gagalembituwi malagaliru na kagatuliti Mulisanduku lya Lipatanu. Yomberi katuliti mipiku ya kupapira mupeti zyaviwera Mulisanduku lya Lipatanu, viraa kaligubikiti kwa mfuniku gwagushemuwa pahala pa kulekeziya vidoda. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Shakapanu lisanduku lilii kalitula mkati mwa Pahala Pananagala Muliringu Linanagala na kukowekiziya lipaziya. Kwa ntambu ayi, kadiwiriti wantu yawawera kunja kulilola lisandiku. Katenditi vyoseri avi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Womberi washituliti shitalawanda mkati mwa Liringu Linanagala, uwega wa kushana, kunja kwa lipaziya. <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />Pashitalawanda yomberi katuliti mabumunda gawamlaviyiti Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Watuliti shintambi sha vikoluboyi mkati mwa Liringu Linanagala, uwega wa kusika, pashilolana na shitalawanda. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Shakapanu kawasha vikoluboyi pashintambi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Watuliti shintalawanda sha kutambikira sha zahabu mkati mwa liringu linanagala, kulongolu kwa lipaziya lyalitula gweka Pahala Pananagala na Pahala Pananagala nentu <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />na kutumiziyiti ubani ununkira pampindi pakuwi, ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Walikoweka lipaziya kuligomi lwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Kulongolu kwa ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, watuliti shitalawanda sha kutambikira malaviwu ga tambiku galii gagalunguzituwi. Shakapanu kalaviyiti vinofu kulunguziwa pamuhera na malaviwu ga mbunji, katenditi ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Kalituliti libeseni likulu lya kunawira mashi pakati pa Liringu Linanagala na shitalawanda sha kutambikira sha shaba, kashimemiziyiti mashi. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Kila shaka Musa pamuhera na Aruni na wana wakuyi, wagululiti mawoku na magulu gawu. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Womberi wagululiti mawoku na magulu gawu kugapunga pawaingiriti Muliringu Linanagala ama kwiza pakwegera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira, ntambu Musa yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Kwa malagaliru gakapananituwi Musa pamuhera na wantu wakuyi, womberi wakowekiti lipaziya kuzyengeta mdamu na pahala pa kutambikira, viraa womberi wakoweka lipaziya kuligomi lwa kumdamu. Su Musa pamuhera na wantu wakuyi wamaliriti lihengu.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihundi ligubika Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Shakapanu lihundi ligubikira Liringu Linanagala na uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu umemiziya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Toziya uweru uweriti mkulu nentu, Musa kasinditi kwingira mkati mwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Kwanjira lishaka ali, wantu wa Israeli pawafiriti kugenda pahala pamonga, womberi wagenditi hera shaka lihundi lifufu palikweniti kulawa pampindi pa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Handa lihundi ali palilawira ndiri, womberi walikaliti pawaweriti na wanjiti ndiri mwanja mpaka lihundi palilawira. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Poseri pawagenditi, lihundi lifufu liii lilanguziya uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu uwera pampindi pa Liringu Linanagala mushaka sha paluwala, motu guweriti mulihundi mushaka sha pashiru, malawiranu gakuyi wantu woseri wa Israeli waweziti kuliwona lihundi mushaka shoseri.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>